'use strict';
// Shattered Worlds - The Hollow Crown, chapters 1-4 in Simplified Chinese (the user, 2026-11-20): the lines of every hero's
// Part 1 as rewritten on 2026-11-20 (js/saga/lines-sky/land/deep.js), where js/saga/lang-zh.js still had the older
// English. English -> Simplified Chinese, exact-string lookup (js/i18n.js). Loaded by js/saga/saga-lang.js after lang-zh.js.
// If an English line changes, change its key here too, or that line falls back to English.
SW.i18n.add("zh", {
 "Med-Lab Sector 7. In tank thirty-one a girl has hummed into the same hairline crack for a week, and she is the only one who sees the grey shapes walk the halls.":"7区医疗实验室。三十一号缸里，一个女孩对着同一道发丝般的裂缝哼了一个星期的歌；整座楼里，只有她看得见那些灰色的身影在走廊里走动。",
 "Fight your way out of the Med-Lab":"杀出医疗实验室",
 "Med-Lab Sector 7. Tank thirty-one has a crack in it, thin as a hair. For a week the girl inside has hummed into it.":"7区医疗实验室。三十一号缸上有一道裂缝，细如发丝。一个星期以来，缸里的女孩一直对着它哼歌。",
 "Nyra. Born where the harbour freezes. Halcyon wrote thirty-one on my glass. Numbers don't sing.":"妮拉。生在港湾结冰的地方。哈尔西恩在我的玻璃上写了个三十一。数字不会唱歌。",
 "There it is again. A grey shape behind the doctor's shoulder, patient as a coat on a hook. Nobody else ever looks at it.":"又来了。医生肩后站着一个灰色的身影，耐心得像挂在钩上的一件外套。从来没有别人看它一眼。",
 "Thirty-one is vocalising. Sedate her before the glass-":"三十一号在发声。给她镇静，趁玻璃还没——",
 "Hold the note. Hold it. ...Now break.":"稳住这个音。稳住。……现在，碎吧。",
 "The grey shapes in the halls were people once. Halcyon drank them down through its feed lines and left the outline standing.":"走廊里那些灰色的身影，曾经都是人。哈尔西恩顺着进料线把他们吸干，只留下一个轮廓站在原地。",
 "Husks, the charts call them, in neat little columns. There's a column ready for me. I'm not filling it.":"图表上管它们叫空壳，排成整整齐齐的小栏。有一栏是给我留的。我才不去填。",
 "Cryo Vault 9 is three floors down. Isolde's in there, and she's going to tell me I was loud. And flat.":"9号冷冻库在下面三层。伊索德在里面，她肯定要说我太吵。还跑调。",
 "Cryo Vault 9, where Isolde taught Nyra to keep her voice low and her blade cold. Tonight Halcyon's boots are on the stairs, and Maren is already counting Nyra's pulse.":"9号冷冻库，伊索德曾在这里教妮拉压低声音、让刀锋保持冰冷。今夜，哈尔西恩的靴子已经踏上楼梯，而玛伦已经在数妮拉的脉搏了。",
 "You sang a tank open, Nyra. The whole ward heard. So did Halcyon.":"你用歌声震开了一口缸，妮拉。整个病区都听见了。哈尔西恩也听见了。",
 "And yet the tank is open. Say well done. It won't kill you.":"可缸还是开了。说声“干得好”。又不会要你的命。",
 "A falcon that screams at every mouse goes hungry. Low voice, cold blade. Then the door.":"见了老鼠就尖叫的猎鹰只会饿肚子。声音要低，刀要冷。然后再去开门。",
 "Low. Cold. Noted. Are you coming out of that glass, or do I sing it open too?":"低。冷。记住了。你是自己从那块玻璃里出来，还是也要我唱开？",
 "Gently. I hate glass. ...No. Too late for gently. Listen: boots on the stairs.":"轻一点。我讨厌玻璃。……不。来不及轻了。听：楼梯上有靴子声。",
 "Then it's tonight. I'll be behind you both with the needle. Nyra, your pulse is already halfway down the corridor.":"那就是今晚了。我拿着针跟在你们俩后面。妮拉，你的脉搏已经跑到走廊半截去了。",
 "Sit. Your heart is skipping like a stone on water. Breathe with me. In. Out. ...Better. Now go, both of you.":"坐下。你的心跳得像水面上打的水漂。跟着我呼吸。吸气。呼气。……好些了。现在走吧，你们俩都走。",
 "Come with us, Maren. Please.":"跟我们一起走吧，玛伦。求你了。",
 "Somebody has to sit with the ones who can't run yet. Come back for them. That's my fee.":"总得有人守着那些还跑不动的人。回来接他们。这就是我的报酬。",
 "Every bed in this ward. I'll come back for all of them. Hold me to it.":"这个病区的每一张床。我会回来把他们全都接走。你给我记着。",
 "Aurelia's screens loop a boy from the Crusher Yard, lightning in his fists, gassing Halcyon's labs. At the Crater, Nyra finds him in the flesh, and the face won't sit right on him.":"奥蕾莉亚的屏幕循环播放着一个来自粉碎场的男孩：拳握闪电，用毒气熏哈尔西恩的实验室。在陨坑，妮拉见到了他本人，而那张脸怎么也对不上眼前这个人。",
 "White hair, lightning in your fists. I've watched you on every screen up there, opening the Sump's vents onto our labs.":"白头发，拳头里攥着闪电。我在上面的每块屏幕上都看过你，打开污水坑的通风口，冲着我们的实验室。",
 "Opened what? I've never been near your labs, Sky girl. Down here the screens have YOU walking Halcyon's drills into our tunnels.":"打开什么？我连你们实验室的边都没挨过，天空城的丫头。我们下面的屏幕上，倒是你领着哈尔西恩的钻机进了我们的隧道。",
 "I spent a year in a tank and a week on the run. I've never met a tunnel I didn't want out of.":"我在缸里待了一年，又逃了一个星期。我见过的隧道，没有一条不想赶紧钻出去的。",
 "Funny. That's exactly how a Halcyon plant would put it.":"有意思。哈尔西恩的卧底就会这么说。",
 "And that's exactly how one would answer. Fine. Let's hear what you sound like with your fists.":"卧底也会这么回答。行。让我听听你的拳头是什么声音。",
 "And you don't fight like someone who gasses labs. You fight like you grew up on a scrap heap.":"你打起来也不像个会放毒气熏实验室的人。倒像个在废料堆上长大的。",
 "Crusher Yard. Finest heap in Deepline. Whoever opened those vents, it wasn't me. Ask anyone below.":"粉碎场。深线最好的废料堆。不管是谁开的那些通风口，都不是我。下面随便问谁。",
 "Then the boy on the screens isn't the boy in front of me. So who lent a stranger your face? And who lent one mine?":"那屏幕上的男孩就不是我面前这个。那是谁把你的脸借给了一个陌生人？又是谁借走了我的？",
 "I didn't. Again.":"我没出卖你们。再来。",
 "Tonight two forged films have every layer ready to kill the others, and one of them wears Nyra's face. She brings the numbered up into the light.":"今夜，两段伪造的影片让每一层都准备向另外两层下杀手，其中一段顶着妮拉的脸。她把那些被编了号的人带上来，带到光里。",
 "Clear the Noble Ring for the Subjects":"为实验体们清空贵族环区",
 "The Three-Layer War. Every screen in the Sky plays one film: Kael, a white-haired Deepline kid, opening the Core Sump's vents on the labs.":"三层之战。天空城的每块屏幕都在播同一段影片：凯尔，一个白发的深线孩子，打开核心污水坑的通风口，灌向实验室。",
 "Down in Deepline the screens play another: Subject 31 leading Halcyon's drills into the tunnels. Each layer swears the other struck first.":"深线的屏幕播的是另一段：31号实验体领着哈尔西恩的钻机进了隧道。每一层都发誓是对方先动的手。",
 "I've never led a drill anywhere in my life. Someone is wearing my face. And his.":"我这辈子从没领过什么钻机。有人顶着我的脸。也顶着他的。",
 "Then show them the real one. The Proving Hall has orders to march on Deepline, and the wards are open. Bring everyone up.":"那就让他们看看真的那个。试炼大厅接到命令要向深线进军，病区的门开着。把所有人都带上来。",
 "Everyone Halcyon ever numbered: up the stairs, onto the Ring, now. Stay low, stay close, and sing if you've got a voice left.":"所有被哈尔西恩编过号的人：上楼，到环区上去，现在。压低身子，靠紧点，嗓子还有声的就唱。",
 "The Hall never marched. Aldric turned his knights around, and Coda cut her strings mid-opera and danced Pell's secrets onto every wall.":"大厅终究没有出兵。奥德瑞让他的骑士们掉转了方向，寇妲在歌剧中途剪断了自己的提线，把佩尔的秘密舞上了每一面墙。",
 "Below, the Lantern Cell catches Pell in his own strings at the Pit. On the Surface, Oda's bell rings three times over the Buried Meridian.":"下方，灯笼小队在深坑用佩尔自己的线把他缠住。地表上，奥达的钟在被掩埋的子午线上空敲了三下。",
 "The Crater. Kael and Nyra face each other, each sure the other is Halcyon's. Kiri's paper crane drops between them with Pell's word: Rue.":"陨坑。凯尔和妮拉对峙，都认定对方是哈尔西恩的人。基里的纸鹤落在两人之间，带来佩尔说出的那个名字：露。",
 "A second Kael in the crowd. The real one turns, and the copy runs: a face with nothing behind it. It wore mine too. Sorry, Kael.":"人群里还有第二个凯尔。真的那个一转身，冒牌货就跑了：一张背后空无一物的脸。它也顶过我的脸。对不起，凯尔。",
 "Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire, Hollis's new one beside the three of the Pact. Nyra hears the Engine Core's hum change pitch, like a call.":"四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，霍利斯新画的那面挨着盟约的三面。妮拉听见引擎核心的嗡鸣变了调，像一声呼唤。",
 "Cryo Vault 9 keeps Halcyon's Subjects colder than any winter. The eldest of them does not mind the cold. Tonight she has run out of patience with the glass.":"9号冷冻库把哈尔西恩的实验体冻得比任何冬天都冷。其中最年长的那位并不在意寒冷。今夜，她对玻璃的耐心耗尽了。",
 "Fight your way out of Cryo Vault 9":"杀出9号冷冻库",
 "Cryo Vault 9. Frost on the inside of the glass, and a falcon of ice asleep on one woman's wrist.":"9号冷冻库。霜结在玻璃内侧，一只冰之猎鹰睡在一个女人的手腕上。",
 "Isolde. I kept the white falcons of the eyrie over the Frozen Harbour. The tear took the eyrie, the harbour, and every bird but one.":"伊索德。我曾在冰封港湾上的鹰巢照看白隼。裂隙夺走了鹰巢，夺走了港湾，夺走了所有的鸟，只剩一只。",
 "She is made of ice now, like everything in this place. I never minded the cold. I mind the glass.":"如今她是冰做的，和这里的一切一样。我从不在意寒冷。我在意的是玻璃。",
 "Subject 52, step back from the door. Sedation in ten. Nine. Eight.":"52号实验体，离开门口。十秒后镇静。九。八。",
 "Ten was generous. The hood comes off, and she needs three.":"数到十已是宽厚。鹰罩一摘，她只需要三。",
 "No more glass. Up, little one. Show me the halls.":"不要再有玻璃了。起来，小家伙。带我看看这些走廊。",
 "And the knight at the end of the corridor. I know that stance. My falcons sat on his gate for twenty winters.":"还有走廊尽头那位骑士。我认得那站姿。我的猎鹰在他的城门上栖了二十个冬天。",
 "For a year the captain of her harbour's sea wall has guarded Isolde's door without once looking through it. Tonight Halcyon comes to take her below the Spire, and she makes him look.":"一年来，她家乡港湾海堤的队长一直守着伊索德的门，却从没往里看过一眼。今夜，哈尔西恩要把她带到尖塔底下，而她要让他看。",
 "Hold Cryo Vault 9 beside Aldric":"与奥德瑞死守9号冷冻库",
 "Subject 52. Return to your vault. I take no pleasure in this, but I will do it.":"52号实验体。回你的冷冻库去。我不以此为乐，但我会照做。",
 "Captain of the harbour wall. Every morning you stood under my eyrie and threw your crusts to my falcons.":"港湾城墙的队长。每天早上，你都站在我的鹰巢下，把你的面包皮丢给我的猎鹰。",
 "The white birds on the gate. You are the falconer. You are from home.":"城门上的白鸟。你是那位驯鹰人。你是从家乡来的。",
 "You have guarded my door for a year, Captain, and not once looked through it.":"你守了我的门一年，队长，却一次都没往里看过。",
 "I was told the Subjects behind these doors were protected. That was the wall I kept.":"我被告知，这些门后的实验体都受到保护。那就是我守的墙。",
 "Stand aside, sir. Subject 52 is reassigned to the feed lines. Director's order.":"让开，长官。52号实验体已被调往进料线。总监的命令。",
 "The Director's word is that she is protected. Until that word is proven false, no one passes my wall.":"总监的原话是，她受到保护。在这句话被证明是假的之前，谁也别想越过我的墙。",
 "Reassigned. Below the Spire. Falconer, what waits in the feed lines?":"调走。调到尖塔底下。驯鹰人，进料线那里等着的是什么？",
 "Go and look, Captain. There is a woman on the Night Ward with a red scarf. She will show you the way down.":"你自己去看，队长。夜间病房有个系红围巾的女人。她会给你指下去的路。",
 "Then I will look. And until I have, no hand touches you.":"那我就去看。在我看清之前，谁也别想碰你。",
 "A good wall. My falcons always did like you.":"一堵好墙。我的猎鹰一向都喜欢你。",
 "Brann, the last bear of north Vharra, says winter answers to him, and he has invited Isolde north to tell him otherwise. At the Ice House, they settle whose winter it is.":"布兰，北瓦拉最后的熊，说寒冬听命于他，还邀伊索德北上，来跟他争个明白。在冰窖，两人要分出这究竟是谁的冬天。",
 "Duel Brann at the Ice House":"在冰窖与布兰决斗",
 "Hn. Bird-woman. Came north at last.":"哼。鸟女人。终于北上了。",
 "You invited me. I came quietly. You are the one who shouts.":"是你邀我来的。我来得悄无声息。大喊大叫的是你。",
 "Vharra's winters had bears. I am the last. Winter answers to me.":"瓦拉的冬天里有熊。我是最后一头。寒冬听我的。",
 "Winter answers to no one. It listens, though, to whoever is quietest. Shall we learn which of us that is?":"寒冬谁也不听。不过，它会倾听最安静的那一个。我们来看看那是谁，如何？",
 "Frost in my beard. Bird on my head. Hn. Fine. It listens to you.":"胡子结霜。头上站鸟。哼。行。它听你的。",
 "It listens to us both. You need only stop shouting at it.":"它听我们俩的。你只要别再冲它吼就行。",
 "Come north again. Bring the bird. Drink first. Argue after.":"再来北边。带上鸟。先喝酒。后吵架。",
 "Warm your hands, bird-woman. Then lose properly.":"暖暖手吧，鸟女人。然后好好输一场。",
 "Two forged films have turned the three layers on one another, and the Proving Hall is ordered down to Deepline. Isolde's falcon carries one word to every ward: rise.":"两段伪造的影片让三层反目成仇，试炼大厅奉命下到深线。伊索德的猎鹰把一个字带到每一个病区：起。",
 "Hold the Ring while the wards rise":"守住环区，等病区起义",
 "The Three-Layer War. Sky screens loop Kael, a Deepline kid, opening the Sump's vents on the labs; Deepline's loop Nyra leading drills. Each blames the other.":"三层之战。天空城的屏幕循环播放深线孩子凯尔打开污水坑的通风口、灌向实验室；深线的屏幕循环播放妮拉领着钻机。双方都怪对方。",
 "Deepline has struck the Sky! The Proving Hall marches on the Skylift at once. All Subjects confined to wards!":"深线袭击了天空城！试炼大厅立刻向天梯进军。所有实验体禁足病区！",
 "My falcon watched that film and never stirred. She stirs for anything with a pulse. That is not a boy.":"我的猎鹰看着那段影片，纹丝不动。凡是有脉搏的东西，她都会动一下。那不是一个少年。",
 "And that's not me on theirs, before you ask. The wards are ready, Isolde. They're waiting on your bird.":"他们那边那个也不是我，省得你问。病区都准备好了，伊索德。就等你的鸟了。",
 "Then she flies. Every ward, every window: rise. And you lead them out, Nyra. I will not do it for you.":"那她就飞。每个病区，每扇窗：起。你带他们出去，妮拉。这事我不替你做。",
 "The wards rose to the bird. Aldric turned the Hall's swords outward, and Coda danced Pell's secrets out under the opera lights.":"病区随着鹰起来了。奥德瑞让大厅的剑锋朝外，寇妲在歌剧院的灯光下把佩尔的秘密舞了出来。",
 "Pell falls in his own strings at the Pit. Oda's bell calls the Surface to the Meridian. Kiri's crane flies Pell's word to the Crater: Rue.":"佩尔在深坑栽在自己的线里。奥达的钟声把地表召到子午线。基里的纸鹤把佩尔说出的名字送到陨坑：露。",
 "There Kael and Nyra stand face to face. A second Kael in the crowd bolts the moment the real one turns. A mask, and no one inside it.":"凯尔和妮拉在那里面对面站着。人群里的第二个凯尔，在真的那个转身的一瞬间拔腿就跑。一张面具，里面空无一人。",
 "Halcyon sold each layer a mask and called it a war. Four banners climb the Spire now, the Engine Core at the top. We go before it finishes calling.":"哈尔西恩卖给每一层一张面具，管它叫战争。如今四面旗帜正攀上尖塔，引擎核心就在顶上。趁它还没呼唤完，我们走。",
 "The tear drops Gale to the very bottom of Deepline's Vent Stacks. He lands, counts his limbs, and starts looking for two things: the way up, and his little sister.":"裂隙把盖尔丢到了深线排风塔的最底层。他落了地，数了数自己的四肢，开始找两样东西：往上的路，和他的小妹妹。",
 "Fight your way up Vent Stack Four":"杀上四号排风塔",
 "Vharra, festival day. A kite climbs into a violet sky that should not be there. The string snaps. The girl goes up. The boy goes down.":"瓦拉，节庆之日。一只风筝爬进一片本不该存在的紫色天空。线断了。女孩往上去。男孩往下坠。",
 "Vent Stack Four, a thousand metres under Aurelia. Hot air, old soot, and a dent in the grating shaped exactly like a young man.":"四号排风塔，奥蕾莉亚下方一千米。热风，陈年煤灰，还有格栅上一个凹坑，形状恰好是个年轻男人。",
 "Ow. Okay. Arms, legs, hair. Hair's fine. Gale, ridge-runner of Vharra, all present. Sora went up. So up is where I'm going.":"哎哟。好吧。胳膊，腿，头发。头发没事。盖尔，瓦拉的山脊跑者，全员到齐。索拉往上去了。那我也往上。",
 "Torn-through in Stack Four, reading off the scale. Containment, bring the net. The big net.":"四号塔有穿裂者，读数爆表。收容组，拿网来。大网。",
 "You brought a net. For the wind. That's sweet. Somebody believed in you this morning.":"你们带了张网。来网风。真贴心。今天早上肯定有人对你们寄予厚望。",
 "Feel that on your neck? Warm air, climbing. This whole stack breathes, and it breathes up.":"脖子上感觉到了吗？热风，往上爬。这整座塔都在呼吸，而且是往上呼。",
 "Hang on, Sora. Your big brother's on his way, and he's had a long fall to work on his lecture.":"撑住，索拉。你哥哥这就来了，他摔了老长一段，正好把训你的话打好了腹稿。",
 "High on the Skylift, the boy who fell finds the sister who flew. She has a paper-folding partner, a satchel of letters Halcyon would rather burn, and no wish at all to be watched.":"天梯高处，坠落的男孩找到了飞走的妹妹。她有个一起折纸的搭档，一挎包哈尔西恩宁可烧掉的信，而且压根不想被人盯着。",
 "GALE?! You fell! I watched you fall the whole way down!":"盖尔？！你摔下去了！我眼睁睁看着你一路摔到底的！",
 "Down one stack, back up the same stack on the warm air. Your towers all look alike, by the way. Took me ages.":"顺着一座塔摔下去，再借着热风顺着同一座塔飞上来。顺便说一句，你们这儿的塔长得都一样。害我找了半天。",
 "You're alive. You're actually alive. ...And you're about to start hovering. I can feel it starting.":"你还活着。你真的还活着。……而且你马上就要开始在我头顶盘旋了。我感觉得到，已经开始了。",
 "Like a cloud with a grudge. Every day. Who's the girl with the paper bird? Does she pay?":"像一朵记仇的云。天天如此。那个拿纸鸟的姑娘是谁？她给钱吗？",
 "Kiri, from the steppe like you. We fly the letters Halcyon wants unsent. Pay's in bread. Can you fly, or only fall?":"基里，跟你一样来自草原。我们飞送哈尔西恩不想让人寄出的信。报酬是面包。你会飞，还是只会摔？",
 "Falling's just flying with bad timing. Deal me in. Bread's fine. Jam would be better.":"摔，不过是时机没掐好的飞。算我一个。面包就行。有果酱更好。",
 "Three unlicensed flyers on the cables. Bring them down. Mind the cars.":"缆索上有三个无证飞行者。把他们打下来。小心缆车。",
 "Three flyers and every tower in Aurelia. That's not a delivery round any more. That's a post. The Paper Post.":"三个飞手，外加奥蕾莉亚的每一座塔。这已经不是跑趟腿送个信了。这是一家邮驿。纸鹤邮驿。",
 "Fine. He's in. But he does NOT tail me on my runs.":"行吧。他算一个。但我送信的时候，他不许跟着我。",
 "Not tail. Escort. Totally different. Mine comes with a breeze on the back of your neck, free of charge.":"不是跟着。是护送。完全两码事。我这份还附赠一阵吹在你后脖颈上的小风，免费。",
 "Eleven races, eleven arguments, no agreed score. Tarn, runner of the Surface post, picks a windless dawn at Mile Zero for race twelve, and this time nobody is running.":"十一场比赛，十一场争吵，比分从没谈拢过。地表信使塔恩为第十二场挑了零英里一个无风的黎明，这一次，谁也不跑了。",
 "Beat Tarn at Mile Zero: race twelve":"在零英里击败塔恩：第十二场",
 "Race twelve, flyboy. Mile Zero to the Crater rim, dead calm. I checked the sky twice. Not a breath.":"第十二场，飞行小子。零英里到陨坑边缘，一丝风都没有。我把天看了两遍。一口气都没有。",
 "No wind? Tarn. The wind is the only reason I go anywhere fast. Otherwise I'd walk, like a person.":"没风？塔恩。风是我跑得快的唯一理由。不然我就走路了，像个正常人一样。",
 "I've run every road from here to the rim on these two feet. That's running. You're a kite with legs.":"从这儿到坑沿的每条路，我都是用这两只脚跑过来的。那才叫跑。你就是只长了腿的风筝。",
 "Eleven arguments and zero agreed scores. Skip the road. First one flat on the sand loses.":"十一场争吵，零个谈拢的比分。路就别跑了。谁先趴在沙地上谁输。",
 "Deal. And this counts as twelve. I'm writing it on my arm.":"成交。这场算第十二场。我写在胳膊上了。",
 "Fine. FINE. You're fast. You're still cheating. There was a breeze. I felt it on my ear.":"行。行！你快。可你还是作弊。刚才有风。我耳朵感觉到了。",
 "That was me breathing hard. Twelve to me. Write it on the other arm.":"那是我在喘粗气。第十二场归我。写在另一条胳膊上吧。",
 "Thirteen. Next month. The long road. And bring your own legs.":"第十三场。下个月。长路。带上你自己的腿。",
 "Legs beat weather, flyboy. Go stand in the corner and think about that.":"腿胜过天气，飞行小子。去墙角站着，好好想想。",
 "Aurelia's screens say Deepline struck first, and the Proving Hall is lacing its boots to march. Gale has one night to fly the uprising's plan to every ward before they go.":"奥蕾莉亚的屏幕说深线先动的手，试炼大厅正系紧靴带准备进军。盖尔只有一夜时间，要赶在他们出发前，把起义的计划飞送到每一个病区。",
 "Clear the drones off the ward route":"清除病区路线上的无人机",
 "The Siege of the Noble Ring starts with a film on every screen: Kael, a white-haired Deepline kid, wrenching the Sump's vents open on the labs.":"贵族环区之围，始于每块屏幕上的一段影片：凯尔，一个白发的深线孩子，猛地扳开污水坑的通风口，灌向实验室。",
 "Down below they're watching another one: Nyra, the singer who broke out of the Med-Lab, leading Halcyon's drills into the tunnels.":"下面他们看的是另一段：妮拉，那个从医疗实验室逃出来的歌手，领着哈尔西恩的钻机进了隧道。",
 "That same hour I took a letter from Nyra's own hand, up here. Someone is borrowing faces, and each layer swears the other struck first.":"可就在同一个钟头，我在这上面从妮拉本人手里接过一封信。有人在借别人的脸，而每一层都发誓是对方先动的手。",
 "And the Proving Hall's lacing up to march on Deepline. A lie has to walk. We fly. Every ward gets the plan before the first boot hits a stair.":"试炼大厅还在系鞋带，准备进军深线。谎言得用腿走。我们用飞的。第一只靴子踩上楼梯之前，每个病区都要拿到计划。",
 "Me? Follow? ...Only a little. Only the dangerous bits.":"我？跟着？……就跟一点点。只跟危险的部分。",
 "Every ward had the plan, every ward rose on cue, and the Hall stopped dead on its own stairs. Not bad for a boy who fell down a chimney.":"每个病区都拿到了计划，每个病区都按时起义，大厅在自己的楼梯上停得死死的。对一个从烟囱里掉下来的男孩来说，还不赖。",
 "Far below, Oda's bell tolls three times over the Meridian drills. In the Pit, Pell hangs tangled in his own Cat's Cradle, and gives up a name.":"在遥远的下方，奥达的钟在子午线的钻机上空敲了三下。深坑里，佩尔被自己的翻花绳缠得动弹不得，供出了一个名字。",
 "Kiri flies it to the Crater, where Kael and Nyra stand fists up, each sure the other is Halcyon's. The name is Rue. A second Kael bolts from the crowd.":"基里把它飞送到陨坑，凯尔和妮拉正举着拳头对峙，都认定对方是哈尔西恩的人。那名字是露。人群里，第二个凯尔拔腿就跑。",
 "A borrowed face, a borrowed war. Hollis has painted a fourth banner, and four of them go up the Spire from four sides. Engine Core at the top.":"借来的脸，借来的战争。霍利斯画了第四面旗，四面旗从四个方向攀上尖塔。引擎核心就在顶上。",
 "Whatever that Engine's been whistling up, we switch it off before it comes. I'll take the windy side. Somebody is paying me for this, right?":"不管那引擎一直在吹口哨召唤什么，我们都要赶在它来之前把它关掉。我负责有风的那边。有人付我钱的吧，对吧？",
 "The Proving Hall, where the Director's champions are made. In a year its finest knight has not given a single step, and he still guards a sea wall that no longer exists.":"试炼大厅，总监的勇士们在此锻造成形。一年来，大厅最出色的骑士没有让过一步，他至今仍守着一道早已不存在的海堤。",
 "The Proving Hall. Sand on the floor, banners on the walls, a gallery of guests with wine. Subject 12 stands in the centre, as he has every night for a year.":"试炼大厅。地上铺沙，墙上挂旗，看台上坐满端着葡萄酒的宾客。12号实验体站在中央，一年来夜夜如此。",
 "I am Aldric, once captain of the harbour wall. The wall is gone. The oath is not: I stand between harm and the people.":"我是奥德瑞，曾是港湾城墙的队长。墙已不在。誓言还在：我立于伤害与人民之间。",
 "Trial forty, Twelve. My guests have come a long way to see what a wall is. Do show them.":"第四十场试炼，十二号。我的客人远道而来，就是想看看墙是什么样子。务必让他们见识一下。",
 "Flawless. The Subjects sleep soundly because men like you stand at their doors.":"完美无瑕。实验体们能睡得安稳，正是因为有你这样的人守在他们门口。",
 "The guests applaud. Yet every night the carts go down from the wards full, and every morning they come back up empty.":"宾客们鼓掌。可每天夜里，推车满载着从病区下去；每天早上，又空着回来。",
 "I have held a wall on one man's word for a year. It is time I weighed the word.":"一年来，我凭一个人的一句话守着一道墙。是时候掂量掂量这句话了。",
 "Aldric asked one question too many about the carts. Vesper, the Night Ward's lamplighter, answers it: she leads him below the Spire to the Engine's feed lines, and makes him look.":"奥德瑞问推车的事，多问了一句。夜间病房的点灯人韦斯帕给了他答案：她领他下到尖塔底下引擎的进料线，让他亲眼去看。",
 "Hold the feed lines beside Vesper":"与韦斯帕死守进料线",
 "Seventy-seven, of the Night Ward. ...The red scarf. You lit the lamps along my sea wall, at home.":"七十七号，夜间病房的。……红围巾。在家乡，是你点亮了我海堤上的灯。",
 "Every dusk. You never turned round. Look down.":"每个黄昏。你从没回过头。往下看。",
 "Grey shapes along the pipes. Breathing. Those are Subjects. Those are the people I was set to guard.":"管道边一个个灰色的身影。还在呼吸。那些是实验体。那些是我奉命守护的人。",
 "Husks. What the Engine leaves. That is what your Director's word was worth.":"空壳。引擎吃剩下的。这就是你那位总监的话值几个钱。",
 "Intruders on the feed lines! ...Sir? Sir, step away from the asset.":"进料线有入侵者！……长官？长官，请离开那件资产。",
 "I swore an oath to keep harm from them. For a year I have stood on harm's side of the door.":"我发过誓，不让伤害近他们的身。可这一年来，我一直站在门的伤害那一边。",
 "Halcyon sends its finest knight to the Skyport to break a wall from the Surface. Aldric goes, because he has long wished to see Tor hold a line.":"哈尔西恩派出最出色的骑士前往天港，去击破一道来自地表的墙。奥德瑞去了，因为他早就想看看托尔是怎么守住一条线的。",
 "Duel Tor at the Skyport":"在天港与托尔决斗",
 "Knight. I'm Tor. Nothing has passed me.":"骑士。我是托尔。没有东西从我这儿过去过。",
 "No one passes my wall either. Halcyon sent me to break you. I came to see a wall worthy of the name.":"也没有人越过我的墙。哈尔西恩派我来击破你。我来，是想见识一道名副其实的墙。",
 "Plant your feet. One of us moves.":"站稳脚。我们总有一个要挪步。",
 "You hit like a gate shutting. I'm standing. Further back.":"你打起来像城门关上。我还站着。只是退远了些。",
 "Two walls, and neither truly gave. At home we would have stood shoulder to shoulder on the same stones.":"两道墙，谁都没有真正退让。在家乡，我们本该肩并肩站在同一排石头上。",
 "When your Hall turns, knight, the gate turns with it.":"等你的大厅倒戈，骑士，城门也会跟着倒戈。",
 "Nothing passes. Not even you. Up.":"什么都过不去。你也不行。起来。",
 "Two stolen faces have set the three layers at each other's throats, and the Director orders the Proving Hall down to Deepline. Aldric has seen the feed lines. He turns his knights around.":"两张被盗的脸让三层彼此扼住了喉咙，总监命令试炼大厅下到深线。奥德瑞见过进料线。他让他的骑士们掉转了方向。",
 "Hold the Noble Ring with your knights":"率骑士守住贵族环区",
 "The Three-Layer War. Sky screens show Kael, a Deepline street kid, opening the Sump's vents on the labs. Deepline's show Nyra leading the drills down.":"三层之战。天空城的屏幕上，深线街头小子凯尔打开污水坑的通风口，灌向实验室。深线的屏幕上，妮拉领着钻机往下钻。",
 "Deepline has struck first, as we always knew it would. The Hall marches tonight, Twelve. Lead them down.":"深线先动手了，正如我们一直预料的那样。大厅今晚出兵，十二号。带他们下去。",
 "I know that boy's face from your screens, Director. I also know your feed lines. One of the two is a lie, and I know which.":"那男孩的脸，我在你的屏幕上见过，总监。你的进料线，我也见过。两者之中有一个是谎言，我知道是哪一个。",
 "Knights of the Hall! Our oath was to the people, never to one man. Turn around. Harm is at our backs.":"大厅的骑士们！我们的誓言是向人民立的，从来不是向某一个人。转过身来。伤害就在我们背后。",
 "The Hall has turned, the wards rise, and Coda has cut her strings on the opera stage. My oath to the Director is broken. The older one stands.":"大厅已经倒戈，病区正在起义，寇妲在歌剧舞台上剪断了自己的提线。我对总监的誓言破了。更古老的那一个还在。",
 "Oda's bell rings three times over the Buried Meridian. In the Pit, Pell is caught in his own strings and names the face-thief: Rue.":"奥达的钟在被掩埋的子午线上空敲了三下。深坑里，佩尔被自己的线缠住，说出了窃脸者的名字：露。",
 "At the Crater a second Kael runs from the real one. Each layer was blaming the other for a puppet show. Four banners start up the Spire.":"在陨坑，第二个凯尔从真的那个面前逃走。每一层都在为一场木偶戏责怪另一层。四面旗帜开始攀上尖塔。",
 "Captain. They have cut the pylons to drop the city. Chamber Six, on your way up: I can reroute them by hand. Hold that door.":"队长。他们切断了塔柱，要让城市坠落。六号塔柱室，就在你上去的路上：我可以亲手为塔柱改道。守住那扇门。",
 "No one came through. The city fell one floor, and caught. Now, the Engine Core, before whatever it calls can answer.":"无人通过。城市下坠一层，接住了。现在，去引擎核心，趁它召唤的东西还没来得及回应。",
 "For six weeks the Burn Ward has run on one girl from the Frozen Harbour, the way a stove runs on coal. It is week seven, and the glass has started to tick.":"六个星期以来，烧伤病房全靠一个来自冰封港湾的女孩运转，就像炉子靠煤。现在是第七周，玻璃开始嘀嗒作响了。",
 "The Burn Ward. Pipes sweat, gauges creep into the red, and in the middle of it all a girl in a glass bottle drums her fingers.":"烧伤病房。管道冒汗，仪表指针慢慢爬进红区，而在这一切的正中央，玻璃瓶里的一个女孩正用手指敲着节拍。",
 "Pyra. At home there was a blue forge that never went out. Here there's a bottle, and guess who gets to be the coal.":"派拉。家乡有一座从不熄灭的蓝色熔炉。这儿只有一个瓶子，猜猜谁来当煤。",
 "Week seven, Subject 44. I asked them to stop the second colour. They said no. So I am to watch, and write it down.":"第七周，44号实验体。我请他们停掉第二种颜色。他们说不行。所以我只能看着，并把它记下来。",
 "Aw, notes. Sweet. Want to write down what happens next? Listen. That ticking is the glass.":"哎呀，记笔记。真可爱。想把接下来发生的事也记下来吗？听。那嘀嗒声，是玻璃。",
 "I burned down the Burn Ward. Honestly, somebody should have read the name on the door.":"我把烧伤病房烧了。说真的，早该有人看看门上写的是什么。",
 "Down the hall there's an ice girl with frost in her hair who swears she can walk. She can't. Up you get, Nyra. It's warm where we're going.":"走廊那头有个头发结霜的冰女孩，发誓说她能走。她不能。起来吧，妮拉。我们要去的地方很暖和。",
 "Pyra's fire carries Nyra out and keeps on going, down the vents, to the Sump. Something chained in the dark burns back.":"派拉的火把妮拉带了出来，然后继续往前烧，顺着通风口一路烧到污水坑。黑暗中，有个被锁着的东西以火回应。",
 "Hold the Core Sump with Ashka":"与阿什卡死守核心污水坑",
 "The Core Sump, at the very bottom of Deepline. Pyra's fire pours down the vents, and in the dark, something burns back.":"核心污水坑，深线的最底层。派拉的火顺着通风口倾泻而下，而在黑暗里，有什么东西烧了回来。",
 "Who's pouring fire down my vents. ...You. You burn like home.":"谁在往我的通风口里倒火。……是你。你烧起来像家乡。",
 "Pyra. Subject 44, formerly. I carried a girl out through my own fire tonight, and the fire didn't stop. It came looking for you.":"派拉。44号实验体，以前是。今晚我背着一个女孩穿过自己的火逃了出来，火却没停。它是来找你的。",
 "Ashka. Sixty. Half of Deepline sleeps warm because I'm chained down here. A year now.":"阿什卡。六十号。深线有一半人睡得暖和，是因为我被锁在这下面。一年了。",
 "I tried to melt those chains just now. Nothing. I hate that more than I hate Halcyon, and I really, really hate Halcyon.":"我刚才试着熔掉那些锁链。没用。我恨这个比恨哈尔西恩还多，而我真的、真的很恨哈尔西恩。",
 "Nothing melts them. I fight fine inside them. Boots on the stairs. Halcyon's coming down.":"什么都熔不掉它们。我戴着锁链也打得很好。楼梯上有靴子声。哈尔西恩下来了。",
 "Then that's what we are. I'll come back with something that breaks chains, sister. Count on it.":"那我们就是了。我会带着能弄断锁链的东西回来，姐妹。你等着。",
 "Two girls, one phoenix, eleven fights and no agreement on the score. Kestra calls fight twelve in the undercroft, the hottest room under the gold.":"两个女孩，一只凤凰，十一场架，比分谁也不服。凯斯特拉把第十二场约在城底暗层，黄金之下最热的房间。",
 "Win fight twelve against Kestra":"赢下与凯斯特拉的第十二场",
 "There she is. Strolls out of the Burn Ward wrapped in a phoenix like she owns it.":"她来了。裹着一只凤凰从烧伤病房溜达出来，好像那是她的东西似的。",
 "It came out of my fire, feathers, so I kind of do. Eleven fights. I'm ahead, by the way.":"它是从我的火里出来的，小羽毛，所以某种程度上还真是。十一场了。顺便说一句，我领先。",
 "You are NOT. My clan has danced the phoenix under this city for a hundred years. Fight twelve. Here, on our beams.":"你才没有！我们氏族在这座城底下跳凤凰舞跳了一百年。第十二场。就在这儿，在我们的梁上。",
 "Ooh, your beams. Hope they're fireproof, honey.":"哟，你们的梁。希望它们防火哦，亲爱的。",
 "And while you share it, both of you, kindly stop setting fire to the beams.":"还有，你们俩分着用它的时候，劳驾别再烧那些梁了。",
 "Two forged films have every layer blaming the others, and Halcyon slams the Noble Ring's gates to march its knights down to Deepline. Pyra is very good at gates.":"两段伪造的影片让每一层都在怪罪另外两层，哈尔西恩砰地关上贵族环区的大门，要让骑士们开赴深线。派拉最擅长对付大门了。",
 "Burn down the gates of the Noble Ring":"烧毁贵族环区的大门",
 "The Three-Layer War. Sky screens loop Kael, a Deepline kid, opening the Sump's vents on the labs. Deepline's loop Nyra leading Halcyon's drills.":"三层之战。天空城的屏幕循环播放深线孩子凯尔打开污水坑的通风口、灌向实验室。深线的屏幕循环播放妮拉领着哈尔西恩的钻机。",
 "Nyra was on my back the week she's meant to be down there. And Ashka watched that boy from her chains. Never sweated. In the Sump. Even rocks sweat.":"她本该在下面的那个星期，妮拉一直趴在我背上。阿什卡也从她的锁链里看过那男孩。一滴汗都没出。在污水坑里。连石头都会出汗。",
 "Gates. Adorable. Everybody stand back, this is the part I'm good at.":"大门。真可爱。大家都退后，这是我最拿手的部分。",
 "No more gates. Aldric's knights come out facing the right way for once, and Coda's dancing Pell's dirty secrets onto the walls.":"大门没了。奥德瑞的骑士们难得朝着正确的方向冲出来，寇妲正把佩尔的脏秘密舞上墙。",
 "Oda's bell rings three times over the Buried Meridian. In the Pit, Pell is caught in his own strings, and the Sump breaks open: Ashka walks out.":"奥达的钟在被掩埋的子午线上空敲了三下。深坑里，佩尔被自己的线缠住，污水坑被打开：阿什卡走了出来。",
 "Kiri's crane carries Pell's word to the Crater: Rue. A second Kael in the crowd runs. Four banners start up the Spire toward the Engine Core.":"基里的纸鹤把佩尔说出的名字送到陨坑：露。人群里的第二个凯尔逃了。四面旗帜开始攀上尖塔，直指引擎核心。",
 "My sister's out, and somebody lit this war with a borrowed face. Up the Spire, then, before that Engine finishes shouting for whatever it wants.":"我姐妹出来了，而有人用一张借来的脸点燃了这场战争。那就上尖塔吧，趁那引擎还没喊完它想要的东西。",
 "Halcyon's best marksman has not missed in a year of shooting. Today the mark is a skiff under a patched sail, and it is full of people.":"哈尔西恩最好的射手一年来箭无虚发。今天的靶子是一艘挂着补丁帆的小艇，艇上满是人。",
 "Hold the Firing Gallery for the skiff":"为小艇守住射击廊",
 "The Firing Gallery. A long white room open to the wind, and a mark a mile out over the clouds. Subject 57 has never missed.":"射击廊。一间朝风敞开的白色长厅，靶子在一英里外的云层之上。57号实验体从未失手。",
 "Yara. I lit the lamp on the sea wall so the ships could find their way in. Halcyon says this is the same job.":"雅拉。我曾在海堤上点灯，好让船只找到回港的路。哈尔西恩说，这是同一份差事。",
 "Target at one mile, bearing for the Skylift. Wind three knots west. Fire, 57.":"目标一英里，航向天梯。西风三节。放箭，57。",
 "That's no ship. Those are people hanging off a rag of sail. Runaways from the wards.":"那不是船。那是挂在一块破帆上的人。从病区逃出来的人。",
 "Escaped Subjects. Fire, 57, or take their place on the feed lines.":"逃跑的实验体。放箭，57，否则就去进料线顶替他们。",
 "A lamp brings people home. It doesn't knock them out of the sky. Turn around, gentlemen. I've found a nearer target.":"灯是把人引回家的。不是把人从天上打下来的。转过身去，先生们。我找到了一个更近的靶子。",
 "How many of my mile-out marks were never ships at all? I'll count them. Every one. Later.":"我那些一英里外的靶子，有多少根本就不是船？我会数清楚的。每一个。以后再数。",
 "The runaways ride the Skylift down to the Surface, and Halcyon's recovery team rides down after them. At Mile Zero, Jax holds the Long Bar's door.":"逃亡者乘天梯下到地表，哈尔西恩的回收小队也乘天梯追了下去。在零英里，杰克斯守着长吧台的门。",
 "Hold the Long Bar with Jax":"与杰克斯守住长吧台",
 "Mile Zero, the Long Bar. Dust on the windows, cold water on the counter, a skiff's worth of runaways under the tables.":"零英里，长吧台。窗上积着灰，柜台上摆着凉水，桌子底下躲着一小艇的逃亡者。",
 "Easy with that bow, Aurelia. You're the one who wouldn't shoot. Whole skiff's been drinkin' to your name.":"那张弓悠着点，奥蕾莉亚人。你就是那个不肯放箭的。整条小艇的人都在为你的名字干杯呢。",
 "Jax. Nobody belongs to anybody in my bar, partner. I'll take the near ones. You take anything past ten paces.":"杰克斯。在我的酒吧里，谁也不归谁，伙计。近的归我。十步以外的归你。",
 "Past ten paces is everything worth an arrow.":"十步以外，才是一切值得放一箭的东西。",
 "Then we argue later. Company's here.":"那咱们回头再吵。客人到了。",
 "Fine shooting, at a mile. Up close you'd have died twice, and I'd have had to mop it up.":"一英里外射得真漂亮。可要是近身，你已经死了两回了，我还得拖地。",
 "Nobody buys the round. Suits me. Go on home, Yara. Your runaways sleep safe under my roof.":"这轮酒谁也不用请。正合我意。回家吧，雅拉。你那些逃亡者在我屋檐下睡得安稳。",
 "Bow against spear: the bet has run for two years. On the Rust Flats, with no caravan to guard, Hart finally charges.":"弓对矛：这赌约已经悬了两年。在锈蚀平原，没有商队要护送，哈特终于冲锋了。",
 "Duel Hart on the Rust Flats":"在锈蚀平原与哈特决斗",
 "Two years, Yara. Bow against spear. Open ground, no wagons, no cover. Rules are rules.":"两年了，雅拉。弓对矛。开阔地，没有车队，没有掩体。规矩就是规矩。",
 "Then charge. Every yard you close costs you an arrow. Count them as you come.":"那就冲吧。你每逼近一码，就要挨一箭。边冲边数。",
 "Never got close. Not once. Fine. The bow reaches further.":"一次都没近身。一次都没有。行。弓够得更远。",
 "Settled, spear-boy. You owe me a drink. Jax owes me two.":"了结了，矛小子。你欠我一杯酒。杰克斯欠我两杯。",
 "Two forged films have turned the three layers on each other, and Halcyon has put a gun on every balcony around the Ring. Yara takes the long shot: the whole length of it.":"两段伪造的影片让三层反目，哈尔西恩在环区四周的每一座阳台上都架了枪。雅拉要打一记远射：从头射到尾。",
 "Clear the gunners off the Noble Ring":"清除贵族环区上的枪手",
 "The Three-Layer War. Sky screens loop Kael opening the Sump's vents on the labs; Deepline's runners swear Nyra led the drills in. Each blames the other.":"三层之战。天空城的屏幕循环播放凯尔打开污水坑的通风口、灌向实验室；深线的信使发誓是妮拉领着钻机进来的。双方都怪对方。",
 "I watched that film through my scope. The boy at the vents never blinks. Forty seconds. Nothing alive goes forty seconds.":"我用瞄准镜看了那段影片。通风口边的那个男孩从不眨眼。四十秒。没有活物能撑四十秒不眨眼。",
 "Gunners to the balconies. The Proving Hall marches. Anyone on the Ring without a badge is a target.":"枪手上阳台。试炼大厅出兵。环区上没戴徽章的都是靶子。",
 "Guns on every balcony, end to end, in one straight line. Careless. One breath, one arrow. The lamp is lit.":"每座阳台都有枪，从头到尾，排成一条直线。太大意了。一口气，一支箭。灯点亮了。",
 "One arrow, drawn for a whole breath, runs the length of the Noble Ring. Every Halcyon gun along it goes quiet.":"一支箭，拉满了整整一口气，贯穿贵族环区的全长。沿途哈尔西恩的每一杆枪都哑了。",
 "Clear. The wards can cross, and Aldric's knights hold the stairs facing out. Word from the Pit: Pell named the face. Rue.":"清干净了。病区的人可以过去了，奥德瑞的骑士们守着楼梯，面朝外。深坑传来消息：佩尔说出了那张脸。露。",
 "At the Crater a second Kael runs from the real one. Oda's bell has called the Surface; Deepline has the Pit. Four banners climb the Spire.":"在陨坑，第二个凯尔从真的那个面前逃走。奥达的钟召集了地表；深线拿下了深坑。四面旗帜攀上尖塔。",
 "Engine Core at the top, and it's been signalling something a long while. We get there before anything signals back.":"引擎核心就在顶上，它向什么东西发信号已经很久了。我们得赶在有东西回信之前到那儿。",
 "A herder's daughter from the steppe wakes in the Paper Shrine under Deepline, twice over, among a thousand paper wishes left for the dead. She has paper, nerve, and one way to go: up.":"一个来自草原的牧人之女，在深线底下的纸之神社里醒来，一醒就是两个，身边是上千张留给亡者的纸心愿。她有纸，有胆量，只有一条路可走：往上。",
 "Fight your way out of the Paper Shrine":"杀出纸之神社",
 "The Paper Shrine, deep under Deepline. Folded wishes for the dead hang from the ceiling on threads, turning in the draught.":"纸之神社，深线的深处。给亡者折的心愿用线悬在天花板上，在穿堂风里打着转。",
 "This is not the steppe. The steppe has sky. Okay: Kiri, herder's daughter, Vharra. Still two of me? ...Yes. Hello, me.":"这不是草原。草原有天空。好吧：基里，牧人的女儿，瓦拉人。还是两个我吗？……是的。你好呀，我。",
 "Sorry, wishes. I'm going to fold you into something with wings and take you somewhere with sky. All of you. Promise.":"对不起了，心愿们。我要把你们折成有翅膀的东西，带你们去有天空的地方。你们所有人。我保证。",
 "Torn-through in the shrine, two signatures. Bag her before she's properly awake.":"神社里有穿裂者，两个信号。趁她没完全醒，把她装袋。",
 "Too late! We're BOTH awake! And we're both annoyed!":"太迟啦！我们俩都醒了！而且我们俩都很火大！",
 "One crane, wide enough for two Kiris and every wish in the shrine. Hold on tight, everyone. We're going up the Stacks.":"一只纸鹤，宽得足够载两个基里和神社里的每一个心愿。大家抓紧了。我们要飞上排风塔。",
 "The first Deepliner ever to reach Aurelia without a ticket lands on a golden roof, under a snowfall of paper.":"有史以来第一个没买票就抵达奥蕾莉亚的深线人，在一片纸雪中降落在一座金色的屋顶上。",
 "The Paper Post carries a letter Halcyon wants unsent down to the Deepline Slums. The boy who signs for it is Rook of the Lantern Cell, all eight of him.":"纸鹤邮驿把一封哈尔西恩不想让人寄出的信送下深线贫民窟。签收的男孩是灯笼小队的鲁克，八个他全到了。",
 "The Deepline Slums. Laundry lines, cook smoke, and a crowd of boys wearing the same grin. It is one boy.":"深线贫民窟。晾衣绳，炊烟，还有一群咧着同样笑脸的男孩。那是同一个男孩。",
 "Paper girl! Kiri, right? Letter for us? Wait. Which one of you do we sign for?":"纸女孩！基里对吧？有我们的信？等等。我们该给你们哪一个签收？",
 "Either. Both. Same girl, twice. Sora flies the high letters, I fold the rest and run them low. Sign here, here, and... there.":"哪个都行。两个都行。同一个女孩，两份。索拉飞高处的信，剩下的我来折，低空跑。在这儿签，这儿，还有……那儿。",
 "Same! I mean, I'm the same guy, like eight times. Everybody else says it's weird.":"一样！我是说，我也是同一个人，大概八份吧。别人都说这很怪。",
 "It's not weird. It's efficient. ...Also, every Halcyon collector in the Slums is standing right behind you.":"一点都不怪。这叫效率。……还有，贫民窟里所有的哈尔西恩回收员都站在你背后。",
 "Great! There's more of us than them!":"太好了！我们比他们人多！",
 "You fold, we clone, nobody gets lonely. Come back any time, paper girl.":"你折纸，我们分身，谁都不孤单。随时再来，纸女孩。",
 "The Post delivers to everyone. Even boys who are mostly reprints.":"纸鹤邮驿谁都送。连基本上是翻印版的男孩也送。",
 "...Mostly reprints. Sorry. That was her.":"……基本上是翻印版。对不起。那句是她说的。",
 "Something comes to the Paper Shrine in Kiri's face, then someone else's, then nobody's. Rue, Pell's spy, can copy anyone she meets. She has never met anyone who is two people.":"有个东西来到纸之神社，先是顶着基里的脸，然后是别人的，然后谁的都不是。露，佩尔的间谍，能复制她遇到的任何人。可她从没遇到过一个人是两个人。",
 "Duel Rue in the Paper Shrine":"在纸之神社与露决斗",
 "The Paper Shrine. Among the wishes stands a girl in a white smiling mask. She is wearing Kiri's face. Then she isn't.":"纸之神社。心愿之间站着一个戴白色笑脸面具的女孩。她顶着基里的脸。然后又不是了。",
 "Both. Either. Same girl, two times. ...You said that in the Slums. It sounded better in your mouth. Why?":"两个都行。哪个都行。同一个女孩，两份。……你在贫民窟说过这句。从你嘴里说出来更好听。为什么？",
 "You followed me? Ugh. You're doing my voice, and you're doing it wrong. Who sent you?":"你跟踪我？呃。你在学我的声音，还学错了。谁派你来的？",
 "Pell says, copy someone once and you do them better than they do. Pell is never wrong. But I keep getting lost in you.":"佩尔说，把一个人复制一次，你就能比本人更像本人。佩尔从来不会错。可我总是在你身上迷路。",
 "There are two of you. I can only be one thing at a time. Hold still and be one girl.":"你们有两个。我一次只能当一样东西。别动，当一个女孩就好。",
 "Not a chance. You took my face without asking, and the Post doesn't deliver to thieves. Both of us! Fold her up!":"想都别想。你没问一声就拿了我的脸，邮驿不给小偷送信。我们俩一起上！把她折起来！",
 "Stop... moving. I can't hold your shape. Which of you is the real one?":"别……动了。我抓不住你的形状。你们哪个才是真的？",
 "Both. That's the one thing you can't copy. Neither of us is pretending.":"两个都是。这正是你复制不了的东西。我们谁都没在假装。",
 "Rue's mask slips. For one heartbeat there is nothing under it at all. Then she is gone, and the wishes drift slowly back down.":"露的面具滑落。有一个心跳的工夫，面具底下什么也没有。然后她不见了，心愿们缓缓飘落回来。",
 "There. Three Kiris now. And the best one is me.":"好了。现在有三个基里了。最好的那个是我。",
 "Aurelia's screens say Deepline struck first; Deepline's say the Sky did. Kiri knows the trick behind both; she has met it before. Tonight a thousand cranes tell the Ring the truth.":"奥蕾莉亚的屏幕说深线先动的手；深线的屏幕说是天空城。基里知道这两边背后的把戏；她以前就遇到过。今夜，上千只纸鹤要把真相告诉环区。",
 "Fly the cranes past the Ring's guards":"让纸鹤飞过环区的守卫",
 "The night of the Siege of the Noble Ring. On every gold balcony a screen plays Kael, Deepline's white-haired street kid, gassing the labs from the Sump.":"贵族环区之围的那一夜。每座金色阳台上都有一块屏幕在播凯尔，深线那个白发街头小子，从污水坑放毒气熏实验室。",
 "Rook sent word up: down there they're shown Nyra, the singer from the Med-Lab, leading Halcyon's drills in. Each side blames the other.":"鲁克从下面捎来消息：他们那儿播的是妮拉，医疗实验室那个歌手，领着哈尔西恩的钻机进来。两边都在怪对方。",
 "I know this trick. I fought it in the shrine: something with no face, wearing whoever it likes. Same empty smile under both.":"我认得这把戏。我在神社跟它交过手：一个没有脸的东西，想穿谁就穿谁。两段影片底下都是同一副空洞的笑。",
 "Then tell the whole Ring. Pell's secrets are stitched into my ribbons, and tonight I cut them loose. Fold them. Fly them.":"那就告诉整个环区。佩尔的秘密就缝在我的丝带里，今夜我把它们剪开。折起来。飞出去。",
 "A thousand cranes, one secret each, one for every door on the Ring. The Proving Hall can read too. Go, go, GO!":"一千只纸鹤，每只一个秘密，环区上每扇门一只。试炼大厅也识字。去吧，去吧，快去！",
 "A thousand cranes land on a thousand doorsteps. The Ring reads who pays Halcyon, and for what. The Proving Hall halts on its own stairs.":"一千只纸鹤落在一千个门前。环区读到了是谁在给哈尔西恩钱，又是为了什么。试炼大厅在自己的楼梯上停了下来。",
 "A letter rides up the Skylift from the Pit. The Lantern Cell has Pell in his own Cat's Cradle, and Pell has named the face: Rue.":"一封信从深坑乘天梯送了上来。灯笼小队用佩尔自己的翻花绳把他缠住，佩尔说出了那张脸：露。",
 "Kiri flies it to the Crater herself. Kael and Nyra stand ready to tear each other apart, and a second Kael watches from the crowd.":"基里亲自把它飞送到陨坑。凯尔和妮拉正准备把对方撕成碎片，而人群里，第二个凯尔在看着。",
 "RUE! It's Rue! Kael, behind you! ...And there it goes. Running away with your face on.":"露！是露！凯尔，你背后！……它跑了。顶着你的脸跑了。",
 "From the Surface comes word of Oda's bell, three tolls over the Meridian drills. Hollis paints a fourth banner, and four start up the Spire.":"地表传来奥达钟声的消息，在子午线的钻机上空敲了三下。霍利斯画了第四面旗，四面旗开始攀上尖塔。",
 "Folded, flown, delivered. Next stop: the Engine Core, before the thing it keeps calling hears back. The Post carries for all four banners.":"折好，飞出，送达。下一站：引擎核心，趁它一直在呼唤的东西还没回音。邮驿为四面旗帜都送信。",
 "Under the nobles' feet, where the pylons run hot, the Sky Clan has danced fire for generations. Tonight a Halcyon sweep comes down looking for the heat.":"在贵族脚下，塔柱烧得滚烫的地方，天空氏族世世代代在此舞火。今夜，哈尔西恩的一支清扫队下来寻找热源。",
 "Drive Halcyon's sweep off the Decks":"把哈尔西恩的清扫队赶出甲板",
 "The Ballast Decks, the hot dark under the gold. The pylons hum like a held note. Somewhere in the dark, a fan snaps open.":"压舱甲板，黄金之下炽热的黑暗。塔柱嗡鸣，像一个拖长的音。黑暗中某处，一把扇子啪地展开。",
 "Kestra of the Sky Clan. We've danced fire down here for a hundred years, under the nobles' slippers, and not one of them has ever looked down.":"天空氏族的凯斯特拉。我们在这下面跳了一百年的火之舞，就在贵族的拖鞋底下，他们没有一个人往下看过一眼。",
 "Heat bloom on ballast deck three. Unregistered combustion. Sweep it and log it.":"三号压舱甲板出现热源扩散。未登记的燃烧。清扫并记录。",
 "Combustion? How rude. It's a dance. ...Fine. Now it's both.":"燃烧？真没礼貌。那是舞蹈。……行吧。现在两样都是了。",
 "Sweep finished. Theirs, I mean. Fire first, then the fan to make it worse. They never learn the second part.":"清扫完毕。我是说，他们被清扫完了。先点火，再扇风，烧得更凶。他们永远学不会第二步。",
 "Someone upstairs will smell the scorch, of course. And Lin is going to give me the look. She's probably giving it to the wall already.":"当然，楼上肯定有人会闻到焦味。琳又要给我那种眼神了。她这会儿大概已经在冲墙使那眼神了。",
 "Kestra has scorched three of the beams the whole city stands on. Lin arrives with the look, and close behind it comes a Halcyon captain with a full sweep.":"凯斯特拉烧焦了整座城赖以立足的三根梁。琳带着那种眼神来了，紧随其后的，是一名带着整支清扫队的哈尔西恩队长。",
 "Hold the Ballast Decks with Lin":"与琳死守压舱甲板",
 "Kestra. Three beams scorched. The city sits on those.":"凯斯特拉。三根梁烧焦了。整座城就坐在它们上面。",
 "And here it is. The look. I can feel it on the back of my neck.":"来了。那种眼神。我后脖颈都能感觉到。",
 "It's in front of you. Behind it is Halcyon: a full sweep, with a captain this time.":"它在你前面。它后面是哈尔西恩：一整支清扫队，这次还带了个队长。",
 "Then they get the whole dance. You keep the beams cool. I keep the fire on them, and only on them. Mostly.":"那他们就看全套舞蹈。你让梁保持凉快。我让火只烧他们，只烧他们。大部分时候。",
 "Every fifth strike. Breathe, sister. Fire goes where your breath goes.":"每五下一次。呼吸，姐妹。气到哪里，火就到哪里。",
 "Not one beam caught. Not one! How do you DO that?":"一根梁都没着！一根都没有！你到底是怎么做到的？",
 "I watch the fire. You watch the enemy. Neither of us watches the score.":"我看火。你看敌人。我们俩谁都不看比分。",
 "I always watch the score. Speaking of which: they say the Burn Ward has a new phoenix. Wearing MY bird.":"我一向看比分。说到这个：听说烧伤病房出了只新凤凰。披着我的鸟。",
 "Fight twelve of the phoenix question. Pyra, who burned the Burn Ward down on her way out of it, strolls into the Ballast Decks wearing the bird Kestra's family has danced for a century.":"凤凰之争第十二场。派拉，那个出逃时顺手烧了烧伤病房的女孩，披着凯斯特拉家族跳了一个世纪的那只鸟，溜达进了压舱甲板。",
 "Duel Pyra in the Ballast Decks":"在压舱甲板与派拉决斗",
 "Kestra! Fight twelve, feathers. And you picked the hottest room in the city. For me? You shouldn't have.":"凯斯特拉！第十二场，小羽毛。你还挑了城里最热的房间。为了我？太客气了吧。",
 "My family danced the phoenix in this dark before your lab was even built. Then you walk out of a burning lab wearing one. Like a hat.":"你的实验室还没建起来，我家族就在这片黑暗里跳凤凰舞了。然后你从一间着火的实验室里走出来，身上就披了一只。跟戴帽子似的。",
 "It came out of MY fire, so it's mine. And it's eleven fights, and I'm ahead. Everybody knows that.":"它是从我的火里出来的，所以是我的。而且是十一场，我领先。大家都知道。",
 "Nobody knows. Nobody agrees. Tonight they will. Mind the beams.":"没人知道。没人同意。今晚就知道了。小心那些梁。",
 "Ooh, the beams. Bo-ring. I'll mind them after.":"哟，又是梁。无——聊。我打完再小心。",
 "Fine. Twelve's yours. ...That dive, though. That was something.":"行。第十二场归你。……不过刚才那一下俯冲。真有你的。",
 "A century of practice. The phoenix is ours. ...Though I suppose a phoenix could spare a second tail.":"一个世纪的练习。凤凰是我们的。……不过，我想一只凤凰也匀得出第二条尾巴。",
 "Two tails. One undercroft. No burning beams. I am asking you both, nicely, once.":"两条尾巴。一个城底暗层。不许烧梁。我好好地求你们俩，只求一次。",
 "Sit down, feather duster. Thirteen's whenever you want it. Bring a bucket.":"坐下吧，鸡毛掸子。第十三场随你挑时候。带个水桶来。",
 "The screens say Deepline struck first, and Halcyon's knights will march down to make it pay, right over the Sky Clan's roof. Kestra decides the Clan has hidden long enough.":"屏幕上说深线先动的手，哈尔西恩的骑士们要开下去讨债，正好从天空氏族的屋顶上踏过。凯斯特拉认定，氏族已经藏得够久了。",
 "Raise the Clan and hold the Ring":"唤起氏族，守住环区",
 "The night of the Siege. Above the undercroft the Noble Ring is shouting at its screens: Kael, a white-haired Deepline boy, throwing the Sump's vents open.":"围城之夜。在城底暗层之上，贵族环区正冲着屏幕叫嚷：凯尔，一个白发的深线男孩，把污水坑的通风口一把掀开。",
 "Look at the fire on that feed. It bends round him as if he isn't there. Fire doesn't go round people, Lin. It goes through them.":"看看那段画面里的火。它绕着他弯过去，好像他根本不在那儿。火不会绕开人，琳。火会穿过人。",
 "Below, they are shown Nyra, the singer from the Med-Lab, leading the drills in. Each layer is certain the other struck first.":"下面给他们看的是妮拉，医疗实验室那个歌手，领着钻机进来。每一层都确信是对方先动的手。",
 "And the Proving Hall is ordered down to Deepline tonight. Its road runs over our heads.":"而试炼大厅今晚奉命下到深线。它的路就从我们头顶上过。",
 "Over our roof, you mean. Sky Clan! A hundred years beneath their floor. Tonight we come up through it.":"你是说，从我们的屋顶上过。天空氏族！我们在他们的地板下待了一百年。今晚，我们从地板里冲上去。",
 "The Ring's marble floor cracks open, and the Sky Clan rises out of the undercroft on wings of fire. The nobles finally look down.":"环区的大理石地板裂开，天空氏族乘着火焰之翼从城底暗层升起。贵族们终于往下看了。",
 "Their faces! Worth every year we waited. Even the Proving Hall stopped dead on the stairs. Nobody marches into a phoenix.":"瞧他们的脸！等了这么多年都值了。连试炼大厅都在楼梯上愣住了。没人敢朝一只凤凰行军。",
 "Oda's bell has rung three times over the Meridian. In the Pit, Pell is caught in his own strings. He named his spy: Rue.":"奥达的钟在子午线上空敲了三下。深坑里，佩尔被自己的线缠住。他说出了他的间谍：露。",
 "Kiri's crane flies the name to the Crater. A second Kael runs from the crowd. Hollis paints a fourth banner, for the Hidden Clans.":"基里的纸鹤把这个名字飞送到陨坑。人群里的第二个凯尔逃了。霍利斯画了第四面旗，为隐秘氏族。",
 "Our banner, in daylight, at last. Four of them, up four sides of the Spire to the Engine Core. Whatever it's been calling, it doesn't get an answer.":"我们的旗帜，终于见了天日。四面旗，从尖塔的四面一路攀上引擎核心。不管它一直在呼唤什么，都别想得到回应。",
 "A kite the size of a sail rides between Aurelia's towers. The girl hanging under it carries letters Halcyon wants unsent, and she has not touched ground since the sky tore.":"一只船帆大小的风筝在奥蕾莉亚的塔楼间穿行。吊在它下面的女孩，送的是哈尔西恩不想让人寄出的信；自从天空裂开，她的脚就再没沾过地。",
 "Beat the drones over the Skyport":"击退天港上空的无人机",
 "The Skyport. Between the gold towers rides a kite as big as a sail, and under it, by one hand, hangs a grinning girl with a satchel.":"天港。金色塔楼之间飘着一只船帆那么大的风筝，风筝下面，一个挎着邮包的女孩单手吊着，咧嘴笑着。",
 "Sora, of the kite clans of Vharra! Letters to anyone, anywhere, for a loaf of bread. Halcyon hates it. That's the best part.":"我是索拉，瓦拉风筝氏族的！一块面包，就能把信送给任何人，送到任何地方。哈尔西恩恨死这个了。这才是最妙的地方。",
 "When the sky tore I went up and my brother went down. I haven't set foot on anything since. Haven't missed it.":"天裂开那天，我往上飞，哥哥往下坠。从那以后，我的脚就没踩过任何东西。也没想过。",
 "Unlicensed flyer over the Skyport. Interceptors, bring her to ground.":"天港上空有无照飞行者。拦截机，把她逼降到地面。",
 "Ground? What's that? Is it nice? Does it have a view?":"地面？那是什么？好玩吗？风景好不好？",
 "Every letter delivered, every drone in the harbour, and my boots still clean.":"信全送到了，无人机全掉进了港湾，我的靴子还干干净净。",
 "Gale's down there somewhere. He fell. ...He's fine. He's always fine. I'll find him from up here, where I can see everything.":"盖尔就在下面某个地方。他掉下去了。……他没事。他向来没事。我会在这上面找到他，这儿什么都看得见。",
 "Sora watched her brother fall out of the sky. Today, on the Skylift cables, he rides a hot updraft back up, already looking at her like she is made of glass.":"索拉亲眼看着哥哥从天上坠落。今天，在天梯的缆索上，他乘着一股热上升气流回来了，看她的眼神已经像在看一件玻璃做的东西。",
 "That's... no. No, no, no. GALE?! You fell! I saw you go!":"那是……不。不不不。盖尔？！你掉下去了！我亲眼看见的！",
 "Down a stack, up the same stack on the warm air. Took a while. Your towers are all gold, Sora. Very confusing.":"顺着一根烟囱掉下去，又乘着热气从同一根烟囱上来。花了点时间。你这些塔楼全是金的，索拉。很容易认错。",
 "You're here. You're really here. ...And you're going to hover. Your eyebrows are hovering already.":"你在这儿。你真的在这儿。……然后你又要在我头顶盘旋了。你的眉毛已经开始盘旋了。",
 "Hovering is how I say I love you. Who's your paper friend? Is she paying you? Is she paying me?":"盘旋就是我说“我爱你”的方式。你那个纸做的朋友是谁？她付你钱吗？她付我钱吗？",
 "Kiri. I fold, your sister flies. We get paid in bread. Also, the cables are crawling with Halcyon, so: hugs later.":"基里。我折纸，你妹妹飞。报酬是面包。另外，缆索上爬满了哈尔西恩的人，所以：拥抱待会儿再说。",
 "Three flyers, every tower in the city. That's not a round any more. It's a post. Call it the Paper Post.":"三个飞行者，全城每一座塔。这就不只是跑一趟腿了，这是一家邮驿。就叫它纸鹤邮驿吧。",
 "And I come on every run. Every single one.":"而且每一趟我都要跟着。每、一、趟。",
 "You do NOT. ...Some runs. The boring ones. Stop smiling like that.":"你才不要！……几趟吧。无聊的那几趟。别那样笑。",
 "Bando of Dockside Nine tells anyone who stands still that he once saved Sora's kite. Sora flies down to correct the record, and won't set one foot on his dock to do it.":"九号码头的班多逢人便说，他救过索拉的风筝。索拉飞下来要更正这段历史，却连一只脚也不肯踏上他的码头。",
 "Beat Bando on Dockside Nine":"在九号码头击败班多",
 "Dockside Nine, the last wharf before the Drowned Line. A kite comes down the Skylift shaft and hangs over the cranes, very cross.":"九号码头，溺亡线前的最后一座码头。一只风筝顺着天梯竖井降下来，悬在吊车上空，气鼓鼓的。",
 "SORA! Everybody, look, it's her! The kite girl! The one I saved!":"索拉！大家快看，是她！风筝丫头！就是我救的那个！",
 "You did NOT save me. You grabbed my kite out of a tree. On festival day. While I stood right underneath it.":"你才没救我！你只是从树上够下了我的风筝。在节庆那天。而我就站在树底下。",
 "Big tree, little girl, kite stuck up top. Then whoosh: one arm, clear across the field. Eleven arm's lengths, easy. That's a rescue.":"大树，小丫头，风筝卡在树顶。然后嗖的一下：一条胳膊，横跨整片空地。十一臂长，轻轻松松。这就叫救援。",
 "I wasn't crying. I was shouting at the tree. New story for you: kite girl beats long arm, and never lands on your dock.":"我没哭。我是在冲那棵树喊。给你讲个新故事：风筝丫头打败长胳膊，而且从头到尾没落在你的码头上。",
 "Ha! Come down here and say that.":"哈！有本事下来说。",
 "Not one toe on the boards. Not one! All right, all right. Kite girl wins.":"一根脚趾都没沾木板。一根都没有！好吧好吧。风筝丫头赢了。",
 "Now the other part. Loud. So the whole dock hears.":"还有另一半。大声点。让整个码头都听见。",
 "I didn't save you. ...I sort of did, though. A little bit. About a thumb's length.":"我没救你。……不过也算救了一点。就一点点。大概一拇指那么长。",
 "A thumb's length. Fine. You can tell THAT one.":"一拇指长。行。那个版本你可以讲。",
 "Reach beats string! That's twice I've saved you now, kite girl!":"手长胜过线长！这是我第二次救你了，风筝丫头！",
 "Halcyon's screens say a Deepline boy struck the Sky first, and the Proving Hall is ready to march. Coda is about to dance out the truth, and someone has to fly it to every tower.":"哈尔西恩的屏幕上说，是一个深线少年先袭击了天空，试炼大厅已整装待发。寇妲即将把真相跳出来，总得有人把它送到每一座塔。",
 "Clear the sky for Coda's ribbons":"为寇妲的丝带清出天空",
 "Dusk, the night of the Siege. From up high every screen in Aurelia glows with one film: Kael, a Deepline street kid, hauling the Sump's vents open.":"黄昏，围城之夜。从高处望去，奥蕾莉亚的每一块屏幕都亮着同一段影像：深线的街头小子凯尔，正奋力扳开污水坑的通风口。",
 "Below, Deepline watches Nyra, the singer Halcyon kept in a tank, lead the drills into its tunnels. Each layer swears the other hit first.":"下方，深线看着妮拉——那个被哈尔西恩关在缸里的歌手——领着钻机钻进他们的隧道。每一层都发誓是对方先动的手。",
 "I fly over the Crusher Yard every night. That night Kael was on a scrap heap eating noodles, nowhere near any vents. Somebody's lying.":"我每晚都从粉碎场上空飞过。那天晚上，凯尔坐在一堆废铁上吃面，离哪个通风口都远着呢。有人在撒谎。",
 "Then carry the truth. Mid-act tonight I cut Pell's ribbons loose, every secret he stitched into them. Take them to every tower.":"那就把真相带走。今晚演到一半，我会剪断佩尔的丝带，连同他缝进去的每一个秘密。把它们送到每一座塔。",
 "Every tower, every window. Gale, low route! And don't follow me!":"每一座塔，每一扇窗。盖尔，你走低空！还有，别跟着我！",
 "A kite crosses every tower in Aurelia trailing a dancer's ribbons, and on every balcony, someone stops to read them.":"一只风筝拖着一位舞者的丝带，掠过奥蕾莉亚的每一座塔；每一座阳台上，都有人停下来读。",
 "The Proving Hall read them too, and stopped on the stairs. Hard to march on Deepline while the sky spells out who paid for the war.":"试炼大厅也读了，于是停在了阶梯上。天上一笔一画写着是谁出钱买了这场战争，这时候还怎么向深线进军。",
 "Oda's bell has rung three times on the Surface. In the Pit, Pell hangs in his own strings and gives up a name. Kiri's crane flies it to the Crater.":"地表上，奥达的钟已经响了三下。深坑里，佩尔吊在自己的丝线上，供出了一个名字。基里的纸鹤把它送往陨坑。",
 "Rue. Pell's spy with no face. Kael and Nyra were about to fight over her lies, and a spare Kael just bolted. Told you somebody was lying.":"露。佩尔那个没有脸的间谍。凯尔和妮拉差点为她的谎言打起来，结果一个多出来的凯尔刚刚溜了。我就说有人在撒谎。",
 "Four banners up the Spire now, to the Engine Core, and something up there is still calling. Highest route's mine. We get there first.":"现在四面旗帜正攀上尖塔，直指引擎核心，而上面有什么东西还在呼唤。最高的那条路归我。我们要第一个到。",
 "The Noble Ring's star dancer once counted temple bells with her feet. Tonight she dances against drones for the Director's guests, and every step hangs on Pell's string.":"贵族环区的首席舞者，曾用双脚数过寺庙的钟声。今晚她要为总监的宾客与无人机共舞，而每一步都悬在佩尔的线上。",
 "Dance down the Director's drones":"跳着舞击落总监的无人机",
 "The Noble Ring opera. Tonight the Director's guests want a spectacle: the star dancer against Halcyon's drones, live, without a net.":"贵族环区歌剧院。今晚总监的宾客想看一场好戏：首席舞者对阵哈尔西恩的无人机，现场直演，不设安全网。",
 "Coda. I learned to count on a temple floor on the Surface, with the bell tolling up through my feet. Now I count for the boxes. Five, six, seven, eight.":"我是寇妲。我在地表一座寺庙的地板上学会数拍子，钟声从脚底一路震上来。如今我为包厢数拍子。五、六、七、八。",
 "Smile, my star. Every step on the beat. I will know if you miss one. I always know.":"笑一笑，我的明星。每一步都踩在拍子上。你漏掉一步，我会知道的。我向来都知道。",
 "I never miss, Pell. That's the whole trouble.":"我从不漏拍，佩尔。麻烦就在这儿。",
 "Applause. Roses on the boards. A noble leans out of his box to whisper about the feed lines, and the ribbons remember every word.":"掌声。舞台上落满玫瑰。一位贵族从包厢里探出身，低声说起进料线的事，丝带记下了每一个字。",
 "Another secret for Pell, stitched in on the beat. Bow. Smile. Hate it. One night I'll find the scissors.":"又一个秘密归了佩尔，踩着拍子缝了进去。鞠躬。微笑。恨透了。总有一晚，我会找到剪刀。",
 "After the opera, Coda slips Pell's strings for a single night and walks into the House Edge, the Ring's richest card room. Zara gives her a chair, a bet, and a fight.":"歌剧散场后，寇妲挣脱佩尔的线，只为一夜，走进了环区最阔绰的牌室——庄家优势赌坊。扎拉给了她一把椅子、一个赌注，和一场架。",
 "Hold the House Edge with Zara":"与扎拉守住庄家优势赌坊",
 "The House Edge, past midnight. Coda walks in alone, still in stage paint, past the high tables.":"午夜过后的庄家优势赌坊。寇妲独自走进来，脸上还带着舞台妆，从高额赌桌旁走过。",
 "The star at my tables, and without her shadow. Sit, before somebody runs to tell Pell.":"明星光临我的牌桌，还没带她的影子。坐吧，趁还没人跑去告诉佩尔。",
 "Every step I take, somebody holds the string. Tonight I want one step that's mine. Even if it only goes as far as a chair.":"我迈的每一步，都有人攥着线。今晚我想要一步属于我自己。哪怕只走到一把椅子那么远。",
 "Then the chair is yours, any night you need it. I'm betting on you, star. I don't lose.":"那这把椅子就归你了，哪晚需要都行。我押你，明星。我从不输。",
 "Your doorman says there are men in grey outside. Pell's, Halcyon's. Hard to tell them apart tonight.":"你的门童说，外面有穿灰衣服的人。佩尔的，哈尔西恩的。今晚很难分清。",
 "Then you dance. I'll deal. Mind the chips.":"那你跳舞。我发牌。当心筹码。",
 "Not one chip on the floor. You fought as if nobody held the string.":"一枚筹码都没掉地上。你打起来就像没人攥着那根线。",
 "Nobody did. One, push. Two, turn. Three, fly. I counted it myself.":"本来就没人攥着。一，推。二，转。三，飞。这是我自己数的拍子。",
 "Keep my seat warm, Zara. One night I won't go back to him.":"替我把座位焐热，扎拉。总有一晚，我不会再回到他身边。",
 "Mid-performance, with the whole house watching, Pell walks onto the stage to take his star back in hand. Coda decides the house can watch something new.":"演出正酣，满场观众注视之下，佩尔走上舞台，要把他的明星重新攥回手里。寇妲决定，让观众看点新鲜的。",
 "Duel Pell on the opera stage":"在歌剧舞台上与佩尔决斗",
 "The opera, mid-performance. The orchestra swells. In the wings, the strings go taut.":"歌剧演到一半。乐声高涨。侧幕里，丝线绷紧了。",
 "I didn't miss it. I took it. Without you.":"我没漏。那一步是我自己迈的。没有你。",
 "I took you out of a temple and gave you the sky. Every step you own, I bought. Bow, and we'll call tonight a rehearsal.":"是我把你从寺庙里带出来，给了你整片天空。你的每一步，都是我买下的。鞠个躬，今晚就当是彩排。",
 "I've bowed for you since I was nine. Here's your change, Pell. One string at a time, on the beat.":"我从九岁起就在为你鞠躬。这是找你的零钱，佩尔。一次一根线，踩着拍子。",
 "Wire after wire parts in her hands. The house thinks it is choreography, and rises to its feet.":"一根又一根丝线在她手中断开。观众以为这是编排好的舞蹈，全场起立。",
 "Cutting your strings in the middle of a performance. How very rude. ...A bow, my star? No? Then I'll take one for us both.":"演出到一半剪断自己的线。真是太失礼了。……鞠个躬吗，我的明星？不？那我替我们俩鞠吧。",
 "The strings in your hands are gone. The ones stitched into my ribbons are next, and this time I choose the audience.":"你手里的线没了。下一个是缝进我丝带里的那些，而这一次，观众由我来选。",
 "Back on the beat, my star. My beat. It always was.":"回到拍子上来，我的明星。我的拍子。一直都是。",
 "The screens say Deepline struck first, and the Director wants the opera to play on while the Proving Hall marches. Coda knows whose orders made those faces. They are stitched into her ribbons.":"屏幕上说是深线先动的手，总监要歌剧照常演下去，好让试炼大厅出兵。寇妲知道是谁下令造出了那些面孔。那些命令就缝在她的丝带里。",
 "Hold the stage through the last act":"守住舞台，直到最后一幕",
 "The Siege of the Noble Ring. Outside the opera, every screen loops Kael, a white-haired Deepline kid, at the Sump's vents. Inside, the show goes on.":"贵族环区之围。歌剧院外，每块屏幕都在循环播放白发的深线小子凯尔站在污水坑通风口前的画面。院内，演出照常进行。",
 "That face is a lie. Pell taught a girl with no face to wear anyone's, and for a year I carried her orders, stitched in my ribbons.":"那张脸是假的。佩尔教会了一个没有脸的女孩戴上任何人的脸，而一年来，我一直替她传递命令，就缝在我的丝带里。",
 "Kael at the vents up here. Nyra, the singer, on the drills down there. Each layer blames the other. Pell built both, for the Director.":"上面是凯尔在通风口。下面是那个歌手妮拉在钻机上。每一层都怪对方。两段都是佩尔替总监造出来的。",
 "The whole Ring is in the house tonight, and the Proving Hall waits for the curtain to march. Every eye is yours, star. Spend them.":"今晚整个环区都在剧院里，试炼大厅就等着落幕出兵。所有的目光都是你的，明星。尽情花吧。",
 "Music, please. Bar one. Mid-act I cut the ribbons loose, and every secret Pell sent through me goes up on the beat.":"请奏乐。第一小节。演到一半，我会剪断丝带，佩尔借我之手传出去的每一个秘密，都会踩着拍子飞上天。",
 "Mid-opera, Coda cuts her ribbons free and dances Pell's ledger out, line by line: the faces, the drills, the vents, the pay.":"歌剧演到一半，寇妲剪断丝带，把佩尔的账本一行一行跳了出来：那些面孔、钻机、通风口，还有酬金。",
 "Sora flies them to every tower, Kiri's cranes to every door. The wards rise, and Aldric turns the Proving Hall around on its own stairs.":"索拉把它们送到每一座塔，基里的纸鹤送到每一扇门。病区起义，奥德瑞让试炼大厅在自家阶梯上调转了方向。",
 "In the Pit, the Lantern Cell catches Pell in his own Cat's Cradle. He names the faceless one: Rue. Kiri's crane flies it to the Crater.":"在深坑，灯笼小队用佩尔自己的翻花绳把他缠住。他说出了那个无面之人：露。基里的纸鹤把名字送往陨坑。",
 "There, Kael and Nyra stand face to face, and a second Kael runs from the crowd. Far below, Oda's bell has rung three times.":"在那里，凯尔与妮拉正面相对，第二个凯尔从人群中逃走。远在下方，奥达的钟已经响了三下。",
 "Three tolls. I'd know that bell anywhere. Four banners up the Spire to the Engine Core, before whatever it calls can answer. Last act. No bow.":"三声。那口钟，我在哪儿都认得出来。四面旗帜攀上尖塔，直取引擎核心，赶在它召唤的东西回应之前。最后一幕。不谢幕。",
 "In the House Edge, Aurelia's nobles lose fortunes with impeccable manners. The winnings slip quietly down to Deepline, and tonight Halcyon sends auditors to find out how.":"在庄家优势赌坊，奥蕾莉亚的贵族们输掉万贯家财，礼数却无可挑剔。赢来的钱悄悄流到深线，今晚哈尔西恩派来了审计员，要查个明白。",
 "Run the auditors out of the House Edge":"把审计员赶出庄家优势赌坊",
 "The House Edge, richest card room in Aurelia. Nobles lose fortunes here with perfect manners and very good wine.":"庄家优势赌坊，奥蕾莉亚最阔绰的牌室。贵族们在这里输掉家财，礼数周全，美酒相伴。",
 "Zara. Deepline card sharp. I won my way up the Skylift one hand at a time. What I staked on the last one is my business.":"我是扎拉。深线来的老千。我一手牌接一手牌赢上了天梯。最后那一手押了什么，是我自己的事。",
 "The house's winnings go back down the Skylift. Bread, medicine, lamp oil. Nobody up here ever asks where.":"庄家赢的钱，又顺着天梯回到下面。面包、药、灯油。上面从没有人问过钱去了哪儿。",
 "Halcyon audit, madam. Irregular transfers to Deepline. We'll be opening the vault. Step away from the table.":"哈尔西恩审计，女士。有流向深线的异常转账。我们要打开金库。请离开牌桌。",
 "Nobody opens my vault. Pull up a chair, gentlemen. You can lose like everyone else.":"没人能打开我的金库。拉把椅子坐下吧，先生们。你们可以像其他人一样输。",
 "Audit concluded. Finding: the house won. Tell your Director to send better players.":"审计结束。结论：庄家赢了。告诉你们总监，派几个更会玩的来。",
 "And Lin wasn't behind my chair tonight. Lin is always behind my chair. Let's see where my bodyguard goes after hours.":"而且今晚琳不在我椅子后面。琳从来都在我椅子后面。我倒要看看，我的保镖下了班去哪儿。",
 "Zara follows her bodyguard down a stair no noble has ever heard of, and finds a whole clan living under the gold. Halcyon's auditors follow Zara.":"扎拉跟着她的保镖，走下一道没有哪个贵族听说过的楼梯，发现黄金之下住着整整一个氏族。哈尔西恩的审计员则跟着扎拉。",
 "Fight beside Lin in the undercroft":"在城底暗层与琳并肩作战",
 "Under the gold, the Ballast Decks: heat, hum, and a hidden stair. A top hat comes down it, very quietly.":"黄金之下，压舱甲板：热气、嗡鸣，和一道隐秘的楼梯。一顶高礼帽顺着楼梯下来，悄无声息。",
 "You followed me. Of course.":"你跟来了。当然。",
 "And look what I find. A clan under the floor. You took my job so your people could watch the Ring from behind my chair.":"瞧瞧我发现了什么。地板底下的一个氏族。你接下我这份差事，是为了让你的族人从我椅子后面盯着环区。",
 "The House Edge sees everyone. The Clan needed eyes there. I would have stood behind your chair regardless.":"庄家优势赌坊看得见每一个人。氏族需要在那里有双眼睛。不过就算没有这层缘故，我也会站在你椅子后面。",
 "That is the best hand anyone has shown me in years. Now. Who's coming down that stair behind me?":"这是这些年来别人亮给我看的最好的一手牌。好了。谁正从我身后那道楼梯下来？",
 "Your auditors. They followed you. Every fifth strike, Zara. Try to keep up.":"你的审计员。他们跟着你来的。每第五击封穴，扎拉。尽量跟上。",
 "Everything. Beginning with this: Halcyon knows where your money goes.":"全部。先说这一条：哈尔西恩知道你的钱去了哪儿。",
 "Jax's Long Bar at Mile Zero: one card table, two chairs, and a revolver that has never once been holstered. Zara and Jax have an old hand to finish.":"零英里，杰克斯的长吧台：一张牌桌，两把椅子，和一把从未入过套的左轮。扎拉和杰克斯还有一手旧牌没打完。",
 "Duel Jax at the Long Bar":"在长吧台与杰克斯决斗",
 "Mile Zero, past midnight. Dust on the windows, one table cleared, and Jax's revolver lying by his right hand, where it always lies.":"零英里，午夜过后。窗上蒙尘，一张桌子收拾干净，杰克斯的左轮搁在他右手边——它向来就搁在那儿。",
 "Zara. Top hat. Red waistcoat. Money suits you, partner.":"扎拉。高礼帽。红马甲。钱很配你啊，伙计。",
 "Jax. And you still deal off the bottom when the cards go cold.":"杰克斯。手气一背，你还是从牌底下发牌。",
 "And you still leave before the pot's split. Some of us remember how that ended.":"而你还是没等分完彩池就走人。有些人可还记得那回是怎么收场的。",
 "We don't talk about that. Not without a table between us and our hands full. Deal.":"那件事不提。除非我们之间隔着一张桌子，手里都攥着牌。发牌。",
 "Ten. Jackpot. 'Course it was. You always did draw the ten.":"十点。头彩。可不是嘛。你向来都能抽到十。",
 "I stacked the deck. You're the one who taught me how.":"我做了牌。是你教我怎么做的。",
 "Then we're square. Drinks are on the house. ...Your house, I mean.":"那我们两清了。酒算庄家请的。……我是说，你这个庄家。",
 "Six in the wheel, sweetheart. You were still counting five.":"转轮里有六发，甜心。你还在数第五发。",
 "The screens say Deepline struck first, and the Proving Hall is told to march. Zara reads faces, and the one on the screen has nothing behind it. She pushes every coin she has into the middle.":"屏幕上说是深线先动的手，试炼大厅接到了出兵的命令。扎拉会读脸，而屏幕上那张脸后面什么也没有。她把手里每一枚硬币都推到了桌子中央。",
 "Hold the House while the money moves":"钱在流转，守住赌坊",
 "The night of the Siege. Over the House Edge's silent tables, a screen loops Kael, a white-haired Deepline kid, opening the Sump's vents on the labs.":"围城之夜。庄家优势赌坊静悄悄的牌桌上方，一块屏幕循环播放着白发的深线小子凯尔打开污水坑的通风口，灌向实验室。",
 "I read faces for a living. That boy has a face and nothing behind it. A card with no pips.":"我靠读脸吃饭。那男孩有张脸，脸后面却什么都没有。一张没有点数的牌。",
 "Deepline's runners say their screens show Nyra, the singer from the Med-Lab, leading Halcyon's drills. The same blank behind her eyes.":"深线的跑腿说，他们的屏幕上放的是妮拉——医疗实验室出来的那个歌手——领着哈尔西恩的钻机。她眼睛后面也是同样的空白。",
 "So each layer thinks the other dealt first, and the Director rakes the pot. Very well. Every coin in the House, on the uprising.":"于是每一层都以为是对方先发的牌，而总监坐收彩池。很好。赌坊里每一枚硬币，全押在起义上。",
 "The House bought the Subjects' doors, the Clan's stairs and every kite in the Paper Post. Halcyon came for the vault. Halcyon left.":"赌坊买下了实验体们的门、氏族的楼梯，还有纸鹤邮驿的每一只风筝。哈尔西恩来抢金库。哈尔西恩走了。",
 "The Proving Hall turns on its own stairs. Far below, Oda's bell rings three times, and in the Pit the Lantern Cell has Pell in his own strings.":"试炼大厅在自家阶梯上倒戈。远在下方，奥达的钟响了三下；深坑里，灯笼小队用佩尔自己的丝线困住了他。",
 "Pell names his faceless spy: Rue. Kiri's crane flies it to the Crater, and a second Kael runs from the crowd.":"佩尔说出了他那个无面间谍的名字：露。基里的纸鹤把名字送往陨坑，第二个凯尔从人群中逃走。",
 "No pips, as I said. Four banners going up the Spire, toward the Engine Core. The Director's machine is calling something. We fold his hand first.":"没有点数，我说过的。四面旗帜正攀上尖塔，直指引擎核心。总监的机器在召唤什么东西。我们先让他弃牌。",
 "Subject 21 is doctor to every Subject in the Hydro Ward, because she is better at it than Halcyon's own staff. When the carts come for six of her beds, she does not leave the room.":"21号实验体是水疗区每一个实验体的医生，因为她比哈尔西恩自己的医护干得更好。当推车来拉走她的六张病床时，她没有离开病房。",
 "Hold the Hydro Ward for your patients":"为你的病人守住水疗区",
 "The Hydro Ward. Basins hum, drips tick, and a woman with her sleeves rolled walks the beds, counting breaths.":"水疗区。水槽嗡嗡作响，点滴嗒嗒滴落，一个卷着袖子的女人在病床间走过，数着呼吸。",
 "Maren. At home I sat with fevered children until the fever went out with the tide. Here the children have numbers.":"我是玛伦。在家乡，我守着发烧的孩子，直到高烧随潮水退去。在这里，孩子们都有编号。",
 "Step aside, 21. Beds four through nine are past use. Engine allocation.":"让开，21号。四到九号床已经没用了。划拨给引擎。",
 "These are my patients. Nobody is past use while I am still in the room. Take your cart and go.":"这些是我的病人。只要我还在这间屋里，就没有谁是没用的。推上你的车，走。",
 "Four. Five. Six... nine. All still breathing. That will do for tonight.":"四。五。六……九。都还在呼吸。今晚就这样吧。",
 "I took Halcyon's job to stay in the room with them. I'll stay until every one walks out on their own feet.":"我接下哈尔西恩的差事，就是为了留在这间屋里陪着他们。我会一直留下，直到每一个人都用自己的脚走出去。",
 "Halcyon sends its doctor down to Deepline's flooded metro with a collection team. A wall gives way, the water takes a stranger, and Maren argues with the sea.":"哈尔西恩派它的医生随一支回收小队下到深线被淹的地铁。一堵墙塌了，水卷走了一个陌生人，玛伦和大海争了起来。",
 "Hold the Drowned Line with Nami":"与奈美守住溺亡线",
 "The Drowned Line. A wall gives, black water pours in, and a young woman goes under and does not come up.":"溺亡线。一堵墙塌了，黑水涌进来，一个年轻女人沉下去，再没浮上来。",
 "Too long under. No. No, sea, you don't get this one. Give her BACK.":"沉得太久了。不。不行，大海，这一个你不能带走。把她还回来！",
 "Cold. ...Who was shouting at the sea?":"好冷。……刚才是谁在冲大海喊？",
 "Your doctor. Maren. Breathe. You were gone a minute, and now you aren't. Slowly.":"你的医生。玛伦。呼吸。你刚才走了一分钟，现在你回来了。慢一点。",
 "Good work, doctor. Breathing, and full of power. Bag her for the Spire.":"干得好，医生。有呼吸，力量充沛。把她装袋，送去尖塔。",
 "You pulled me out. Then you fought your own team for me. Nami. I owe you a life.":"你把我拉了出来。然后为了我跟自己的队伍打了起来。我叫奈美。我欠你一条命。",
 "You owe me rest and fluids. I have to go back up: there's a girl in a tank who keeps forgetting to breathe.":"你欠我的是休息和补水。我得回上面去：有个缸里的女孩总是忘记呼吸。",
 "Then whenever the doctor comes down here, I'm at her back. That's the debt.":"那以后医生每次下来，我都守在她身后。这就是我还的债。",
 "Vesna keeps the Red Ledger, and half of Maren's patients are written in it. In the Neon Market, the doctor comes to settle their account.":"维斯娜掌管着赤色账簿，玛伦的病人有一半都记在上面。在霓虹市场，医生前来替他们结账。",
 "Duel Vesna in the Neon Market":"在霓虹市场与维斯娜决斗",
 "The Neon Market, Red Quarter. Pink light on wet stone, and a woman in black with a red book open on her knee.":"霓虹市场，赤区。粉色的光落在湿漉漉的石头上，一个黑衣女人膝上摊着一本红色的书。",
 "You charge Deepline for its own blood. In my trade we call that a sickness.":"你向深线收它自己血的钱。在我这行，这叫病。",
 "In mine it's called bookkeeping. Every account is settled in red, doctor. Yours too.":"在我这行，这叫记账。每一笔账都用红字结清，医生。你的也一样。",
 "Then let's settle it. Sit still. This may sting.":"那就结吧。坐好别动。可能会有点疼。",
 "Strike the names off your ledger, Vesna. The ones who can't pay.":"把那些名字从你的账簿上划掉，维斯娜。那些付不起的人。",
 "One page, then. Not the long one. That page is Halcyon's, and I intend to collect it in full.":"那就划一页。不是长的那页。那页是哈尔西恩的，我打算一分不少地讨回来。",
 "Two forged films have the three layers at each other's throats, and Halcyon is coming for the wards. Maren holds one door while every Subject runs for the Noble Ring.":"两段伪造的影像让三层世界互相掐住了喉咙，哈尔西恩正朝病区扑来。玛伦守住一扇门，让每一个实验体奔向贵族环区。",
 "Hold the ward door while they run":"他们奔逃时，守住病区的门",
 "The Three-Layer War. Sky screens show Kael, a Deepline kid, opening the Sump's vents on the labs. Deepline's show Nyra leading drills. Each blames the other.":"三层之战。天空的屏幕上，深线小子凯尔打开污水坑的通风口，灌向实验室。深线的屏幕上，妮拉领着钻机。双方都怪对方。",
 "I dressed the burns from those labs myself. And the boy on the film never breathes: forty seconds in Sump smoke. Nyra, theirs isn't you either.":"那些实验室里的烧伤，是我亲手包扎的。而影像里那个男孩一次都没呼吸：在污水坑的浓烟里待了四十秒。妮拉，他们那段里的也不是你。",
 "I know. The wards are open, Maren. Everyone's running for the Ring, and Halcyon is right behind them.":"我知道。病区的门都开了，玛伦。大家都在往环区跑，哈尔西恩就紧跟在后面。",
 "Then everyone through this door, and nobody after them. Go. I'll be the last out.":"那就让所有人从这扇门过去，后面一个追兵也别放过来。走。我最后一个出去。",
 "Last one through. Every bed empty. For the first time in a year, I may leave the room.":"最后一个过去了。每张病床都空了。一年来第一次，我可以离开这间屋子了。",
 "Aldric's knights turned on the Ring; Oda's bell called the Surface. In the Pit, Pell named the face-thief: Rue. At the Crater, a second Kael ran.":"奥德瑞的骑士在环区倒戈；奥达的钟唤起了地表。深坑里，佩尔说出了那个窃脸者：露。陨坑那边，第二个凯尔逃了。",
 "Four banners going up the Spire, and something at the top calling in the Engine's voice. Someone up there needs a very long rest.":"四面旗帜正攀上尖塔，顶上有个东西在用引擎的声音呼唤。上面有人需要好好地、长长地休息一下了。",
 "Halcyon's brightest chemist has never asked where her Subjects come from, only what they do. Then the Director wants Subject 44 ready for something called the feed lines, and nobody will say what that means.":"哈尔西恩最聪明的化学家从不问她的实验体从哪里来，只问他们会起什么反应。后来总监要她把44号实验体准备好，送去一个叫“进料线”的地方，却没人肯说那是什么意思。",
 "Fight past security to the feed lines":"突破安保，前往进料线",
 "The Burn Ward labs, week six. Racks of red and blue flasks, and through the glass a girl in a bottle, glowing like a stove.":"烧伤病房实验室，第六周。一排排红色和蓝色的烧瓶，玻璃后面，一个装在瓶里的女孩，像火炉一样发着光。",
 "Elixa, chief alchemist. Red burns. Blue freezes. No one has tried both on a living subject. So, naturally, I'd like to.":"艾莉克莎，首席炼金师。红色灼烧。蓝色冰冻。还没人在活体上把两种都试过。所以，理所当然，我想试试。",
 "Feed lines. That's not in my protocol. What becomes of her afterwards?":"进料线。我的实验方案里没有这一项。之后她会怎么样？",
 "Afterwards is the Engine's business. Security, see the doctor to her quarters.":"之后是引擎的事。安保，送博士回她的住处。",
 "Curious. They were terribly anxious that I not see the afterwards. So I went down and looked.":"有意思。他们非常紧张，生怕我看到“之后”。所以我下去看了。",
 "Grey shapes along the pipes, still breathing. Husks. I recognised the burn scars. I wrote those up as promising.":"管道边一排灰色的身影，还在呼吸。空壳。我认得那些烧伤的疤痕。我曾在报告里把它们写成“前景可观”。",
 "Six weeks of notes on how to make one. Not a single page on how to unmake it. New notebook, then.":"六周的笔记，记的全是怎么造出一个。怎么把它变回去，一页都没有。那就换个新本子吧。",
 "Elixa walks into the Glowwild for spores that might wake a Husk. Ume, who has turned plenty of Halcyon people into compost, decides to hear her out first.":"艾莉克莎走进荧野，寻找也许能唤醒空壳的孢子。把不少哈尔西恩的人变成了堆肥的梅，决定先听她把话说完。",
 "Hold the spore beds with Ume":"与梅守住孢子苗床",
 "Halcyon's chemist, in my garden! Don't touch that one. Or that one. What do you want the spores for?":"哈尔西恩的化学家，跑到我园子里来了！别碰那个。那个也别碰。你要孢子做什么？",
 "A cure for the Husks. Your spores keep a memory of whatever they grew on. I want to know if they can remind a body.":"治疗空壳的药。你的孢子会记住它们生长过的东西。我想知道，它们能不能让一具身体想起来。",
 "Oh, good answer. Most Halcyon people say weapons. Most Halcyon people end up as compost.":"哦，好回答。大多数哈尔西恩的人会说是武器。大多数哈尔西恩的人最后都成了堆肥。",
 "I would prefer not to be compost. Do we settle the price first, or the drones behind you?":"我宁愿不变成堆肥。我们先谈价钱，还是先解决你身后的无人机？",
 "Drones, then price. Step where I step, chemist. Exactly where.":"先无人机，后价钱。我踩哪儿你踩哪儿，化学家。一点都别偏。",
 "You fought for the garden. Fine: spores, every season. And every season I'll ask what for.":"你为园子打了一仗。好吧：孢子，每季都给。每一季我都会问你拿去做什么。",
 "You'll get an answer every time. Green Cauldron, meet the Glowwild. Do behave, both of you.":"每次你都会得到答案。绿釜，来认识一下荧野。你们俩可都要规矩点。",
 "Now back up the Skylift. Week seven is tomorrow, and they mean to run my formula without me.":"现在回天梯上去。明天就是第七周，他们打算撇开我，照我的配方做下去。",
 "Week seven. Elixa comes back to stop the second colour, and Halcyon overrules her. Then the glass gives, and her result turns to look at the woman who took the notes.":"第七周。艾莉克莎赶回来要阻止第二种颜色，哈尔西恩驳回了她。然后玻璃碎了，她的实验结果转过身，看向那个做笔记的女人。",
 "Duel Pyra in the Burn Ward":"在烧伤病房与派拉决斗",
 "The Burn Ward, week seven. Alarms, steam, a smell of hot glass. The bottle breaks, and the fire walks out of it, and turns.":"烧伤病房，第七周。警报、蒸汽、一股滚烫玻璃的气味。瓶子碎了，火从里面走了出来，转过身。",
 "Lab coat. You mixed it. I drank it. Six weeks. And you took NOTES.":"白大褂。你调的。我喝的。六个星期。而你还在记笔记！",
 "I did. Pages of them. Tonight I asked them to stop, they said no, and I picked up my pen anyway. That is not a defence.":"我记了。好几页。今晚我要他们停手，他们说不，而我还是拿起了笔。这不是辩解。",
 "Knowing doesn't give me back a single week. You're on my list.":"你知道了，也还不回我哪怕一个星期。你上我的名单了。",
 "Then look at me. I would rather see the result than look away from it. I have done enough of that.":"那就看着我。我宁愿直视结果，也不愿移开目光。移开目光的事，我已经做得够多了。",
 "You're the only result that ever looked back at me. Running from it would be bad science. And worse manners.":"你是唯一一个回头看我的实验结果。从它面前逃开，是糟糕的科学。更是糟糕的礼数。",
 "Two forged films have every layer blaming the others, and the guards on the Noble Ring are running on Elixa's stimulants. She knows exactly what a second colour would do to them.":"两段伪造的影像让每一层都在怪罪别的层，而贵族环区的守卫全靠艾莉克莎的兴奋剂撑着。她很清楚，第二种颜色会对他们起什么作用。",
 "Fight Halcyon's guards on the Ring":"在环区与哈尔西恩的守卫作战",
 "The Three-Layer War. Sky screens loop Kael, a Deepline kid, opening the Sump's vents on the labs; Deepline's loop Nyra leading drills down.":"三层之战。天空的屏幕循环播放深线小子凯尔打开污水坑的通风口，灌向实验室；深线的屏幕循环播放妮拉领着钻机往下钻。",
 "I ran that film through my instruments. Sump fire all round the boy, and he reads room temperature. Whatever that is, it isn't a boy.":"我把那段影像过了一遍仪器。那男孩周围全是污水坑的火，他的读数却是室温。不管那是什么，都不是个男孩。",
 "Then make yourself useful, Elixa. Every guard on the Ring is running on your stimulants. I checked the flasks.":"那就派点用场吧，艾莉克莎。环区上每个守卫都靠你的兴奋剂撑着。我查过那些烧瓶了。",
 "Then they get a second colour. Blue to slow, green to sleep. For once I'm on the right side of the glass.":"那就给他们加第二种颜色。蓝色让人迟缓，绿色让人沉睡。这一回，我总算站在了玻璃正确的那一边。",
 "Halcyon's soldiers asleep in the corridors, and the Proving Hall turned. Aldric's doing, I'm told. Coda's dance did the rest.":"哈尔西恩的士兵在走廊里睡倒一片，试炼大厅也倒戈了。听说是奥德瑞干的。剩下的交给了寇妲的舞。",
 "Oda's bell rings over the Meridian. In the Pit, Pell, tangled in his own Cat's Cradle, names the face-thief: Rue. At the Crater, a second Kael runs.":"奥达的钟声在子午线上空响起。深坑里，被自己的翻花绳缠住的佩尔说出了那个窃脸者：露。陨坑那边，第二个凯尔逃了。",
 "No face, no heat. I would dearly love a sample. Later. Four banners are climbing the Spire, and the Engine Core is drawing power for something.":"没有脸，没有体温。我真想取个样本。以后再说。四面旗帜正攀上尖塔，引擎核心正在为某样东西蓄能。",
 "Every decree the Director makes carries Isa's seal. Then order forty-one reaches her desk, and she reads what it would do with the Subjects.":"总监颁布的每一道法令，都盖着伊莎的印。后来第四十一号令送到了她的案头，她读到了它要拿实验体们怎么办。",
 "Fight off the guards in the Archive":"在档案馆击退守卫",
 "The Archive. Lamps, dust, ten thousand ledgers. Every contract in the Ring, every law of the Director's, sealed in one woman's ink.":"档案馆。灯火、灰尘、上万本账册。环区的每一份契约，总监的每一条法令，都用同一个女人的墨封印。",
 "Isa, of the old school on the steppe. Sen and I could draw a line no one crossed. Here, I draw Halcyon's lines instead.":"我是伊莎，出自草原上的老学堂。森恩和我能画出一道无人能越的线。在这里，我画的却是哈尔西恩的线。",
 "Order forty-one, seal-writer. The Director wants it binding by noon.":"第四十一号令，封印书师。总监要它在中午前生效。",
 "Every Subject past use, to the Engine. No names. No record. ...No. Not in my ink.":"所有没用了的实验体，送入引擎。不留名字。不留记录。……不。不能用我的墨。",
 "Order forty-one remains unsealed. It will remain so.":"第四十一号令仍未盖印。它将一直如此。",
 "But every order before it bears my seal. I wrote the bars of this cage, clause by clause. Now I must unwrite them.":"可它之前的每一道命令，都盖着我的印。这座牢笼的每一根栏杆，都是我一条一款写出来的。如今我必须把它们一一抹去。",
 "Halcyon sends a captain for the hand that refused order forty-one. Out of the stacks steps Lin, of a clan the Ring swears is a rumour, to guard it.":"哈尔西恩派了一名队长，来取那只拒绝了第四十一号令的手。书架间走出了琳——她所属的氏族，环区一口咬定只是谣传——前来守护那只手。",
 "The Archive, the next night. Boots between the stacks. A Halcyon captain wants the seal-writer's hand.":"档案馆，第二天夜里。书架之间响起靴声。一名哈尔西恩队长要取封印书师的手。",
 "Seal-writer. Breathe. The Sky Clan has read your seals for a year. We read the one you refused.":"封印书师。呼吸。天空氏族读你的印已经读了一年。你拒绝的那一道，我们也读到了。",
 "You're from under the floor. The clan no one up here believes in. Why come up for me?":"你是从地板底下来的。上面没人相信存在的那个氏族。为什么要为我上来？",
 "The Pact of Three Layers keeps the layers from killing one another. Your ink is the Director's best weapon. Not tonight.":"三层盟约让各层不至于互相残杀。你的墨是总监最好的武器。今晚不是了。",
 "Write. I'll keep the door.":"写吧。我守门。",
 "Not a drop spilled. Every law in these stacks bears my seal, Lin. I built the cage myself, in a fair hand.":"一滴墨都没洒。这些书架上的每一条法令都盖着我的印，琳。这座牢笼是我亲手造的，字迹还工工整整。",
 "Then unbuild it. One word, large enough for all of them.":"那就把它拆了。一个字，大到足以盖过所有法令。",
 "A Final Word. When I can find one that heavy. Until then, stay near my brush hand.":"一个终字。等我找到那么重的一个字。在那之前，守在我执笔的手边。",
 "Always.":"一直都在。",
 "Isa goes down to the Old Metro to ask Sen, her old schoolmate, to help her unwrite her laws. First he wants to know whether her line still holds.":"伊莎下到旧地铁，去请她的老同窗森恩帮她抹去自己写下的法令。他先要知道，她的线还守不守得住。",
 "Duel Sen in the Rust Dojo":"在锈蚀道场与森恩决斗",
 "The Old Metro. A rusted carriage swept spotless: the Rust Dojo. Sen kneels inside, beside a neat stack of Isa's letters.":"旧地铁。一节生锈的车厢，打扫得一尘不染：锈蚀道场。森恩跪坐在里面，身旁是一摞叠得整整齐齐的伊莎的信。",
 "Sen. Every letter I sent, you answered with a single line. This time I came for more than a line.":"森恩。我寄来的每一封信，你都只回一行。这一次，我来要的不止一行。",
 "...A year of your seals. Each one drew a line down here. Around people.":"……你盖了一年的印。每一道都在这下面画了一条线。圈住了人。",
 "I know. I mean to unwrite every one. But first I need to know that my own line still holds.":"我知道。我打算把每一道都抹去。但首先，我得知道我自己的线还守得住。",
 "Draw it.":"画吧。",
 "...It held.":"……守住了。",
 "You stopped a hair's width short. You always did wait too long.":"你差一根头发丝那么远就停了。你向来都等得太久。",
 "Write your word, Isa. I will answer it. One line.":"写下你的字，伊莎。我会回应它。一行。",
 "Crossed. ...Again. Slower.":"越过了。……再来。慢一点。",
 "The screens show a Deepline boy striking the Sky, and Halcyon's war law waits on Isa's desk for her seal. Tonight she writes something else: one word to answer every law she ever sealed.":"屏幕上放着一个深线少年袭击天空，哈尔西恩的战时法令摆在伊莎案头，等着她盖印。今晚她要写的是别的：一个字，回应她盖过印的每一条法令。",
 "Hold the Ring while you write":"边写边守住环区",
 "The night of the Siege. The Archive's windows flicker with the film on every wall: Kael, a white-haired Deepline boy, opening the Sump's vents.":"围城之夜。档案馆的窗户映着每面墙上闪烁的影像：白发的深线少年凯尔，正打开污水坑的通风口。",
 "And in Deepline they watch Nyra, the escaped singer, lead the drills. Two borrowed faces, and each layer certain the other struck first.":"而在深线，人们看着那个逃出来的歌手妮拉领着钻机。两张借来的脸，每一层都认定是对方先动的手。",
 "Halcyon's war law lies on my desk, awaiting my seal. The Proving Hall marches the moment it is binding.":"哈尔西恩的战时法令就摆在我案头，等我盖印。它一生效，试炼大厅就出兵。",
 "Every law the Director ever had me seal, answered in one word. Ink.":"总监让我盖过印的每一条法令，都用一个字来回答。墨。",
 "The Final Word falls across the sky in crimson ink. Every seal on every law Halcyon ever made breaks at once.":"终字以猩红的墨横贯天际落下。哈尔西恩所立的每一条法令上的每一枚印，同时碎裂。",
 "Void. The Proving Hall has no orders, the wards have no locks, and every Subject has a name again.":"作废。试炼大厅没有了命令，病区没有了锁，每一个实验体都重新有了名字。",
 "Oda's bell tolls three times on the Surface. In the Pit, Pell, caught in his own strings, names his faceless spy: Rue.":"奥达的钟在地表敲响三下。深坑里，被自己的丝线缠住的佩尔，说出了他那个无面间谍的名字：露。",
 "Kiri's crane carries the name to the Crater. A second Kael flees the crowd. Four banners start up the Spire, toward the Engine Core.":"基里的纸鹤把名字带到陨坑。第二个凯尔逃离了人群。四面旗帜开始攀上尖塔，朝引擎核心而去。",
 "A forgery, then, the whole war. And that Engine is still calling for something. I mean to close that door before anyone answers.":"这么说，整场战争都是伪造的。而那台引擎还在召唤着什么。我要在任何人回应之前，把那扇门关上。",
 "For a hundred years the Sky Clan has lived in the warm dark under Aurelia. Tonight Halcyon means to seal it in like a cellar, and Lin answers with an open hand.":"一百年来，天空氏族一直生活在奥蕾莉亚底下温暖的黑暗里。今晚，哈尔西恩要像封地窖一样把它封死，而琳以一只摊开的手作答。",
 "Stop the crews bolting the undercroft":"阻止工队封死城底暗层",
 "The Ballast Decks. Halcyon crews come down with bolt guns and cutters, to shut the undercroft's old doors and starve out its heat.":"压舱甲板。哈尔西恩的工队带着射钉枪和切割机下来了，要封死城底暗层的旧门，断掉那里的热气。",
 "Lin, of the Sky Clan. A hundred years we have lived under the gold. These doors open from our side.":"我是天空氏族的琳。一百年来，我们一直生活在黄金之下。这些门，从我们这一侧开。",
 "No fire near the beams. Breathe, sister. This wants a quiet hand.":"梁木边不许用火。呼吸，姐妹。这事得用一双安静的手。",
 "Five strikes, and the fifth seals. For a moment they forgot how their own arms worked. A moment is enough.":"五击，第五击封穴。有那么一会儿，他们忘了自己的胳膊怎么用。一会儿就够了。",
 "Fine. That was impressive. Quiet, and smug, and impressive.":"好吧。挺厉害的。又安静，又得意，又厉害。",
 "Not smug. Rested.":"不是得意。是从容。",
 "Zara of the House Edge needs a bodyguard; the Sky Clan wants eyes on the Noble Ring. From behind one chair, Lin can be both.":"庄家优势赌坊的扎拉需要一个保镖；天空氏族想在贵族环区安一双眼睛。站在一把椅子后面，琳两样都能做到。",
 "The House Edge, richest card room in Aurelia. Chandeliers, green baize, and a great deal of money losing politely.":"庄家优势赌坊，奥蕾莉亚最阔绰的牌室。水晶吊灯、绿呢牌桌，还有大把大把彬彬有礼地输掉的钱。",
 "So you're the one the Ring whispers about. Small, quiet, and my last three guards still can't lift a glass.":"原来环区私下议论的就是你。个子小，话不多，而我前三个保镖到现在还举不起酒杯。",
 "They were rude to a waiter. I sealed their arms. The feeling comes back by morning.":"他们对一个侍者无礼。我封了他们的胳膊。到早上就能恢复知觉。",
 "Darling, you're hired. Stand behind my chair. You'll see everyone.":"亲爱的，你被录用了。站在我椅子后面。你会看清每一个人。",
 "That is why I came. ...You have guests. Halcyon. They are unhappy about where your money goes.":"我正是为此而来。……你有客人了。哈尔西恩。他们不满意你的钱流去的地方。",
 "Not one chip on the floor. You really do see everyone.":"一枚筹码都没掉地上。你还真是看得见每一个人。",
 "Everyone. And where your winnings go. Down.":"每一个人。还有你赢的钱去了哪儿。下面。",
 "And?":"然后呢？",
 "And nothing. I stand behind the chair.":"没有然后。我站在椅子后面。",
 "Before dawn in the Hidden Village on the Surface, Ivo has trained for an hour to beat the soft one. Lin has sealed him twice. She needs to hear only his fifth punch.":"地表的隐秘之村，天亮之前。伊沃已经练了一个小时，就为了打败那个软绵绵的家伙。琳已经封住他两次了。她只需要听他的第五拳。",
 "Duel Ivo in the Hidden Village":"在隐秘之村与伊沃决斗",
 "The mountain, before dawn. Frost on the ring's rope. A young man with gold fists has been at his reps for an hour.":"山上，天亮之前。擂台的围绳上结着霜。一个长着金色拳头的年轻人已经反复练了一个小时。",
 "LIN! The soft one! I've been up since three! Today you don't seal me!":"琳！软绵绵的那个！我三点就起来了！今天你别想封住我！",
 "Good morning, Ivo. Your style is loud. Every punch sends a herald ahead of it.":"早上好，伊沃。你的路数太吵了。每一拳出手前都先派了个传令官。",
 "Twelve punches in two seconds! Herald THAT!":"两秒十二拳！你倒是通报一个试试！",
 "I don't need all twelve. Only the fifth.":"我不需要十二拳。只要第五拳。",
 "Third time. THIRD. I can't feel my arms. I can feel my nose. That's something.":"第三次了。第三次！我感觉不到胳膊了。我还感觉得到鼻子。总算还剩点什么。",
 "They'll wake by noon. Loud isn't wrong, Ivo. It's only easy to hear.":"到中午就醒了。吵不是错，伊沃。只是太容易听见。",
 "Tomorrow, before dawn. I'm working on quiet. I'm working on it VERY hard.":"明天，天亮之前。我在练安静。我练得非常、非常用力！",
 "Not so soft now, eh? Up! Breathe! Again!":"现在不那么软了吧？起来！呼吸！再来！",
 "The screens show a Deepline boy striking the Sky, and Halcyon has its war law ready to seal. Isa means to write one word that undoes every law she ever sealed. Lin keeps the room.":"屏幕上放着一个深线少年袭击天空，哈尔西恩的战时法令已备好待盖印。伊莎要写下一个字，抹去她盖过印的每一条法令。琳守着这间屋。",
 "Hold the guards off Isa's brush":"挡住守卫，护住伊莎的笔",
 "The Noble Ring, the night of the Siege. Every screen shows the same few seconds: Kael, a Deepline street kid, turning the Sump's vent wheels.":"贵族环区，围城之夜。每一块屏幕都在放同样的几秒钟：深线的街头小子凯尔，正转动污水坑的通风阀轮。",
 "Watch his feet. No weight in them. Everyone stands like someone. That boy stands like no one.":"看他的脚。一点重量都没有。每个人站着都像某个人。那个男孩站着，却像谁都不是。",
 "Deepline's screens show Nyra, the singer, leading the drills down. Each layer blames the other, while the Proving Hall waits for its marching orders.":"深线的屏幕上，是那个歌手妮拉领着钻机往下钻。每一层都怪对方，而试炼大厅正等着出兵的命令。",
 "Orders sealed in my ink. I am writing the Final Word. Keep them off my hand.":"用我的墨封印的命令。我在写终字。别让他们碰到我的手。",
 "Write. The brush is yours. The room is mine.":"写吧。笔归你。这间屋归我。",
 "The Final Word crosses the sky in crimson ink. Every law the Director sealed comes undone. The Proving Hall stands on its stairs, unordered.":"终字以猩红的墨横贯天际。总监封印过的每一条法令都随之失效。试炼大厅站在自家阶梯上，无令可从。",
 "Brush hand safe. Not a drop spilled. Breathe, Isa. ...Now out.":"执笔的手无恙。一滴墨都没洒。吸气，伊莎。……现在，呼气。",
 "Far off, Oda's bell rings three times over the Meridian drills. In the Pit, Pell, caught in his own strings, names the one who stood like no one: Rue.":"远处，奥达的钟在子午线的钻机上空响了三下。深坑里，被自己的丝线缠住的佩尔，说出了那个站着像谁都不是的人：露。",
 "Kiri's crane carries the name to the Crater. A second Kael slips from the crowd and is gone. Four banners start up the Spire, toward the Engine Core.":"基里的纸鹤把名字带到陨坑。第二个凯尔从人群中溜走，不见了。四面旗帜开始攀上尖塔，朝引擎核心而去。",
 "That Engine has been calling something. We climb quietly, and we climb now.":"那台引擎一直在召唤什么东西。我们悄悄地爬，现在就爬。",
 "Every night the Night Ward locks Subject 77 in. Most nights she leaves by the roof, and Aurelia's dark lower alleys have started to have lamps in them.":"每晚夜间病房都会把77号实验体锁起来。大多数夜里，她都从屋顶离开，而奥蕾莉亚底层那些黑暗的小巷里，开始有了灯。",
 "Clear the dark alleys before dawn":"天亮前清扫黑暗小巷",
 "The Night Ward. Lock, count, lights out. On the roof above cell 77, a red scarf is already moving.":"夜间病房。上锁，点名，熄灯。77号房的屋顶上，一条红围巾已经在动了。",
 "Vesper. At home I lit the sea wall at dusk. Every lamp. Nobody saw who.":"我是韦斯帕。在家乡，黄昏时我点亮海堤。每一盏灯。没人看见是谁。",
 "The alleys down here have none. Tonight, thirty.":"下面这些小巷一盏都没有。今晚，三十盏。",
 "Movement on the Ward roofs. Red cloth. Find it.":"病房屋顶有动静。红布。找出来。",
 "You'll find lamps.":"你们只会找到灯。",
 "Thirty lit. Back before the count.":"点了三十盏。点名前回去。",
 "On the way: a cart from the wards, rolling down to the feed lines. Full. It came back up empty.":"路上：一辆从病区出来的推车，往下滚向进料线。满的。回来时是空的。",
 "Vesper has shadowed the empty carts all the way to the Engine. Tonight she brings the knight who guards the wards, to see what he has been guarding.":"韦斯帕一路尾随那些空推车，直到引擎。今晚，她带来了守卫病区的骑士，让他看看自己一直守着的是什么。",
 "Hold the feed lines with Aldric":"与奥德瑞守住进料线",
 "The Engine's feed lines. Pipes as thick as trees, a slow grey hum, and two figures on a gantry where neither should be.":"引擎的进料线。管道粗得像树干，一阵缓慢的灰色嗡鸣，栈桥上站着两个身影——他们都不该出现在这里。",
 "Seventy-seven. You are outside your ward. I ought to take you back to it.":"七十七号。你离开了你的病区。我理应把你带回去。",
 "Look first. You held the sea wall I lit every dusk. You never turned round.":"先看看。你守过那道我每个黄昏都去点灯的海堤。你从没回过头。",
 "Down there. Grey. Breathing. Your Subjects. The Director calls them Husks.":"那下面。灰色的。还在呼吸。你的实验体。总监管他们叫空壳。",
 "Then I'll light the road.":"那我来为你点亮道路。",
 "Moro of the Lantern Cell hides in shadows; Vesper walks through them. On the Night Ward roofs, he finally makes one she can't.":"灯笼小队的莫罗藏身于影子；韦斯帕则从影子里穿过。在夜间病房的屋顶上，他终于造出了一道她穿不过去的影子。",
 "Duel Moro on the Night Ward roofs":"在夜间病房屋顶与莫罗决斗",
 "The Ward roofs. A sleepy young man sits on the ridge where Vesper always crosses. His shadow runs much too long.":"病房的屋顶。一个睡眼惺忪的年轻人坐在韦斯帕总要经过的屋脊上。他的影子拖得太长了。",
 "You again. You walk through my shadows like they're doors. It's rude.":"又是你。你从我的影子里穿过去，就好像它们是门一样。很没礼貌。",
 "They're for walking through. You hide in yours.":"影子本来就是用来穿过的。你却躲在你的影子里。",
 "Pell taught us shadows hide things. I decided they hold things. Try this one.":"佩尔教我们，影子用来藏东西。我觉得，影子也能困住东西。试试这一道。",
 "Already halfway.":"已经过了一半。",
 "It held me a whole second. Most don't manage one.":"它困住了我整整一秒。大多数连一秒都撑不住。",
 "Two stolen faces have the three layers ready to kill each other, and the knights of the Proving Hall have orders to march on Deepline. Vesper means every knight to see the Husks first.":"两张偷来的脸让三层世界随时准备互相残杀，试炼大厅的骑士们已接到向深线进军的命令。韦斯帕要让每一个骑士先去看看空壳。",
 "Clear the road to the feed lines":"打通前往进料线的道路",
 "The Three-Layer War. Sky screens loop Kael, a Deepline kid, at the Sump's vents; Deepline's loop Nyra leading the drills. Each side blames the other.":"三层之战。天空的屏幕循环播放深线小子凯尔站在污水坑通风口前；深线的屏幕循环播放妮拉领着钻机。双方都怪对方。",
 "That boy on the film casts no shadow. Lamp behind him, lamp before him. Nothing on the floor. I light lamps. I notice.":"影像里那个男孩没有影子。身后有灯，身前有灯。地上什么都没有。我是点灯的。我会注意到。",
 "Lamplighter. The knights wait on my word. Show them what you showed me.":"点灯人。骑士们在等我一句话。把你给我看的，也给他们看。",
 "Every lamp from the Hall to the Husks, then. Let them walk down and look.":"那就从大厅到空壳，每一盏灯都点上。让他们自己走下去看。",
 "Lamp by lamp, a road of light runs down below the Spire. The knights see the Husks, and the Proving Hall turns.":"一盏接一盏，一条光之路延伸到尖塔之下。骑士们看见了空壳，试炼大厅倒戈了。",
 "I stood a year in the wrong place. No longer. Coda has cut her strings on the stage above. We go up.":"我在错误的位置上站了一年。不会再这样了。寇妲已经在上面的舞台上剪断了她的线。我们上去。",
 "Word from the Pit: Pell named the face. Rue. At the Crater a second Kael ran. No shadow, no face. No one.":"深坑传来消息：佩尔说出了那张脸。露。陨坑那边，第二个凯尔逃了。没有影子，没有脸。谁也不是。",
 "Oda's bell has called the Surface. Four banners climb the Spire toward the Engine Core; halfway up, the stair lamps are lit already. Nobody saw who.":"奥达的钟已唤起了地表。四面旗帜朝引擎核心攀上尖塔；才爬到一半，阶梯上的灯已经点亮了。没人看见是谁。",
 "Under Deepline, in Halcyon's Beast Pens, one cage was built for something bigger than a man. Fenn has spent a month learning which of its bars is weakest.":"深线之下，哈尔西恩的兽栏里，有一只笼子是为比人更大的东西打造的。芬恩花了一个月，摸清了哪根栏杆最不结实。",
 "The Beast Pens, under Deepline. Wet straw, rust, and the sour smell of animals that have stopped expecting to be fed.":"兽栏，深线之下。湿稻草、铁锈，还有那些早已不指望有人来喂的牲口散发出的酸臭。",
 "On Vharra the sky tore open over our camp. I set my storm-wolf between the tear and the tents.":"在瓦拉，天空在我们的营地上方裂开了。我让风暴之狼挡在裂隙和帐篷之间。",
 "The wolf held. I fell through. Woke in here, behind bars they forged for a bear.":"狼挡住了。我掉了下去。醒来就在这儿，关在他们给熊打的铁栏后面。",
 "Pen Nine is awake. Prods out. And somebody log what it has been chewing on.":"九号栏醒了。电棍拿出来。再找个人记下来，它一直在啃什么。",
 "Third bar from the left. Took a month. Hungry winters teach a man to be patient with iron.":"左数第三根。花了一个月。挨过饿的冬天，会教人对铁有耐心。",
 "There you are. Found my track, did you. Good wolf.":"你来了。循着我的踪迹找来的，是吧。好狼。",
 "Up, then. Toward the air. Halcyon can count its empty cages after.":"那就起来。往有风的地方走。空笼子，让哈尔西恩回头慢慢数。",
 "In the Crusher Yard a scrap-kid wears the storm-eye of Vharra scratched into his jacket. Fenn has no clan left, and Halcyon's drones are already in the air.":"粉碎场里，一个捡废铁的小子把瓦拉的风暴之眼刻在了夹克上。芬恩早已没有族人，而哈尔西恩的无人机已经升空。",
 "Hey! Wolf man! This heap's mine. Ferra said so, and when Ferra says a thing, the scrap listens.":"喂！狼人！这堆废铁是我的。费拉说的，费拉一开口，连废铁都得听着。",
 "That mark on your jacket. The storm-eye. Who taught you to cut that, kid?":"你夹克上那个印记。风暴之眼。谁教你刻的，小子？",
 "Nobody taught me nothing. Born under the thunderheads, fell through the tear, landed in trash. So?":"没人教过我任何东西。生在雷云底下，从裂隙掉下来，落进垃圾堆。怎么着？",
 "Only the storm clans wear that eye. You're kin. Down here, I'm the closest thing to a clan you've got.":"只有风暴诸族才佩那只眼睛。你是自家人。在这下面，我就是你最接近族人的人了。",
 "Great. A big brother. Did I order one of those? I'm pretty sure I didn't order one of those.":"好极了。一个大哥。我点过这个吗？我很确定我没点过这个。",
 "Nobody orders one. Drones, coming over the wall. Stay behind me.":"从来没人点。无人机翻墙过来了。待在我身后。",
 "Behind you? Grandpa, watch THIS!":"你身后？老头儿，看好了！",
 "Okay. Not bad for an old wolf. You can stay. Tonight. Maybe.":"行吧。对一头老狼来说还不赖。你可以留下。今晚。大概吧。",
 "I'll stay till you can put a Halcyon captain down on your own.":"我会一直留到你能一个人撂倒哈尔西恩的队长为止。",
 "I literally just did that! You were standing right there!":"我刚刚就撂倒了一个！你就站在旁边看着！",
 "Then I stay until you stop shouting about it. Could take years. Find me a blanket.":"那我就留到你不再为这事嚷嚷为止。可能得好几年。给我找条毯子。",
 "Something Halcyon turned loose is killing in the Glowwild. Two hunters reach its trail in the same breath, and neither of them shares.":"哈尔西恩放出来的某个东西正在荧野里杀戮。两个猎手在同一个呼吸间找到了它的踪迹，谁也不打算分享。",
 "Duel Kova for the Glowwild trail":"与科瓦决斗，争夺荧野猎踪",
 "The Glowwild, blue light dripping off the leaves. A torn deer on the moss, and two hunters kneeling at one print.":"荧野，蓝光从叶尖滴落。苔藓上躺着一头被撕开的鹿，两个猎手跪在同一个脚印旁。",
 "Back off, one-trick wolf! Mine. My forest, my print, my hunt. Grrr.":"滚开，只会一招的狼！是我的。我的森林，我的脚印，我的猎物。吼——",
 "You'll go in a tiger, come out a tortoise, and something gets eaten in between. Go home, pup.":"你进去时是老虎，出来时成了乌龟，中间总有什么被吃掉。回家去吧，小崽子。",
 "Every beast beats one wolf. Want proof? I've got four kinds of proof!":"百兽胜一狼。要证据？我有四种证据！",
 "Fine. Whoever's still on his feet takes the trail.":"行。最后还站得住的，拿走猎踪。",
 "Okay! Okay. The wolf is... good. For a wolf. One wolf.":"好吧！好吧。这头狼……挺厉害。就一头狼而言。一头而已。",
 "You're every beast at once and none of them all the way. Pick one, show-off. Keep it.":"你同时是所有野兽，却没有一种做到底。挑一种，爱显摆的。守住它。",
 "Or. We hunt it together. Since I'm fast. And you're... there. Very there.":"要不。我们一起追它。反正我快。而你……就杵在那儿。特别能杵。",
 "Keep up, then. And we tell nobody we enjoyed this.":"那就跟上。还有，别告诉任何人我们玩得挺开心。",
 "Tiger, eagle, tortoise... and one wolf, napping in the moss. Want to borrow a beast? I have spares.":"老虎、雄鹰、乌龟……还有一头狼，在苔藓里打盹。要借你一只野兽吗？我有备用的。",
 "Halcyon's screens say Kael gassed the Sky's labs, and while the layers argue, the drills bite down into the buried city. Fenn knows his kid's scent. This lie does not carry it.":"哈尔西恩的屏幕说凯尔用毒气熏了天空城的实验室；趁各层吵个不停，钻机一口口咬进那座被埋的城。芬恩认得自家小子的气味。这个谎言上没有。",
 "Lead the pack into the drill camp":"率领狼群冲进钻机营地",
 "The Ash Dunes at dusk. Halcyon's drills sink into the Buried Meridian, a city that went under in the war with its people inside.":"黄昏的灰烬沙丘。哈尔西恩的钻机正沉入被掩埋的子午线——一座在战争中连同居民一起沉入沙下的城市。",
 "It's on every screen. A Deepline boy, Kael, opening the Sump vents on the Sky's labs. A Sky girl, Nyra, leading drills into Deepline.":"每块屏幕上都在放。一个深线男孩，凯尔，打开污水坑的排气口，对准天空城的实验室。一个天空城女孩，妮拉，领着钻机钻进深线。",
 "Now the Sky blames Deepline and Deepline blames the Sky, and nobody's looking at the sand but us.":"现在天空城怪深线，深线怪天空城，除了我们，谁也没在看这片沙子。",
 "Kael? That kid can't keep a secret through supper. That's not his walk. Something is wearing his face.":"凯尔？那小子连一顿晚饭的工夫都藏不住秘密。那不是他走路的样子。有什么东西顶着他的脸。",
 "Down the slope Dune and Tarek, enemies for years, haul on one chain. On the mountain Oda's bell rings three times. It never has.":"坡下，多年的死对头杜恩和塔里克拽着同一条锁链。山上，奥达的钟响了三下。从来没有过。",
 "Three tolls. The whole Surface is coming. Up, wolf. We run at the front.":"三声钟响。整个地表都要来了。起来，狼。我们跑在最前头。",
 "The storm-wolf goes through the drill camp like lightning through dry grass, and the Surface pours in behind it.":"风暴之狼冲过钻机营地，如闪电掠过干草，整个地表紧随其后涌了进来。",
 "Camp's broken. Drills are quiet. Now I want whatever owns the lie.":"营地破了。钻机停了。现在，我要找到这个谎言的主人。",
 "The same night the Sky's wards rise and Aldric turns his knights around. In Deepline's Pit Arena, Pell is caught in his own strings.":"同一夜，天空城的病区揭竿而起，奥德瑞让他的骑士们掉转了方向。在深线的深坑竞技场，佩尔被自己的丝线缠住了。",
 "Pell names his faceless spy, Rue, who wore both faces for the Director. Kiri's crane flies it to the Crater, where a second Kael runs.":"佩尔供出了他的无面密探露，是她替总监戴着那两张脸。基里的纸鹤把消息送到陨坑，那里的第二个凯尔逃了。",
 "Rue. I'll know that scent anywhere now. Nobody wears my kid's face and walks away clean.":"露。如今这个气味我在哪儿都认得出。谁也别想顶着我家小子的脸，干干净净地走掉。",
 "Hollis paints a fourth banner. Four banners, and every pack under them, climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core, before whatever it calls can answer.":"霍利斯画下第四面旗帜。四面旗帜，连同每一面旗下的每一支狼群，攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，奔向引擎核心——赶在它召唤的东西应声之前。",
 "Four hundred metres under the Surface, Halcyon has put a drill in Brakk's hands and told him to dig. Nobody told him which way.":"地表之下四百米，哈尔西恩把一台钻机塞进布拉克手里，叫他挖。没人告诉他往哪边挖。",
 "Fight your way up out of Shaft Nine":"从九号竖井一路杀上地面",
 "Shaft Nine, Halcyon's deepest mine. Lamp-smoke, rock dust, and four hundred metres of stone pressing down on everyone.":"九号竖井，哈尔西恩最深的矿。灯烟、岩尘，四百米的岩石压在每个人头顶。",
 "Unit Forty. The big one. Drill's yours. Dig till the shift bell, then keep digging.":"四十号工。大个子。钻机归你了。挖到换班铃响，然后接着挖。",
 "On Vharra I kept the Standing Stones. Children walked in my shadow. It was cool there, in summer.":"在瓦拉，我守护立石阵。孩子们走在我的影子里。夏天，那里很凉快。",
 "The sky tore. I fell here. They gave me a drill.":"天裂了。我掉到这里。他们给了我一台钻机。",
 "Why is it pointed at the roof? The seam is DOWN, you ox! Down!":"你干吗冲着顶上钻？矿脉在下面，你这头蠢牛！往下！",
 "...Up is better.":"……往上更好。",
 "Four hundred metres later, a stone fist breaks into grey daylight. The hillside heaves behind it like something waking.":"四百米之后，一只石拳破进灰蒙蒙的天光。它身后的山坡隆起，像某种东西正在苏醒。",
 "Now. A place to stand.":"现在。找个立足的地方。",
 "For three days a huge man has sat on a nameless peak without moving. On the third evening the village elder comes to sit beside him, and Halcyon's diggers start up the path.":"一个巨汉在一座无名山峰上坐了三天，一动不动。第三天傍晚，村里的长老上来坐到他身旁，而哈尔西恩的挖掘队开始沿山路往上爬。",
 "A mountain no map shows. A huge man sits on it like part of the rock. An old man climbs up, puffing, and sits beside him.":"一座地图上没有的山。一个巨汉坐在上面，像是岩石的一部分。一位老人气喘吁吁地爬上来，坐在他身旁。",
 "Comfortable? Three days you've sat on my mountain. The goats have started treating you as furniture.":"坐得舒服吗？你在我的山上坐了三天了。山羊都开始把你当家具了。",
 "On Vharra I stood by the Stones. Here, nothing needs me to stand.":"在瓦拉，我站在立石旁。在这里，没有什么需要我站着。",
 "A rock sits where it was dropped. A mountain chooses where it stands. That's the whole difference, young one.":"石头被扔在哪儿，就待在哪儿。山却会选择自己立在何处。全部的区别就在这里，年轻人。",
 "...And the men with drills. On the path.":"……还有那些拿钻机的人。在山路上。",
 "Halfway up it, by the sound. So. Choose.":"听声音，已经爬到半山腰了。那么。选吧。",
 "Here.":"这里。",
 "Well chosen. The village has a gate, a forge, a ring and a bell. Now it has a mountain, too.":"选得好。村子有一道门、一座熔炉、一个土俵和一口钟。现在，它还有了一座山。",
 "The round man in the ring. He looks at me. Like a bull at a fence.":"土俵上那个圆滚滚的人。他在看我。像公牛盯着栅栏。",
 "That's Taro. He wants to know which of you is harder to move. Let him find out. Slowly, for both your sakes.":"那是太郎。他想知道你们俩谁更难推动。让他去弄明白吧。慢慢来，为了你们俩好。",
 "Nobody has moved Taro out of the Village ring since he was nine years old. Then a mountain walked into the village, and this morning Taro has salted the ring for it.":"太郎从九岁起就没被人推出过村中的土俵。然后一座山走进了村子，今天早上，太郎为它在土俵上撒了盐。",
 "Duel Taro in the Village ring":"在村中土俵与太郎决斗",
 "Salt for the ring. A bow for the bell. Then we learn something, mountain.":"给土俵撒盐。向钟鞠躬。然后我们来弄明白一件事，山。",
 "Learn what?":"弄明白什么？",
 "Which of us the earth would rather keep. I have stood here since I was nine. No one has ever put me past the rope.":"大地更愿意留住我们中的哪一个。我从九岁起就站在这里。从没有人把我推出过绳圈。",
 "I do not want to push you. ...You will keep asking.":"我不想推你。……你会一直问下去的。",
 "Every morning. Politely.":"每天早上都问。客客气气地。",
 "Taro's heel stops on the rope, one grain of salt from out. The whole village is on its feet, and nobody breathes.":"太郎的脚跟停在绳圈上，离出界只差一粒盐。全村人都站了起来，没有一个人敢喘气。",
 "I could not move you a single step. And you stopped one grain short of putting me out. Why?":"我连一步都推不动你。而你停在离把我推出去只差一粒盐的地方。为什么？",
 "The ring is yours. I chose where to stand. Not there.":"土俵是你的。我选了立足之处。不是那里。",
 "That is the most irritating thing anyone has ever said to me. Again tomorrow. I will bow first.":"这是有生以来别人对我说过最气人的话。明天再来。我先鞠躬。",
 "Unmoved. Bow to the ring, mountain. Then step in again.":"纹丝不动。向土俵鞠躬吧，山。然后再进来。",
 "Halcyon's biggest drill chews toward the city under the Ash Dunes while every screen shows the same two stolen faces. Brakk does not follow the shouting. He walks to the drill.":"哈尔西恩最大的钻机啃向灰烬沙丘下的城市，而每块屏幕都在放同样两张被盗的脸。布拉克不跟着叫喊走。他朝钻机走去。",
 "Stop the drill crews at the Meridian":"在子午线拦下钻机队",
 "The Buried Meridian. Halcyon's biggest drill gnaws down toward a city still lying under the sand, its people with it.":"被掩埋的子午线。哈尔西恩最大的钻机向下啃噬，朝着一座仍躺在沙下的城市钻去，城里的人也还在。",
 "The screens do our work. The Sky thinks a Deepline boy gassed its labs. Deepline thinks a Sky girl drilled its tunnels.":"屏幕替我们干活。天空城以为深线的男孩毒害了它的实验室。深线以为天空城的女孩钻了它的隧道。",
 "Kael, Nyra, who cares. Each side blames the other, and nobody watches the Surface. Drill it all.":"凯尔也好，妮拉也罢，谁在乎。两边互相怪罪，没人盯着地表。全给我钻开。",
 "Hollis says: in a shouting room, watch the quiet one. You are quiet. And digging.":"霍利斯说：满屋子人在喊，就看那个不出声的。你们不出声。还在挖。",
 "Dune and Tarek, who have fought over this sand for years, set their feet on one chain. Oda's bell tolls three times. The Surface comes.":"在这片沙地上斗了多年的杜恩和塔里克，把脚踩在同一条锁链上。奥达的钟敲了三下。地表来了。",
 "People under the sand. I stand on top of them.":"沙下有人。我站在他们上面。",
 "Brakk lays two stone hands on the drill-head. It screams. It smokes. It stops.":"布拉克把两只石手按在钻头上。它尖叫。它冒烟。它停了。",
 "It's one man! Why won't it turn? How do I even report this?":"就一个人！它怎么就是转不动？这让我怎么上报？",
 "Report a mountain.":"报一座山。",
 "That night Aldric turns the Proving Hall's knights around, and in Deepline's Pit Arena, Pell is caught in his own Cat's Cradle.":"那一夜，奥德瑞让试炼大厅的骑士们掉转了方向；在深线的深坑竞技场，佩尔被自己的翻花绳缠住了。",
 "Pell names the thing that wore both faces for the Director: Rue, his faceless spy. Kiri's crane flies it to the Crater, and a second Kael runs.":"佩尔供出了替总监戴着两张脸的那个东西：露，他的无面密探。基里的纸鹤把消息送到陨坑，第二个凯尔逃了。",
 "Hollis paints a fourth banner. Four banners start up the Halcyon Spire, toward the Engine Core and whatever it keeps calling.":"霍利斯画下第四面旗帜。四面旗帜开始攀登哈尔西恩尖塔，奔向引擎核心，和它一直在召唤的东西。",
 "Up, then. I will be the step.":"那就上去。我来当台阶。",
 "Every road on the Surface starts on Jax's porch. This morning Halcyon has ridden in to turn it into a checkpoint, and they want Tarn, the post runner, as well.":"地表上的每一条路都从杰克斯的门廊起步。今天早上，哈尔西恩骑马赶来，要把这里改成检查站，还要带走信使塔恩。",
 "The Long Bar at Mile Zero, last stop before the open wastes. Dust on the porch, cold water behind the counter, a piano nobody plays.":"零英里的长吧台，开阔荒原前的最后一站。门廊上落着尘土，吧台后有凉水，还有一架没人弹的钢琴。",
 "Came through the tear with a revolver, a deck of cards and my grandmother laughin' as she dealt me in. Still got all three.":"我穿过裂隙时带着一把左轮、一副牌，还有我奶奶一边发牌带我入局、一边笑出的声音。三样都还在。",
 "Halcyon requisition. These premises are a checkpoint as of now. We'll also be collecting the runner who drinks here.":"哈尔西恩征用。从现在起，此处为检查站。在这儿喝酒的那个信使，我们也要一并带走。",
 "Tarn's out on the road, and this here's a bar. So. You want a drink, partner, or the other thing?":"塔恩在路上跑着呢，这儿是酒吧。所以。伙计，你是想喝一杯，还是想来点别的？",
 "Detain the barkeep.":"拘押酒保。",
 "Other thing it is. Ante up.":"那就是别的了。下注吧。",
 "They'll come back with more, Jax. They always come back with more.":"他们会带更多人回来的，杰克斯。他们总会带更多人回来。",
 "Then the water stays cold and the iron stays warm. Every road starts on this porch. Theirs don't.":"那水就一直凉着，铁就一直热着。每条路都从这道门廊起步。他们的路不算。",
 "Tarn comes up onto the porch with nine towns of dust on him and a Halcyon patrol a mile behind. Jax pours a cold one and checks his cylinder.":"塔恩走上门廊，身上沾着九座镇子的尘土，一支哈尔西恩巡逻队落后他一英里。杰克斯倒了一杯凉的，顺手检查了一下转轮。",
 "Water! Cold! Please! Nine towns since dawn, a checkpoint in every one, and I didn't stop for a single one.":"水！凉的！拜托！天亮以来九座镇子，每座都有检查站，我一座都没停。",
 "Always cold. Sit before you fall. ...Nine towns, with Halcyon on your heels?":"永远是凉的。先坐下，别倒了。……九座镇子，哈尔西恩一路咬着你的脚后跟？",
 "They can't keep up, that's the point. Bad news, though: they kept up as far as your porch. Sorry, Jax.":"他们跟不上，这就是重点。坏消息是：他们一直跟到了你的门廊。对不住，杰克斯。",
 "Don't be. Porch is for meetin' folks. Some get a drink. Some get shown the road.":"别对不住。门廊就是用来见人的。有人喝上一杯。有人被请上路。",
 "I'll take the left side. You take everybody else. Fair split.":"左边归我。其他人全归你。公平分账。",
 "Captain's down. Ha! You missed one, by the way.":"队长倒了。哈！对了，你漏了一个。",
 "Didn't miss. That one was a warnin'. The sixth had the captain's name on it.":"没漏。那一枪是警告。第六发上写着队长的名字。",
 "Same time tomorrow? Keep the water cold.":"明天老时间？把水放凉。",
 "Always is, runner. Mind the road.":"一直是凉的，信使。路上当心。",
 "Yara can drop a rider at a mile and Jax can drop one at ten paces. Before she goes back up to the Sky to settle her own debts, they settle the old bet at his distance.":"雅拉能在一英里外放倒一个骑手，杰克斯能在十步之内放倒一个。在她回天空城清算自己的旧账之前，两人按他的距离来了结那个老赌约。",
 "Ten paces, Jax. Your distance, no wind to read. Win here and the bet's yours. Lose, and it's mine at every range.":"十步，杰克斯。你的距离，没有风要读。在这儿赢了，赌约归你。输了，每个距离都归我。",
 "And loser buys. All this arguin', and not a single drink's changed hands.":"还有，输的人请客。吵了这么久，一杯酒都还没易过手。",
 "Halcyon kept me shooting at a mile for a year. I'm going back up to answer for that. I want this settled first.":"哈尔西恩逼我在一英里外开了一年的枪。我要回天上去为这事做个了结。在那之前，我想先把这件事了了。",
 "Mile's a long way off to need a friend, partner. Ten paces is where they stand.":"伙计，一英里太远了，用不着朋友。十步，才是朋友站的地方。",
 "Fine. I'm buying. Wipe that look off your face.":"行。我请。把你脸上那副表情收起来。",
 "Ten paces or a mile. A good shot doesn't care which. Again?":"十步也好，一英里也罢。好枪手不挑。再来？",
 "Six Halcyon drills turn in the sand over the Buried Meridian, and every screen on the Surface plays the same two faces. Jax has six bullets and a gambler's nose for a stacked deck.":"被掩埋的子午线上方，六台哈尔西恩钻机在沙中转动，地表上每一块屏幕都在放同样的两张脸。杰克斯有六颗子弹，还有一个赌徒闻得出做过手脚的牌的鼻子。",
 "Clear the six drills at the Meridian":"清掉子午线的六台钻机",
 "The Buried Meridian. Six Halcyon drills churn the sand over a city full of the dead, and the Long Bar's regulars have brought rifles.":"被掩埋的子午线。六台哈尔西恩钻机在一座满是死者的城市上方搅动沙子，长吧台的常客们扛着步枪来了。",
 "Screens say a Deepline boy, Kael, gassed the Sky's labs, and a Sky girl, Nyra, ran drills into Deepline. Whose side are we on, Jax?":"屏幕上说，深线的男孩凯尔用毒气熏了天空城的实验室，天空城的女孩妮拉把钻机开进了深线。我们站哪边，杰克斯？",
 "Two faces, one week, both doin' Halcyon's chores. Sky blames the Deep, Deep blames the Sky. That's a stacked deck.":"两张脸，一个星期，干的都是哈尔西恩的杂活。天空城怪深线，深线怪天空城。这是做过手脚的牌。",
 "Dune and Tarek, who'd sooner bury each other, take one chain between them. Up the mountain, Oda's bell rings three times. It never has.":"杜恩和塔里克，恨不得把对方埋了的两个人，合拽起同一条锁链。山上，奥达的钟响了三下。从来没有过。",
 "We're on the side that ain't drillin'. Six drills. Six in the cylinder. I like them odds.":"我们站不钻地的那边。六台钻机。弹巢里六发。这赔率我喜欢。",
 "Six shots crack across the dunes. Six drill-heads grind to a stop, one after another, like a clock running down.":"六声枪响划过沙丘。六个钻头一个接一个嘎吱停转，像一座发条走尽的钟。",
 "Paper crane from the Crater, Jax! The Sky rose on its own lords tonight, and Deepline caught its puppet-master in his own strings!":"陨坑来的纸鹤，杰克斯！今晚天空城反了自家的老爷，深线把它的傀儡师缠在了他自己的线里！",
 "Pell named the liar: Rue, a thing with no face, wearin' whatever the Director told her. A second Kael ran from the Crater.":"佩尔供出了那个骗子：露，一个没有脸的东西，总监叫她戴什么，她就戴什么。第二个凯尔从陨坑逃了。",
 "Told you. Same dealer, both hands. Somebody tell Halcyon the bar is closed.":"早说过了。同一个庄家，发了两手牌。谁去告诉哈尔西恩一声，酒吧打烊了。",
 "Under the Pact's three banners Hollis paints a fourth. Four banners start up the Halcyon Spire, toward the Engine Core.":"在盟约的三面旗帜之下，霍利斯画下第四面。四面旗帜开始攀登哈尔西恩尖塔，奔向引擎核心。",
 "House always wins, they say. Let's go see the house. Before that Engine gets an answer to whatever it's callin'.":"人家说，庄家永远是赢家。那就去会会庄家。赶在那台引擎召唤的东西应声之前。",
 "Tarn once crossed the Vharra steppe on foot in nineteen days. This morning a Halcyon checkpoint stands across the road at Mile Zero, and his bag is full of letters.":"塔恩曾徒步十九天横穿瓦拉草原。今天早上，一个哈尔西恩检查站横在零英里的路上，而他的包里装满了信。",
 "Fight through the Mile Zero checkpoint":"杀穿零英里检查站",
 "Mile Zero, before dawn. A runner jogs on the spot, letters buttoned inside his shirt, his breath smoking in the cold.":"零英里，黎明前。一个信使在原地小跑，信件扣在衬衫里，呼出的气在寒风中冒着白烟。",
 "Vharra's steppe, end to end: forty days on a good horse. I did it in nineteen. On foot. Still annoyed it wasn't eighteen.":"瓦拉草原，从这头到那头：骑一匹好马要四十天。我用了十九天。靠两条腿。到现在还气不是十八天。",
 "Then the sky tore and the tear rolled east at a walk. I stayed ahead of it nine hundred miles, yelling run at every camp. Then I turned and hit it.":"后来天裂了，裂隙以步行的速度向东滚去。我在它前头跑了九百英里，冲每一座营地喊“快跑”。然后我转过身，揍了它一拳。",
 "Halcyon checkpoint. All post is confiscated by order of the Director. Hand over the bag, runner.":"哈尔西恩检查站。奉总监之命，所有邮件一律没收。把包交出来，信使。",
 "Letters don't stop at checkpoints. I'll warm up on you.":"信不会在检查站停下。就拿你们热热身。",
 "Every hit harder than the last. You should've stopped me at the first one.":"每一拳都比上一拳更重。你们早该在第一拳就拦住我。",
 "Road's only cut if I stop. Next town's forty miles. Back by sundown. Sooner, if it's downhill.":"只要我不停，路就断不了。下一座镇子四十英里。日落前回来。要是下坡，还能更早。",
 "On the porch of the Long Bar, Tarn runs into the one man from the steppe he thought the tear had taken: Fenn. Halcyon's hounds have followed Fenn's scent right up the steps.":"在长吧台的门廊上，塔恩撞见了那个他以为已被裂隙吞掉的草原故人：芬恩。哈尔西恩的猎犬循着芬恩的气味，一路追上了台阶。",
 "Hold the Long Bar porch with Fenn":"与芬恩死守长吧台门廊",
 "Tarn. Crossed the whole steppe in nineteen days, and still can't sit for one drink.":"塔恩。十九天跑遍整片草原，还是坐不住喝完一杯。",
 "Fenn! You're alive! I went camp to camp in front of the tear. I never got as far as yours.":"芬恩！你还活着！我在裂隙前头一座营地一座营地地跑，就是没跑到你那儿。",
 "Wolf stood in front of it. I fell. Woke in a Halcyon cage. Chewed my way out.":"狼挡在它前面。我掉了下来。在哈尔西恩的笼子里醒来。啃出了一条路。",
 "That's you all over. Jax! Two waters, cold, and one's for a man who eats cages!":"真是你的作风。杰克斯！两杯水，凉的，其中一杯给一个吃笼子的人！",
 "Later. Halcyon's hounds have my scent. Tracked it to this porch. Sorry.":"待会儿再说。哈尔西恩的猎犬盯上了我的气味，一路追到这道门廊。抱歉。",
 "Like the old days. You hunt, I run rings round them till they're dizzy.":"跟从前一样。你来猎，我绕着它们兜圈子，兜到它们头晕。",
 "The wolf's the one thing I never outran. Don't tell it. It'll get proud.":"狼是我唯一跑不过的东西。别告诉它。它会得意的。",
 "The steppe's gone, Fenn. But a porch and a friend make a decent starting line.":"草原没了，芬恩。可一道门廊加一个朋友，当起跑线也够了。",
 "Ivo has trained before every dawn for years to catch the fastest man on the Surface. Today Tarn has post to deliver, Halcyon on his tail, and no time for this.":"伊沃多年来每天天不亮就训练，只为追上地表上最快的人。今天，塔恩有邮件要送，哈尔西恩跟在后头，他可没工夫陪他玩。",
 "Beat Ivo at Mile Zero":"在零英里击败伊沃",
 "TARN! Before sunup, like I promised! I've done four hundred reps already! Today I catch you!":"塔恩！太阳出来之前，说到做到！我已经练了四百组了！今天我要追上你！",
 "Ivo, I've got a letter for the Crater rim and Halcyon sniffing after the post. I haven't got the time.":"伊沃，我有一封信要送到陨坑边上，哈尔西恩还在嗅着邮路。我没那个工夫。",
 "Then fight me on the way! If I land one, I run the route with you. If I don't, I go back up the mountain. Deal?":"那就边跑边跟我打！要是我打中一下，我就陪你跑完这条线。打不中，我就回山上去。成交？",
 "Deal. Try to stay in sight.":"成交。尽量别跟丢了。",
 "I touched you! Did you feel that? My knuckle touched your vest! That counts!":"我碰到你了！你感觉到没有？我的指节碰到你的背心了！这算数！",
 "...Nearly. That was a nearly.":"……差一点。那是差一点。",
 "From you, nearly is basically a win! How are you still faster? I train before EVERY dawn!":"从你嘴里说出差一点，那基本就算赢了！你怎么还是更快？我可是每天天不亮就练！",
 "GOT YOU! Finally! Up you get, we're running the rest of the route together. I'll set the pace! Kidding. Mostly.":"逮到你了！终于！起来吧，剩下的路我们一起跑。我来定节奏！开玩笑的。大部分是。",
 "Every town on the Surface has seen the same two faces on Halcyon's screens and picked a side. Tarn has one night to tell them all they picked wrong, and one dawn to hold the drills until they come.":"地表上的每一座镇子都在哈尔西恩的屏幕上看到了同样的两张脸，也都选了边。塔恩只有一夜的时间告诉他们选错了，还有一个黎明的时间拖住钻机，等他们赶来。",
 "Hold the Meridian till the towns come":"守住子午线，等各镇赶来",
 "The night before the Drills. Every Halcyon screen on the Surface plays the same two films, over and over.":"钻机之战前夜。地表上每一块哈尔西恩的屏幕都在放同样的两段影像，一遍又一遍。",
 "Deepline's boy Kael gassed the Sky's labs! The Sky's girl Nyra drilled Deepline! Each says the other started it. Pick a side, runner!":"深线的男孩凯尔用毒气熏了天空城的实验室！天空城的女孩妮拉钻了深线！双方都说是对方先动的手。选边站吧，信使！",
 "Same two faces, same week, both doing Halcyon a favour. Faces can be borrowed. Drills can't.":"同样的两张脸，同一个星期，都在帮哈尔西恩的忙。脸可以借。钻机可借不来。",
 "Tarn. The drills reach the Buried Meridian at dawn. Oda will ring three times, which he never has. See that every town knows why.":"塔恩。钻机黎明时就会钻到被掩埋的子午线。奥达会敲三下钟，他从没敲过。让每一座镇子都知道为什么。",
 "Forty towns tonight, the drills at dawn. I've run worse roads, Hollis. Tie my laces for luck.":"今夜四十座镇子，黎明钻机就到。比这更糟的路我也跑过，霍利斯。帮我系个鞋带，讨个好运。",
 "Dawn. Tarn reaches the Meridian first, beside Dune and Tarek on their one shared chain. The drills are already turning.":"黎明。塔恩第一个赶到子午线，站在杜恩和塔里克身边，他们共握着一条锁链。钻机已经在转了。",
 "By noon the dunes are full: forty towns with picks and rifles, and the bell still rolling off the mountain. The drill line breaks.":"到正午，沙丘上挤满了人：四十座镇子的人扛着镐和步枪赶来，钟声还在从山上滚滚而下。钻机阵线崩溃了。",
 "Forty towns in one night, and every one of them came. My legs want a word with me.":"一夜四十座镇子，每一座都来了。我的腿想跟我好好谈谈。",
 "That same night Aldric turns the Sky's knights around, and in Deepline's Pit Arena the masked sensei Pell is caught in his own strings.":"同一夜，奥德瑞让天空城的骑士们掉转了方向；在深线的深坑竞技场，戴面具的师父佩尔被自己的丝线缠住了。",
 "Pell names the one who wore both faces for the Director: Rue. Kiri's paper crane flies it to the Crater. A second Kael there runs.":"佩尔供出了替总监戴着两张脸的人：露。基里的纸鹤把消息送到陨坑。那里的第二个凯尔逃了。",
 "Water first, runner. Cold. Then carry that name up the Spire with everybody else.":"先喝水，信使。凉的。然后把这个名字，和大伙儿一起带上尖塔。",
 "Hollis paints a fourth banner under the Pact's three. Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core.":"在盟约的三面旗帜之下，霍利斯画下第四面。四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，奔向引擎核心。",
 "Last leg's straight up. Good. Before that Engine finishes calling whatever it's calling.":"最后一段是直上直下。好。赶在那台引擎把它召唤的东西召来之前。",
 "Halcyon built the Ice House to hold anything, and brews sleeping draughts strong enough for a bear. The last bear of the north has stopped drinking them.":"哈尔西恩造冰窖，是为了关住一切；它酿的安眠药剂，烈得能放倒一头熊。北方最后一头熊，已经不喝了。",
 "Smash your way out of the Ice House":"砸开冰窖杀出去",
 "Halcyon's Ice House. Frost on the pipes, walls a yard thick, and a Subject who will not stay asleep.":"哈尔西恩的冰窖。管道结霜，墙厚一码，还有一个怎么也不肯一直睡着的实验体。",
 "Subject's awake again! Double the dose! It's a bear, it's a man, it's... why is it both?":"实验体又醒了！剂量加倍！是熊，是人，是……怎么两个都是？",
 "North Vharra. Bears that walked like men. Men that fought like bears. I am the last of either.":"北瓦拉。像人一样行走的熊。像熊一样战斗的人。我是这两者中最后一个。",
 "Thick walls. Snow was deeper. Move.":"墙厚。雪更深。让开。",
 "The Ice House wall now has a hole in it the shape of a very large, very annoyed man.":"冰窖的墙上如今多了一个洞，形状像一个非常魁梧、非常恼火的人。",
 "North. Nobody goes there. Nobody talks there. Good.":"北方。没人去那儿。没人在那儿说话。好。",
 "Send more. They learn why nobody follows twice.":"再派人来。他们会明白，为什么没人跟第二次。",
 "For thirty days a boy has followed an old bear across the northern snow, talking the whole way. Today Halcyon's catchers come up the slope behind them both.":"一连三十天，一个男孩跟着一头老熊穿越北方雪原，嘴巴一路没停过。今天，哈尔西恩的捕手从山坡上追了上来。",
 "Hold the northern rim with Kova":"与科瓦死守北境边缘",
 "The northern rim. Wind, snow, and for the thirtieth day running, a boy hopping from one of the bear's footprints to the next.":"北境边缘。风，雪，还有连续第三十天，一个男孩从熊的一个脚印蹦到下一个脚印。",
 "Day thirty! Teach me the bear! Tiger, got it. Eagle, got it. Tortoise, got it. Bear, NOT got it. Please please please!":"第三十天！教我熊吧！老虎，会了。雄鹰，会了。乌龟，会了。熊，还不会。求你求你求你了！",
 "Hn. You talk more than the wind.":"哼。你的话比风还多。",
 "He's talked since the Glowwild. Teach him, Brann. Buy the quiet back.":"他打从荧野起就没停过嘴。教他吧，布兰。把清静买回来。",
 "Catchers on the slope. Fight beside me. No words, boy. Not one. Then the bear.":"捕手上山坡了。跟我并肩打。不许说话，孩子。一个字都不许。然后教你熊。",
 "Deal! I mean. (nods very, very hard)":"成交！我是说。（拼命、拼命点头）",
 "Good. The bear is quiet. Until it is not. Lesson one.":"很好。熊是安静的。直到它不再安静。第一课。",
 "Lesson two. Longer.":"第二课。更久。",
 "Isolde says winter answers to her. Brann has asked her up to the northern rim to say so to his face, in his snow.":"伊索德说寒冬听命于她。布兰请她到北境边缘来，在他的雪地里，当着他的面再说一遍。",
 "Duel Isolde on the northern rim":"在北境边缘与伊索德决斗",
 "You asked me north to say it to your face. Very well. Winter answers to me.":"你请我北上，当面说给你听。那好。寒冬听命于我。",
 "Winter answers to nobody. It listens. To me.":"寒冬不听命于任何人。它只是倾听。倾听我。",
 "Halcyon kept me a year in a vault colder than your mountain. I never minded the cold. I minded the glass.":"哈尔西恩把我关在一个比你的山还冷的冷库里一年。我从不在乎冷。我在乎的是那层玻璃。",
 "No glass here. Snow. Say it again, bird-woman. See who the snow listens to.":"这里没有玻璃。只有雪。再说一遍，养鸟的女人。看看雪听谁的。",
 "Shall I say it again? Slower, for the bear?":"要我再说一遍吗？说慢点，好让熊听得懂？",
 "Today is enough. Tea. Your bird can sit by the window.":"今天够了。喝茶。你的鸟可以坐在窗边。",
 "She is made of ice. She has no use for a window.":"她是冰做的。她用不着窗户。",
 "Everyone wants a window.":"谁都想要一扇窗。",
 "Hush now. Even bears sleep through the winter. Hood that temper and come again.":"嘘，安静。熊也会睡过整个冬天。给你的脾气戴上头罩，下次再来。",
 "The screens swear a boy from Deepline poisoned the Sky. Fenn swears that boy is kin. Brann believes the wolf, and brings the north down to the Buried Meridian.":"屏幕信誓旦旦地说，一个深线男孩毒害了天空城。芬恩发誓那男孩是他的自家人。布兰信狼，把北方带下山，带到了被掩埋的子午线。",
 "Maul the drill crews at the Meridian":"在子午线撕碎钻机队",
 "The Buried Meridian. Halcyon's drills grind like teeth into a city of the dead. All night the runner went town to town, shouting.":"被掩埋的子午线。哈尔西恩的钻机像牙齿一样碾进一座死者之城。那个信使跑了一整夜，一座镇子一座镇子地喊。",
 "Old bear! The screens! Kael, Deepline boy, gassed the Sky! Nyra, Sky girl, drilled Deepline! Now everybody hates everybody! Rawr!":"老熊！屏幕！凯尔，深线男孩，毒害了天空城！妮拉，天空城女孩，钻了深线！现在谁都恨谁！嗷呜！",
 "Hn. Each blames the other. Halcyon drills.":"哼。互相怪罪。哈尔西恩在钻。",
 "Fenn says the boy is his brother. I believe the wolf. Faces lie. Snow does not.":"芬恩说那男孩是他弟弟。我信狼。脸会说谎。雪不会。",
 "Dune and Tarek take one chain between them. From the mountain, Oda's bell rings three times. In ninety-six years it never has.":"杜恩和塔里克合拽一条锁链。山上，奥达的钟响了三下。九十六年来，从没响过三下。",
 "North does not sit still for drills. North comes south.":"北方不会坐看钻机。北方南下。",
 "Snow falls on the Ash Dunes for the first time in a hundred years. The drill crews run from it, slipping, and do not come back.":"百年来头一回，雪落在了灰烬沙丘上。钻机工人们在雪里连滚带滑地逃窜，再也没回来。",
 "Not winter. A bear in a bad mood.":"不是冬天。是一头心情不好的熊。",
 "That night Aldric turns the Sky's knights around, and in Deepline's Pit Arena the masked Pell is caught in his own strings.":"那一夜，奥德瑞让天空城的骑士们掉转了方向；在深线的深坑竞技场，戴面具的佩尔被自己的丝线缠住了。",
 "Can I talk now? One faceless thing wore both faces! Rue! Pell said! Kiri's crane told the Crater and the fake Kael RAN! I KNEW it!":"我现在能说话了吗？一个没脸的东西戴了两张脸！露！佩尔说的！基里的纸鹤告诉了陨坑，那个假凯尔就逃了！我就知道！",
 "Hollis paints a fourth banner for the Hidden Clans. Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core, and whatever it has been calling.":"霍利斯为隐秘氏族画下第四面旗帜。四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，奔向引擎核心，和它一直在召唤的东西。",
 "Up. Quietly.":"上去。安静点。",
 "Under the Ash Dunes lies a city that went down in the Ashfall War with its people still inside. Above it, patient as the sand, stands the one who keeps them.":"灰烬沙丘之下，埋着一座在落灰战争中连同居民一起沉没的城市。在它之上，如沙一般耐心地，站着守护他们的那一位。",
 "Drive the raiders off the Meridian":"把掠夺者赶出子午线",
 "The Ash Dunes at dusk. Wind combs the ridges flat. Underneath lies the Buried Meridian, its people still at home.":"黄昏的灰烬沙丘。风把沙脊梳平。底下是被掩埋的子午线，城里的人还在家中。",
 "We are still here. Ninety-six years under the sand, and still here. I keep the door.":"我们还在这里。在沙下九十六年，还在这里。我守着门。",
 "Some say I was born down there. Some say I am the sand they lie in, standing up. We correct neither.":"有人说我生在下面。有人说我是他们长眠其中的沙，站了起来。两种说法，我们都不纠正。",
 "Lanterns crest the ridge: Tarek's chain raiders, with shovels, carts and Halcyon's money.":"灯笼越过沙脊：塔里克的锁链掠夺者，带着铁锹、推车和哈尔西恩的钱。",
 "Diggers. Again. No one carries our dead away to be weighed and sold.":"挖掘的人。又来了。谁也别想把我们的死者运走，称斤论两地卖掉。",
 "Go home, raiders. The sand has your shovels now. It keeps what it is given.":"回家去吧，掠夺者。你们的铁锹现在归沙子了。沙子会留住给它的东西。",
 "On the far ridge a chain rattles. Tarek is watching, as he always does, from just out of reach.":"远处的沙脊上，一条锁链哗啦作响。塔里克在看着，一如既往，就在够不着的地方。",
 "Next year, chain-man. And the year after. We have waited longer than you have lived.":"明年见，锁链人。还有后年。我们等过的时间，比你活过的还长。",
 "On the longest night of every year an old man walks into the desert with tea Dune never drinks. This year Halcyon's survey crews have learned to work at night.":"每年最长的那一夜，都有一位老人带着杜恩从不喝的茶走进沙漠。今年，哈尔西恩的勘测队学会了在夜里干活。",
 "Hold the dunes with Hollis till dawn":"与霍利斯守住沙丘直到黎明",
 "Midwinter, the year's longest dark. Stars like spilled salt. An old man crunches over the dunes with a kettle and two cups.":"冬至，一年中最长的黑夜。星星像撒了一地的盐。一位老人提着一壶茶、两只杯子，嘎吱嘎吱地踩过沙丘。",
 "Evening, Dune. Brought tea. You won't drink yours, so I'll drink it for you. Same as every year.":"晚上好，杜恩。带了茶。你那杯你不会喝，我就替你喝了。跟每年一样。",
 "Every year you climb down your mountain for this. Why?":"每年你都为这个从山上下来。为什么？",
 "Because it's the longest night, and nobody should sit through it alone. Not even a desert.":"因为这是最长的一夜，谁都不该独自熬过它。哪怕是一片沙漠。",
 "...We are not alone tonight. Halcyon's survey crews come in the dark now. They measure us for the drill.":"……今夜我们并不孤单。哈尔西恩的勘测队现在都在夜里来。他们在为钻机丈量我们。",
 "Then we'll stand up for a bit, and sit back down after. The night's long enough for both.":"那我们就站起来一会儿，然后再坐回去。这一夜够长，两件事都来得及。",
 "There. Tea's gone stone cold. Worth every sip.":"好了。茶都凉透了。每一口都值。",
 "Every year. It was never the sand I walked out here to see.":"每一年。我走到这里来看的，从来就不是沙子。",
 "For six years Tarek has dug at the Buried Meridian and Dune has swallowed his chains. Now Halcyon is paying triple for what lies deepest, and for the first time she walks out to meet him.":"六年来，塔里克一直在挖被掩埋的子午线，杜恩一直在吞他的锁链。如今哈尔西恩为最深处的东西开出三倍价钱，她第一次主动走出去迎他。",
 "Duel Tarek over the buried city":"在被埋之城上方与塔里克决斗",
 "Dune. Six years my crew's worked this ground. How many of my chains have you swallowed? I stopped counting.":"杜恩。我的人在这片地上干了六年。我的锁链被你吞了多少条？我都不数了。",
 "Thirty-one. You stopped counting. We did not. They lie down there with our people.":"三十一条。你不数了。我们一直在数。它们和我们的族人一起躺在下面。",
 "Halcyon's paying triple for the deep levels now. One more fight and the city's open. Last one, I promise.":"哈尔西恩现在为深层开三倍价钱。再打一场，这座城就开了。最后一场，我保证。",
 "You never walk to anyone. You wait, and reel them in. Today we walk to you.":"你从不走向任何人。你只是等着，把人拽过来。今天，我们走向你。",
 "...Thirty-two. You really do keep count.":"……三十二条。你还真一直在数。",
 "On the horizon behind the raiders' camp, something huge with Halcyon's sun painted on its flank begins to turn.":"在掠夺者营地后方的地平线上，某个侧面漆着哈尔西恩太阳标志的庞然大物开始转动。",
 "Triple pay. So that's why. They're done buying. They've brought drills. They'll take the whole city in one bite.":"三倍价钱。原来是这么回事。他们不打算再买了。他们把钻机开来了。他们要一口吞下整座城。",
 "Then whoever stands on top of it goes under too. You. Your crew. Me. Buried twice.":"那么站在上面的人也会一起沉下去。你。你的人。我。被埋两次。",
 "Reeled in. Thirty-one chains, Dune, and it turns out I only ever needed the one.":"收线了。三十一条锁链，杜恩，结果我只需要那一条。",
 "Halcyon's drills are sinking through the Buried Meridian on their way down to Deepline, and the three layers are too busy blaming each other to stop them. Dune cannot hold the city alone.":"哈尔西恩的钻机正穿过被掩埋的子午线，一路钻向深线，而三层只顾着互相指责，没空去拦。杜恩一个人守不住这座城。",
 "Beat back the drills with Tarek":"与塔里克一起击退钻机",
 "The same night, in all three layers, every screen plays two films, over and over.":"同一夜，三层里的每一块屏幕都在放两段影像，一遍又一遍。",
 "In one, Kael, a white-haired Deepline kid, opens the Core Sump's vents onto the Sky's labs. In the other, Nyra, the Sky's singer, leads drills into Deepline.":"一段里，深线的白发少年凯尔打开核心污水坑的排气口，对准天空城的实验室。另一段里，天空城的歌者妮拉领着钻机钻进深线。",
 "The Sky says Deepline struck first. Deepline says the Sky did. And the drills from that film are HERE. Is the singer with them?":"天空城说深线先动的手。深线说是天空城。而影像里那些钻机就在这儿。那个歌者也跟着来了吗？",
 "A face is a coat. Anyone can wear it. The sand knows whose drills these are. Halcyon's, as they always were.":"脸是一件外衣。谁都能穿。沙子知道这些钻机是谁的。哈尔西恩的，一直都是。",
 "From the mountain, the bell of the Last Toll rings three times. In ninety-six years Oda has never rung it more than once.":"山上，终钟寺的钟响了三下。九十六年来，奥达从没敲过一下以上。",
 "A man walks out across the sand with no sickle and no chain on his arm. Tarek, holding out one end of his chain.":"一个男人走过沙地，手里没有镰刀，臂上也没缠锁链。是塔里克，递出他锁链的一端。",
 "They'll bury everyone, Dune. You, me, the dead, my crew. Take it. One end each.":"他们会把所有人都埋了，杜恩。你，我，死者，我的人。拿着。一人一端。",
 "Sand and chain together. The crews are reeled in, the drills sink into the dunes they came to dig, and the whole Surface stands on the ridge.":"沙与锁链齐出。钻机工人被一一拽了回来，钻机沉进了它们本想挖开的沙丘，整个地表都站在了沙脊上。",
 "Word from the Crater, on one of Kiri's paper cranes. Pell got caught in the Pit and gave up a name. Rue. One faceless thing, wearing both faces.":"陨坑传来消息，用的是基里的纸鹤。佩尔在深坑被逮住，供出了一个名字。露。一个没有脸的东西，戴着两张脸。",
 "Kael and the singer never struck anyone. The Director sent a mask, and the layers fought it. We remember masks.":"凯尔和那个歌者从没伤过任何人。是总监派来一张面具，各层跟它打了起来。我们记得面具。",
 "Hollis writes a fourth banner under the Pact's three. Four banners start up the Halcyon Spire from four sides, toward the Engine Core.":"在盟约的三面旗帜之下，霍利斯写下第四面。四面旗帜从四个方向攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，奔向引擎核心。",
 "Something under that Spire is calling. The sand hums with it. Climb, before it is answered.":"那座尖塔底下有东西在召唤。沙子跟着它嗡嗡作响。爬吧，在它得到回应之前。",
 "The Hidden Village sits on a mountain nobody ever charted, and its elder hasn't shifted from his bench all morning. Halcyon is about to mistake that for weakness.":"隐秘之村坐落在一座从未被人绘入地图的山上，村里的长老一上午都没从长凳上挪过窝。哈尔西恩正要把这误当成软弱。",
 "Drive Halcyon off the mountain":"把哈尔西恩赶下山",
 "A mountain no map shows. Smoke from the forge, frost on the terraces, and an old man on a bench who has not moved since breakfast.":"一座地图上没有的山。熔炉冒着烟，梯田结着霜，长凳上一位老人从早饭后就没动过。",
 "I remember the night after the Ashfall War. The rich went up, the poor went down, and a few stubborn families swore to live in all three.":"我记得落灰战争之后的那一夜。富人上去了，穷人下去了，还有几户倔强的人家发誓，要同时活在三层里。",
 "I wrote the Pact by firelight. Oda rang the bell over it. Ninety-six years on, we still argue about the second line.":"我借着火光写下了盟约。奥达在它上面敲响了钟。九十六年过去，我们还在争第二句。",
 "Halcyon survey, Section Four. This mountain appears on no map, which makes it company property. Remove the elderly occupant.":"哈尔西恩勘测队，第四区。此山不见于任何地图，因此属于公司财产。清除年迈的占用者。",
 "Standing still gathers Stillness, son. And I've been sitting on this bench a very long time.":"静立不动会积攒静心，孩子。而我在这条长凳上已经坐了很久很久了。",
 "There. Now the mountain's on somebody's map. Mine. It has a little drawing of you lot rolling down it.":"好了。现在这座山上了某人的地图。我的。上面还画着你们这伙人滚下山的小图。",
 "Down the path, Oda's bell rings once: his way of saying well done.":"山路下方，奥达的钟响了一下：这是他在说“干得好”。",
 "Don't gloat, you old bell. You'd have rung it either way.":"别得意，你这口老钟。不管怎样你都会敲的。",
 "For a year a boy has waited at the village gate, because an old man told him to. The old man has run out of excuses, and Halcyon is on the path.":"一年来，一个男孩一直守在村门口，因为一位老人叫他等。这位老人已经找不出借口了，而哈尔西恩正走在山路上。",
 "Hold the Village gate with Ivo":"与伊沃守住村门",
 "Dawn at the Hidden Village. A boy of fourteen sits by the gate with frost on his knees, as he has every dawn for a year.":"隐秘之村的黎明。一个十四岁的男孩坐在门边，膝上结着霜，一年来每个黎明都是如此。",
 "Three hundred and sixty-five! A whole year of sunrises, Elder! You said wait for the sunrise. I waited!":"三百六十五！整整一年的日出，长老！您说等日出。我等了！",
 "So you did. Most leave after a week. Brakk sat on my mountain three days, and I thought that was patience.":"你确实等了。大多数人一个星期就走了。布拉克在我的山上坐了三天，我还以为那就叫耐心。",
 "Teach me. Please. I'll do the reps. All of them. Twice.":"教我吧。求您了。那些练习我都做。全部。做两遍。",
 "Lesson one, then. Halcyon's coming up the path. Start before they're ready, and don't stop till it's done.":"那么，第一课。哈尔西恩正上山来。在他们准备好之前动手，做完之前别停。",
 "Was that it? The lesson? I just hit them really, really fast.":"就这样？这就是那一课？我只是打得特别、特别快而已。",
 "Good. So will I. Somebody has to keep an eye on him, and you snore.":"好。我也会。总得有人盯着他，而你打呼噜。",
 "For ninety-six years two old men have argued over one line of the Pact, one with words and one with a bell. Halcyon is taking children again, and today the argument comes to fists.":"九十六年来，两位老人为盟约中的一句话争论不休，一个用言语，一个用钟声。哈尔西恩又开始抓孩子了，今天，这场争论终于动了拳头。",
 "Duel Oda at the Last Toll":"在终钟寺与奥达决斗",
 "The Temple of the Last Toll. Two old men, one bell, and an argument over one line, ninety-six years long.":"终钟寺。两位老人，一口钟，为一句话争了九十六年。",
 "The second line says the Clans keep the layers from killing each other. Between them, Oda. It says nothing about joining a war.":"第二句说，诸氏族要让各层不至于互相残杀。站在它们中间，奥达。可没说要加入一场战争。",
 "Oda rings the bell. Once. Hard enough to shake dust from the rafters.":"奥达敲了一下钟。只一下。重得把房梁上的灰都震了下来。",
 "I know what Halcyon does. I know they take children for their tanks. ...I know about Coda, old friend. Your little dancer.":"我知道哈尔西恩在干什么。我知道他们抓孩子去填他们的缸。……我知道寇妲的事，老朋友。你的小舞者。",
 "The bell rings again, quieter. Then Oda sets it down on the step, and lifts his fists.":"钟又响了一声，轻了些。然后奥达把它放在台阶上，举起了拳头。",
 "Ninety-six years of arguing with a bell. Fine. Fists, then. Whoever's standing reads the line.":"跟一口钟争了九十六年。行。那就用拳头。谁还站着，谁来念那句话。",
 "Ha. Still got it. ...So have you. My jaw's ringing louder than your bell.":"哈。宝刀未老。……你也是。我的下巴比你的钟响得还厉害。",
 "Oda sits in the temple doorway, smiling, and waits. Of the two of them, he was always the better at waiting.":"奥达坐在寺门口，微笑着，等着。他们两个当中，他一向更擅长等待。",
 "All right. We go down the mountain. We stand with them, not only between them. You win the line. I win the fight.":"好吧。我们下山。我们和他们站在一起，而不只是站在他们中间。那句话算你赢。这一架算我赢。",
 "The bell tolls over Hollis, flat on his back on the temple floor. It sounds exactly like I told you so.":"钟声在平躺于寺庙地板上的霍利斯头顶响起。听起来分明就是“我早跟你说过”。",
 "Every screen in the three layers says the other side struck first. Halcyon's drills are grinding down through the Buried Meridian, and for once the Surface will not stand between: it will stand together.":"三层里的每一块屏幕都说是对方先动的手。哈尔西恩的钻机正碾穿被掩埋的子午线，而这一回，地表不打算站在中间：它要站在一起。",
 "Beat back the drills at the Meridian":"在子午线击退钻机",
 "The Buried Meridian, under a sky of drill smoke. Halcyon's rigs are boring through the dead city on their way down to Deepline.":"被掩埋的子午线，头顶是钻机的浓烟。哈尔西恩的钻塔正钻穿那座死城，一路往深线钻去。",
 "The Sky's films show Kael, Deepline's white-haired kid, opening the Core Sump's vents on their labs. Deepline's show Nyra, the Sky's singer, leading drills in.":"天空城的影像里，深线的白发小子凯尔打开核心污水坑的排气口，对准他们的实验室。深线的影像里，天空城的歌者妮拉领着钻机钻进来。",
 "So each side blames the other, and nobody asks whose drills they are. When everyone shouts, watch who stays quiet. Halcyon is very quiet.":"所以双方互相怪罪，没人问这些钻机是谁的。所有人都在喊的时候，要看谁不出声。哈尔西恩就很安静。",
 "On the mountain, Oda's bell rings three times. In ninety-six years he has never rung it more than once.":"山上，奥达的钟响了三下。九十六年来，他从没敲过一下以上。",
 "Three. ...Oh, old friend. Everyone! To the drills! Dune and Tarek have the chain. The rest of you have me.":"三下。……哦，老朋友。所有人！去钻机那儿！杜恩和塔里克拿着锁链。剩下的人有我。",
 "The last rig topples into the sand. In the Sky the wards have risen; in the Pit, the Lantern Cell has caught Pell in his own strings.":"最后一座钻塔倒进沙里。在天空城，病区已经揭竿而起；在深坑，灯笼小队用佩尔自己的丝线把他缠住了。",
 "Pell names the face-thief: Rue, his faceless spy, wearing Kael and Nyra on the Director's orders. Kiri's paper crane flies the name to the Crater.":"佩尔供出了窃脸者：露，他的无面密探，奉总监之命戴上了凯尔和妮拉的脸。基里的纸鹤把这个名字送到了陨坑。",
 "So the layers were never at war. Somebody needed them to be. Bring me the Pact, and a brush. And something to lean on.":"这么说，各层从来就没在打仗。是有人需要它们打。把盟约拿来，再拿支毛笔。再给我个能靠的东西。",
 "Under the Pact's three banners Hollis writes a fourth: the Hidden Clans, who live in all of them. By dawn four banners climb the Halcyon Spire.":"在盟约的三面旗帜之下，霍利斯写下第四面：隐秘氏族，他们活在每一层里。天亮时，四面旗帜攀上了哈尔西恩尖塔。",
 "The Engine Core's at the top, and the man who sold us the masks. Whatever that Engine's calling, I'd like it switched off before anything answers.":"引擎核心就在顶上，还有卖给我们面具的那个人。不管那台引擎在召唤什么，我都希望在任何东西应声之前把它关掉。",
 "Up we go, everyone. Mind your knees. It's a long way, and I'm not carrying anybody.":"都上去吧，各位。当心膝盖。路很长，我谁也不背。",
 "The Glowwild glows because Halcyon poisoned it. Ume has grown a garden in it, lovely and lethal in equal measure, and Halcyon wants every leaf of it in jars.":"荧野之所以发光，是因为哈尔西恩毒害了它。梅在那里种出了一座花园，美丽与致命各占一半，而哈尔西恩想把它的每一片叶子都装进罐子。",
 "Weed the collectors out of the garden":"把采集队从花园里除掉",
 "The Glowwild: a forest lit violet and green by the waste Halcyon pours into it. At its heart, the loveliest garden on the Surface.":"荧野：一座被哈尔西恩倾倒的废料映成紫绿两色的森林。在它的中心，是地表上最美的花园。",
 "If the forest had to be poison, it was going to be beautiful poison. That was my first rule.":"既然森林非得是毒，那就该是美丽的毒。这是我的第一条规矩。",
 "My second rule is simpler. Touch none of it. Not the bluebells, not the moonmoss, and especially not the nice pink ones.":"第二条规矩更简单。一样都别碰。蓝铃花别碰，月苔别碰，尤其是那些好看的粉色的，别碰。",
 "Collection Team Six. Halcyon owns whatever grows on Halcyon's runoff. We're taking samples. All of them.":"第六采集队。长在哈尔西恩废水上的东西，都归哈尔西恩所有。我们来取样本。全部。",
 "Oh, help yourselves! Start with the pretty ones.":"哦，请便！从漂亮的开始吧。",
 "Spore Puff, Vine Snap, and a Corpse Flower for dessert. They went straight for the pink ones. They always do.":"孢子云、藤鞭，饭后再来一朵尸花。他们直奔那些粉色的去了。每次都是。",
 "Bees drift in over the flowers, thin and starving, humming like a fever. Ume holds out a palm of nectar.":"蜜蜂飘进花丛，瘦弱饥饿，嗡嗡声像发烧时的呓语。梅伸出一掌花蜜。",
 "Elixa, Halcyon's chief alchemist, comes down the Skylift for spores, for a cure that might wake the Husks. Ume always asks what for. The collectors who followed Elixa down are not asked anything.":"哈尔西恩的首席炼金师艾莉克莎乘天梯下来取孢子，要做一种也许能唤醒空壳的解药。梅总要问拿去做什么。跟着艾莉克莎下来的采集队，可没人问他们什么。",
 "Ume. Spores again, please. For the cure. I think I can wake a Husk, one of the grey ones the Engine leaves behind.":"梅。又来要孢子了，拜托。为了解药。我觉得我能唤醒一个空壳，就是引擎留下的那些灰色的人。",
 "I always ask what for. ...Wake one? Elixa, sweetheart, you mixed the serums that made them.":"我总要问拿去做什么。……唤醒一个？艾莉克莎，亲爱的，那些让他们变成空壳的血清，就是你调的。",
 "I did. That is the what-for. Also, a variable I failed to control: Halcyon followed me down. Collectors, by the poison oaks.":"是我调的。这就是拿去做什么。另外，还有一个我没控制住的变量：哈尔西恩跟着我下来了。采集队，就在毒橡树那边。",
 "Then take two jars. They want everything bottled. You throw flasks, I grow trouble. A garden needs both.":"那就拿两罐。他们什么都想装瓶。你扔药瓶，我种麻烦。花园两样都需要。",
 "Red, blue, green, and your spores on top. Fascinating rash. I'm writing it down. They'll be scratching for a month.":"红的、蓝的、绿的，再撒上你的孢子。好迷人的疹子。我记下来了。他们得挠上一个月。",
 "Two months. I did put up a sign about the oaks. It's very small. It's under the oaks.":"两个月。我在橡树那儿立了块牌子。很小。就在橡树底下。",
 "Bring me that, and you can have my Corpse Flower. Well. A cutting. Handled from a distance.":"把那个带给我，我就把尸花给你。嗯。一截插枝。离远点拿。",
 "Every spring Thorne, who keeps a garden of bones in the catacombs under Deepline, sends cuttings with a polite note. This spring he comes himself, carrying shears, because Ume's roots are dripping on his dead.":"索恩在深线地下的墓穴里照料一座白骨花园，每年春天都会寄来插枝，附上一张客气的便条。今年春天他亲自来了，还带着剪刀，因为梅的根正往他的死者身上滴东西。",
 "Duel Thorne in the Glowwild":"在荧野与索恩决斗",
 "Good evening, Ume. Cuttings, as every spring. And shears, this time. Do forgive me. I did knock.":"晚上好，梅。插枝，跟每年春天一样。这回还带了剪刀。请务必见谅。我敲过门了。",
 "Thorne! Shears, in my garden? That's either very brave or very rude, and you've never once been rude.":"索恩！在我的花园里带剪刀？这要么是非常勇敢，要么是非常无礼，而你从来没无礼过一次。",
 "Your roots have broken through my catacomb ceiling, and something drips from them onto my dead. I have come to prune.":"你的根穿透了我地下墓穴的顶棚，有东西从根上滴下来，落在我的死者身上。我是来修剪的。",
 "Then let us settle it as gardeners do. Whatever is still standing at the end of the season, grows.":"那就让我们以园丁的方式了结吧。季末还立着的，就继续生长。",
 "Achoo. ...Your pollen. You have won, my dear, and I shall be sneezing for a week.":"阿嚏。……你的花粉。你赢了，亲爱的，而我得打上一个星期的喷嚏。",
 "Two weeks. I bred it stronger, just for you. Now, the dripping: we follow it back to Halcyon's dump pipe. Together.":"两个星期。我特意为你把它培育得更强了。好了，说回滴水的事：我们顺着它找到哈尔西恩的排污管。一起去。",
 "A joint pruning. How perfectly delightful. Achoo. Do bring the shears.":"联合修剪。真是再妙不过了。阿嚏。剪刀务必带上。",
 "The three layers are at each other's throats over two films, and Halcyon's drill camp on the Meridian is pumping its waste straight into the Glowwild. Ume decides to send it back.":"三层为了两段影像斗得你死我活，而哈尔西恩在子午线的钻机营地正把废料直接排进荧野。梅决定原样奉还。",
 "Overrun the drill camp at the Meridian":"攻占子午线的钻机营地",
 "The Drills at the Buried Meridian. Halcyon's camp squats on the Glowwild's edge, its pipes coughing black sludge into the roots.":"被掩埋的子午线的钻机之战。哈尔西恩的营地盘踞在荧野边缘，管道把黑色淤泥咳进树根里。",
 "Up top, the films show a Deepline boy, Kael, opening vents on the Sky's labs. Down below, they show the Sky's singer, Nyra, drilling the tunnels.":"上面，影像里是一个深线男孩，凯尔，打开排气口对准天空城的实验室。下面，影像里是天空城的歌者妮拉，在钻隧道。",
 "So each side blames the other. Pretty stories. Poisonous. Someone grafted the wrong face onto the wrong stem, and I know a graft when I see one.":"所以双方互相怪罪。好听的故事。有毒。有人把错误的脸嫁接到了错误的茎上。嫁接的手法，我一眼就看得出来。",
 "From the mountain the bell of the Last Toll rings three times. All across the Surface, people put down their tools and come.":"山上，终钟寺的钟响了三下。整个地表，人们放下手里的工具，赶了过来。",
 "Oda's never rung three. Well then. Halcyon's been feeding my forest for years. Time it fed them back.":"奥达从没敲过三下。好吧。哈尔西恩喂了我的森林这么多年。该让它反过来喂喂他们了。",
 "The whole Glowwild blooms at once over the camp: spores like snow, vines like cables, flowers taller than the rigs.":"整片荧野在营地上同时盛放：孢子如雪，藤蔓如缆，花朵高过钻塔。",
 "Don't touch anything! Nobody touch ANYTHING!":"什么都别碰！谁都不许碰任何东西！",
 "Good advice. A season late.":"好建议。晚了一季。",
 "By nightfall, word from the Crater: caught in the Pit, Pell named the face-thief. Rue, his faceless spy, wearing both faces for the Director.":"入夜时，陨坑传来消息：在深坑被逮住的佩尔，供出了窃脸者。露，他的无面密探，替总监戴着两张脸。",
 "A graft, like I said. Now Hollis has painted a fourth banner, and everyone's climbing the Halcyon Spire for the Engine Core at the top.":"嫁接，跟我说的一样。现在霍利斯画下了第四面旗帜，大家都在攀登哈尔西恩尖塔，奔向顶上的引擎核心。",
 "I'm bringing seeds. Whatever that Engine's been calling down, it can meet my nastiest perennial first.":"我要带上种子。不管那台引擎一直在召唤什么下来，都得先见识见识我最毒的多年生植物。",
 "A tiger raised him in the mornings, an eagle by noon, a tortoise by night. Now Halcyon has come into the Glowwild with nets, and Kova can't decide which to be first.":"清晨养他的是老虎，正午是鹰，入夜是龟。如今哈尔西恩带着网闯进了荧野，科瓦拿不定主意先当哪一个。",
 "The Glowwild at dawn, blue light leaking from the leaves. A Halcyon party is stringing snares between the trees.":"黎明的荧野，蓝光从树叶间渗出。一队哈尔西恩的人正在树与树之间拉起套索。",
 "Tiger raised me mornings. Eagle, noons. Tortoise, nights. Never learned to be just one. Why would you?":"早上老虎养我。中午，鹰。晚上，龟。从没学会只当一个。干吗要只当一个？",
 "There. The feral. The Beast Pens want him intact. Net him, and mind the teeth.":"在那儿。那个野孩子。兽栏要完好无损的。网住他，当心他的牙。",
 "Net me? Which me? Rrrrr. Tiger first!":"网我？网哪个我？吼噜噜噜！先当老虎！",
 "Tiger for the morning. Eagle for noon. And now they're running, so... tortoise. Nap time.":"早上当虎。中午当鹰。现在他们跑了，那么……当龟。午睡时间到。",
 "Past the forest's edge a caravan creaks along the road. Kova watches it go, then slips after it through the ferns.":"森林边缘外，一支商队沿路吱吱呀呀地驶过。科瓦目送它远去，然后穿过蕨丛，悄悄跟了上去。",
 "Spear guy never looks behind him. Never! Somebody has to.":"拿矛的那家伙从来不回头看。从来不！总得有人替他看。",
 "For nine years a caravan guard has left meat out for whatever follows his wagons through the Glowwild. Tonight Halcyon raiders wait round the bend, and the thing in the trees walks out.":"九年来，一名商队护卫总会留下肉，喂给那个尾随他的车队穿过荧野的东西。今晚，哈尔西恩的劫掠者埋伏在弯道那头，而林子里的那个东西走了出来。",
 "Guard the caravan road with Hart":"与哈特守护商队之路",
 "The caravan road through the Glowwild. Every night Hart leaves meat by the wheel ruts. Every morning it is gone.":"穿过荧野的商队之路。每晚，哈特都把肉留在车辙旁。每天早上，肉都不见了。",
 "Hi! The meat. Thanks. Nine years of thanks. Also! Halcyon raiders. Round the bend. Lots.":"嗨！那些肉。谢谢。九年份的谢谢。还有！哈尔西恩的劫掠者。在拐弯那边。好多。",
 "...You're what follows the caravans.":"……跟着商队的，原来是你。",
 "You thought I was a beast? I mean. Sometimes. Tiger, mostly. Bit of eagle.":"你以为我是野兽？嗯。有时候是。大多是老虎。带点鹰。",
 "Nine years, and nothing's surprised me. Fine. Keep your distance. I'll keep it for you.":"九年了，没什么能让我吃惊。行吧。保持距离。你不保持，我替你保持。",
 "Brann taught me the bear. I can be quiet now! ...Mostly. Here they come!":"布兰教会了我当熊。我现在能安静了！……大多时候。他们来了！",
 "Three beasts and me! Plus some bear. Bear's new.":"三头野兽加上我！再加点熊。熊是新学的。",
 "Could you cook it? Just once? Raw is a tiger thing. I'm not always tiger.":"能煮熟吗？就一次？吃生的是老虎的事。我又不总是老虎。",
 "Something Halcyon turned loose is killing in the Glowwild. Kova finds its trail, and finds Fenn and his storm-wolf there first.":"哈尔西恩放出来的某个东西正在荧野里杀戮。科瓦找到了它的踪迹，却发现芬恩和他的风暴狼已经先到了。",
 "Beat Fenn for the Glowwild trail":"打败芬恩，夺下荧野猎踪",
 "Gutted deer under the blue leaves. Kova finds the print, and a wolf-man already crouched over it.":"蓝色的树叶下躺着一头被开膛的鹿。科瓦找到了脚印，还有一个早已蹲在脚印旁的狼人。",
 "Go home, pup. One wolf is plenty for this.":"回家去，小崽子。对付这个，一头狼就够了。",
 "One wolf. One trick! I've got tiger, eagle, tortoise and a bit of bear. Who finds it first, hm? Hm?":"一头狼。一招鲜！我有虎、鹰、龟，还有点熊。谁先找到它，嗯？嗯？",
 "Ha! Then let's see who's standing. Every beast against the one-trick wolf! Rawr!":"哈！那就看看谁还站着。百兽对一招鲜的狼！嗷呜！",
 "...Fine. You hit like a tiger. You move like an eagle.":"……行。你出手像虎，身法像鹰。",
 "Like always! And we both pretend we hate it. Grr. See? Hating it.":"跟以前一样！我们俩还都假装很嫌弃。呜噜。看到没？正嫌弃着呢。",
 "One wolf, pup. Pick a beast and keep it.":"一头狼就够了，小崽子。挑一种野兽，别变来变去。",
 "Poison from the drill camp is leaking into the forest, and the beasts are furious. Meanwhile somebody is going around wearing other people's faces, and Kova thinks that's his trick.":"钻机营地的毒水渗进了森林，野兽们怒不可遏。与此同时，有人顶着别人的脸四处招摇，而科瓦觉得，那可是他的招数。",
 "Lead the beasts against the drills":"率百兽杀向钻机",
 "The Ash Dunes. Halcyon's drills sink into the Buried Meridian, and their waste runs downhill into the Glowwild. The beasts can taste it.":"灰烬沙丘。哈尔西恩的钻机钻进被掩埋的子午线，废水顺坡流进荧野。野兽们尝得出那股味道。",
 "Screens everywhere! Kael, Deepline boy, gassing the Sky. Nyra, Sky girl, drilling Deepline. Sky blames Deep, Deep blames Sky. Bleh.":"到处都是屏幕！凯尔，深线的男孩，给天上放毒气。妮拉，天上的女孩，钻穿深线。天上怪深线，深线怪天上。呸。",
 "Changing faces? That's MY trick! Except I don't use it to lie. And the beasts smell Halcyon all over those two.":"变脸？那可是我的招数！只不过我不拿它骗人。而且野兽们在那两个人身上闻到的，全是哈尔西恩的味道。",
 "Dune and Tarek take one chain between them. From the mountain Oda's bell rings three times, and the whole Surface starts walking.":"杜恩和塔里克共握一条锁链。山上，奥达的钟响了三下，整个地表都动身了。",
 "Tigers! Eagles! Tortoises! Everybody! Follow me! AROOO!":"老虎！老鹰！乌龟！大家伙儿！跟我来！嗷呜——！",
 "The Glowwild's beasts boil out of the trees with Kova at their head. The drill camp scatters like quail.":"荧野的野兽在科瓦的带领下从林中汹涌而出。钻机营地像受惊的鹌鹑一样四散奔逃。",
 "That's... the thing that follows my caravans. All of it. All at once.":"那是……跟着我商队的那个东西。全部。一下子全来了。",
 "The same night the Sky's wards rise behind Aldric's turned knights, and Deepline's Pit Arena traps Pell, its masked sensei, in his own strings.":"同一夜，天上的病区跟在倒戈的奥德瑞骑士身后揭竿而起；而在深线的深坑竞技场，那位戴面具的师父佩尔被自己的线困住了。",
 "Pell names the face-thief: Rue, who wore Kael and Nyra for the Director. Kiri's paper crane flies it to the Crater, and a second Kael runs.":"佩尔说出了窃脸者的名字：露，是她替总监扮成了凯尔和妮拉。基里的纸鹤把消息送到陨坑，第二个凯尔逃了。",
 "Rue. Hmph. Shape-shifting to tell lies. Gives the rest of us a bad name.":"露。哼。变形就为了撒谎。把我们这些变形的名声都搞臭了。",
 "Hollis paints a fourth banner. Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire for the Engine Core, before whatever it's calling can answer.":"霍利斯画下第四面旗帜。四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，直取引擎核心，要赶在它召唤的东西应答之前。",
 "Hart has guarded caravans across the Rust Flats for nine years on a single rule about distance. Halcyon's toll riders are across the road, and nobody has told them the rule.":"九年来，哈特护送商队穿越锈蚀平原，只靠一条关于距离的规矩。哈尔西恩的收费骑手拦在路上，还没人告诉过他们这条规矩。",
 "The Rust Flats: red dust, the caravan road from Mile Zero to the Crater rim, and a young man with a very long spear.":"锈蚀平原：红色的尘土，从零英里通往陨坑边缘的商队之路，还有一个拿着很长很长的矛的年轻人。",
 "Hart! Halcyon toll riders across the road. They say the wagons pay or the wagons burn. Mine's the one with the chickens!":"哈特！哈尔西恩的收费骑手把路拦住了。他们说车队要么交钱，要么烧掉。装鸡的那辆是我的！",
 "Nine years on this road and nothing's surprised me yet. Get behind me. Stay out of reach. Mind the chickens.":"在这条路上走了九年，还没什么能让我吃惊。到我身后去。待在够不着的地方。看好你的鸡。",
 "I know. I leave meat out for it. Never asked what it is. That's its business. Roll on.":"我知道。我给它留肉。从没问过它是什么。那是它自己的事。继续走。",
 "Something moves under the crystal of the Glass Sea, and Halcyon riders are herding it at the caravan. Tor plants the shield. Hart sets the spear behind it.":"玻璃之海的晶体下有东西在动，哈尔西恩骑手正把它往商队赶。托尔立盾，哈特在盾后架矛。",
 "Hold the Glass Sea crossing with Tor":"与托尔守住玻璃之海渡口",
 "The Glass Sea crossing. The caravan halts. Under the crystal, something long is moving.":"玻璃之海的渡口。商队停下。晶体下，有个长长的东西在动。",
 "Crawlers ahead. Riders behind them. Herding.":"前面，爬虫。后面，骑手。在赶。",
 "Shield in front. Spear behind it. Same as every crossing.":"盾在前。矛在后。每个渡口都一样。",
 "And whatever doesn't bounce stays three metres from the wagons.":"弹不开的，就让它离车队三米远。",
 "Nothing got past. Nothing will.":"什么都没过去。以后也不会。",
 "We quit arguing over who does the work years ago, didn't we?":"我们好几年前就不争到底是谁出力了，对吧？",
 "You quit. It's the shield.":"是你不争了。靠的是盾。",
 "...And the thing that follows us through the Glowwild is on that dune again. Licking its paws. Watching.":"……还有，那个跟着我们穿过荧野的东西又在那座沙丘上了。舔着爪子。看着。",
 "Yara is ahead on their bet and says reach belongs to the bow. Out on the open Rust Flats, with no caravan to hide behind, Hart means to show her what a spear does about that.":"雅拉在赌约上领先，她说射程归弓。在空旷的锈蚀平原上，没有商队可躲，哈特要让她看看，长矛对此有什么话说。",
 "Duel Yara on the Rust Flats":"在锈蚀平原与雅拉决斗",
 "That rider on the ridge was most of a mile off. He was down before your spear finished turning. I'm ahead on the bet, Hart.":"山脊上那个骑手离这儿快一英里。你的矛还没转过来，他就倒了。赌约我领先，哈特。",
 "Then charge me. Open flats, light wind from the west, no wagon to hide behind. Reach decides.":"那就冲我来。空旷平原，西边微风，没有车可躲。谁够得着，谁说了算。",
 "Agreed. I'll start walking. You start counting the distance.":"一言为定。我开始走。你开始数距离。",
 "I couldn't get far enough back. Every step I took, the spear was already there.":"我退得不够远。我每退一步，矛都已经在那儿了。",
 "Then the bet's square. Took long enough.":"那赌约扯平了。可真够久的。",
 "Square up close. At a mile I'm still ahead.":"近身算扯平。隔一英里，还是我领先。",
 "Reach decides, spear-boy. Mine is a mile, and the wind's on my side today.":"谁够得着，谁说了算，矛小子。我够得着一英里，今天风也站在我这边。",
 "Forty towns are on the march for the drills, strung out in one long column, and Hart is at the point. Everyone behind him has seen the two faces on Halcyon's screens.":"四十座城镇向钻机进发，拉成一支长长的纵队，哈特走在最前头。他身后的每个人，都在哈尔西恩的屏幕上看过那两张脸。",
 "Hold the column's front at the drills":"在钻机前守住纵队前锋",
 "The Ash Dunes. Forty towns march on the Buried Meridian in one column. Hart walks at its head, with Tor on the flank.":"灰烬沙丘。四十座城镇排成一支纵队，向被掩埋的子午线进军。哈特走在最前头，托尔守着侧翼。",
 "Is it true, Hart? Deepline's Kael gassed the Sky, the Sky's Nyra drilled Deepline? Each side says the other hit first.":"是真的吗，哈特？深线的凯尔给天上放了毒气，天上的妮拉钻穿了深线？两边都说是对方先动的手。",
 "At a distance a face can be anyone's. Up close you see the seams. Somebody wants all of us standing far apart.":"隔得远，一张脸可以是任何人的。凑近了，就能看见接缝。有人想让我们所有人都离得远远的。",
 "Ahead, Dune and Tarek hold one chain between them. Behind, Oda's bell rings three times. In ninety-six years it never has.":"前方，杜恩和塔里克共握一条锁链。后方，奥达的钟响了三下。九十六年来，从没有过。",
 "Stories at a distance. Drills at the end of the spear. Column, close up behind me.":"传言，隔远点。钻机，留在矛尖前。纵队，在我身后靠拢。",
 "The column's front never bends. Not one drill crew gets inside the spear.":"纵队的前锋从未弯折。没有一个钻机队闯进矛的范围。",
 "Front held. Nothing got past either of us. You can say it was the shield.":"前锋守住了。我们俩谁那儿都没漏过去一个。你可以说是盾的功劳。",
 "That night the Sky's wards rise and Aldric turns his knights around. In Deepline's Pit Arena, Pell is caught in his own strings.":"当夜，天上的病区揭竿而起，奥德瑞调转了他的骑士。在深线的深坑竞技场，佩尔被自己的线缠住了。",
 "Pell names the seams: Rue, his faceless spy, who wore Kael and Nyra on the Director's orders. Kiri's crane flies it to the Crater, and a second Kael runs.":"佩尔说出了那些接缝的名字：露，他的无面密探，奉总监之命扮成了凯尔和妮拉。基里的纸鹤把消息送到陨坑，第二个凯尔逃了。",
 "Hollis paints a fourth banner. Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core, before whatever it calls can answer.":"霍利斯画下第四面旗帜。四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，向引擎核心进发，要赶在它召唤的东西应答之前。",
 "A tower. Long way up, no room to swing. I'll manage.":"一座塔。往上爬很远，没地方抡矛。我会应付的。",
 "In the Hidden Village there is a ring of packed earth, and in the ring there is Taro. Nobody has ever moved him out of it, and Halcyon has come to try.":"隐秘之村里有一个夯土的土俵，土俵里站着太郎。从来没人把他推出去过，如今哈尔西恩来试试了。",
 "Throw the surveyors out of the ring":"把勘测队扔出土俵",
 "The Village ring: packed earth, a circle of salt, a straw rope, and a very large man no one has moved since he was nine.":"村中的土俵：夯实的泥土，一圈盐，一条草绳，还有一个从九岁起就没人推动过的巨汉。",
 "Halcyon land survey. This village is an unlicensed structure. You. The large one. Step outside the circle.":"哈尔西恩土地勘测。这个村子属于无证建筑。你。大个子。走出那个圈。",
 "Step in first. Then ask me again.":"先进来。然后再问我一遍。",
 "The survey team lies in a heap beyond the salt. Taro's feet have not moved.":"勘测队在盐圈外堆成一堆。太郎的脚没有挪动分毫。",
 "Now bow to the floor. It was gentle with you.":"现在向地面行礼。它对你们手下留情了。",
 "Every spring Oda the bell-monk comes down the path to bless the Village ring. This spring Halcyon comes up the other way.":"每年春天，敲钟的僧人奥达都会沿山路下来，为村中的土俵祈福。今年春天，哈尔西恩从另一头爬了上来。",
 "Hold the ring with Oda":"与奥达守住土俵",
 "Spring in the village. Down the temple path comes Oda, the silent monk of the Last Toll, his bell in both hands, as every year.":"村里的春天。终钟寺那位沉默的僧人奥达双手捧着钟，沿寺庙的山路走下来，年年如此。",
 "Oda. The ring is ready. Fresh salt, swept earth, and me.":"奥达。土俵准备好了。新撒的盐，扫净的土，还有我。",
 "Oda rings the bell once over the ring. Taro bows to it. The bell hums back.":"奥达在土俵上方敲了一下钟。太郎向它行礼。钟嗡嗡回应。",
 "...Halcyon is on the lower path. You heard their boots too.":"……哈尔西恩在下面的山路上。你也听见他们的靴子声了。",
 "Oda nods, and does not lower the bell. He holds it now the way Taro holds a stance.":"奥达点点头，没有放下钟。此刻他握钟的样子，就像太郎扎下的架势。",
 "Then the blessing waits. You ring. I push.":"那祈福先等等。你敲钟。我推人。",
 "A blessed ring holds better. Thank you, Oda.":"受过祈福的土俵更稳。谢谢你，奥达。",
 "The bell rings once, softly. From Oda, that is a whole speech.":"钟轻轻响了一声。对奥达来说，这就是一整篇演讲了。",
 "Same time next spring. I will have the salt ready.":"明年春天，老时间。我会把盐备好。",
 "For years Tor, the shield at the village gate, has asked which of them is the true wall. Halcyon is coming, Hollis wants the strongest of them guarding the village, and today Taro throws the salt.":"多年来，守在村门口的盾——托尔，一直在问他们俩谁才是真正的墙。哈尔西恩要来了，霍利斯要他们中最强的那个守村，而今天，太郎撒下了盐。",
 "Push Tor out of the ring":"把托尔推出土俵",
 "Taro. Halcyon's coming. Hollis wants his truest wall at the gate. Me.":"太郎。哈尔西恩要来了。霍利斯要他最可靠的墙守门。我。",
 "A gate is a door. A ring is a wall. Nobody has moved me since I was nine.":"门只是门。土俵才是墙。从我九岁起，就没人推动过我。",
 "Nobody has got past me. Ever. Same thing.":"从没人越过我。从来没有。一回事。",
 "Not the same thing. Step in. Salt. Bow. Push.":"不是一回事。进来。撒盐。行礼。推。",
 "...Outside the salt.":"……出盐圈了。",
 "You are. And I am still in it. The ring holds.":"你出了。而我还在里面。土俵守住了。",
 "You dug in. Felt it. Your heel moved.":"你脚下使了劲。我感觉到了。你的脚跟动了。",
 "Gate's mine. Ring's yours. Two walls. Village can afford both.":"门归我。土俵归你。两堵墙。村子两堵都养得起。",
 "Arrows bounce. Wrestlers too.":"箭会弹开。相扑手也会。",
 "Halcyon's drills are sinking through the Buried Meridian on their way down to Deepline, and the layers are too busy blaming each other to notice. Taro means to draw a ring around the worst of them.":"哈尔西恩的钻机正穿过被掩埋的子午线，一路向深线钻去，而各层忙着互相指责，谁也没注意。太郎打算在最凶的那台周围画一个圈。",
 "Hold the salt ring against the drills":"守住盐圈，迎战钻机",
 "The Drills at the Buried Meridian. Three tolls of Oda's bell have brought the whole Surface to the sand. Taro walks salt round the biggest rig.":"被掩埋的子午线的钻机。奥达的三声钟响把整个地表都召到了沙地上。太郎绕着最大的那台钻机，一路撒盐。",
 "The films say the Sky's singer, Nyra, drilled Deepline, and Deepline's Kael gassed the Sky. Each side blames the other. Is any of it true?":"影片里说，天上的歌手妮拉钻穿了深线，深线的凯尔给天上放了毒气。两边都怪对方。这里头有一句是真的吗？",
 "In the ring you see your opponent's face, close. A face on a screen is not an opponent.":"在土俵里，你能近距离看清对手的脸。屏幕上的脸，算不得对手。",
 "Whoever wore those faces has never stepped into a ring. This drill has. Bow, drill.":"戴着那些脸的人，从没踏进过土俵。这台钻机踏进来了。行礼吧，钻机。",
 "Taro gets both arms round the rig, plants his feet, and throws it out of the salt. Out on the dunes, Dune and Tarek drag the rest under on one chain.":"太郎双臂抱住钻机，扎稳双脚，把它扔出了盐圈。沙丘上，杜恩和塔里克用同一条锁链把其余的拖进了沙底。",
 "That rig weighs forty tonnes!":"那台钻机有四十吨重！",
 "Forty tonnes, inside the ring. Now it is outside.":"四十吨，在圈里。现在在圈外了。",
 "Word comes by night: Pell, caught in the Pit, has named the thing that wore both faces. Rue, his faceless spy, on the Director's orders.":"夜里传来消息：在深坑落网的佩尔，说出了那个戴过两张脸的东西的名字。露，他的无面密探，奉的是总监的命令。",
 "Hollis writes a fourth banner. Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core, before whatever it calls can answer.":"霍利斯写下第四面旗帜。四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，向引擎核心进发，要赶在它召唤的东西应答之前。",
 "A man who sends masks to fight for him has never been in a ring. We will go up and draw one around him.":"派面具替自己打架的人，从没进过土俵。我们上去，在他周围画一个。",
 "For six years Tarek's chain raiders have dug the dead city for scrap and sold it to Halcyon. Tonight Halcyon stops buying.":"六年来，塔里克的锁链掠夺者在死城里挖废料，卖给哈尔西恩。今晚，哈尔西恩不买了。",
 "Hold the Sinkhole against Halcyon":"守住天坑，抵御哈尔西恩",
 "The Sinkhole, on the edge of the Buried Meridian. By lantern light, chain raiders winch scrap out of the dead city.":"天坑，位于被掩埋的子午线边缘。借着灯笼的光，锁链掠夺者正用绞盘把废料从死城里吊上来。",
 "Copper, steel, old wire. The dead don't need it, Halcyon pays for it. Fair trade. Never asked for a better one.":"铜，钢，旧电线。死人用不着，哈尔西恩肯掏钱。公平买卖。从没想过要更好的。",
 "Change of procurement, Tarek. Halcyon no longer requires suppliers. The drills arrive this week. Vacate the site.":"采购方案变更，塔里克。哈尔西恩不再需要供应商。钻机本周到场。请腾空场地。",
 "Vacate? I don't go anywhere, friend. You always come to me.":"腾空？我哪儿也不去，朋友。向来是你们来找我。",
 "Noted. Then we come to you. Retire them.":"已记录。那我们就来找你。让他们“退休”。",
 "Reeled in, the lot of you. Tell your bosses the price just went up.":"一个不落，全拽过来了。告诉你们老板，价钱刚涨了。",
 "Boss... if they've got drills, they dig the whole city. And whoever's standing on top of it.":"老大……他们要是有了钻机，会把整座城都挖穿。连同站在上面的人。",
 "...That's us. Yeah. I see it now. Douse the lanterns.":"……就是我们。是啊。我现在明白了。把灯笼灭了。",
 "Hold the forge path with Garo":"与加罗守住锻炉山路",
 "Garo's forge at the Hidden Village: sparks, hot iron, a hammer that never seems to stop. A raider climbs the path, his sickle chipped like an old tooth.":"隐秘之村，加罗的锻炉：火星，烧红的铁，一把似乎从不停歇的锤子。一个掠夺者爬上山路，他的镰刀缺口斑斑，像一颗老牙。",
 "Halcyon's chains. They've stopped buying, Garo. They want the buried city, and my crew out of the way.":"哈尔西恩的锁链。他们不买了，加罗。他们要那座被埋的城，还要我的弟兄们别挡道。",
 "Then it needs an edge. Sit. ...And you brought company up my mountain.":"那它就得有刃。坐。……还有，你把客人带上我的山了。",
 "Halcyon. Sorry. They've got a habit of following me. I'll pay for the damage. In scrap.":"哈尔西恩。抱歉。他们有跟着我的毛病。损失我赔。拿废料赔。",
 "There. Sharp. Bring it back notched. I like to see it used.":"好了。锋利了。缺了口再拿回来。我喜欢看到它被用过。",
 "Best smith on the Surface, sharpening a raider's sickle for nothing. What's your angle?":"地表最好的铁匠，白给一个掠夺者磨镰刀。你图什么？",
 "One day you'll use it on the right side.":"总有一天，你会站在对的那一边用它。",
 "Bando of Dockside Nine claims the longer reach, in public. Tarek has come down into Deepline with a warning about the drills, and nobody on the docks will listen until they have measured.":"九号码头的班多当众宣称自己够得更远。塔里克下到深线，带来一个关于钻机的警告，可在比完谁够得远之前，码头上没人肯听。",
 "Beat Bando at Dockside Nine":"在九号码头打败班多",
 "Tarek of the chain raiders! On MY dock! You told the whole Surface you've got the longer reach!":"锁链掠夺者的塔里克！跑到我的码头来了！你跟整个地表说你够得更远！",
 "I did. That's not why I'm here, dockhand. Halcyon's drills won't stop at the Surface. They're coming down.":"我说过。可我不是为这个来的，码头佬。哈尔西恩的钻机不会停在地表。它们要钻下来了。",
 "Everyone hears it after we measure, buddy. That's the deal. I once reached across a whole festival field for little Sora's kite, you know!":"比完了大家才听，哥们儿。说好了的。告诉你，我有一回隔着整片庙会场地，替小索拉够回了风筝！",
 "I know. Everybody knows. Fine. Chain against arm. Loser shuts up and listens.":"我知道。谁都知道。行。锁链对手臂。输的闭嘴听着。",
 "...You reeled me in. My arm was longer. I'm sure my arm was longer. Six arm's lengths, easy.":"……你把我拽过去了。我的胳膊明明更长。我肯定我的胳膊更长。少说长出六臂。",
 "Your arm was. My chain wasn't. Now listen, all of you: Halcyon's drills are coming down through your ceiling.":"你的胳膊是更长。我的锁链可不短。现在都听好：哈尔西恩的钻机要从你们头顶上钻下来了。",
 "Okay, okay. Deepline's listening. And we're measuring again later. Twice.":"好啦好啦。深线在听。回头我们还要再比。比两次。",
 "Reeled in by an arm! Want to measure again, chain-man? Bring a longer chain.":"被一条胳膊拽过来了吧！还想再比吗，锁链佬？带条长点的链子来。",
 "The layers are tearing at each other over two films, and Halcyon's drills are turning in the Buried Meridian. Tarek sold Halcyon scrap for six years. He knows whose drills they are.":"各层为了两段影片彼此撕咬，而哈尔西恩的钻机正在被掩埋的子午线里转动。塔里克卖了六年废料给哈尔西恩。他知道这些钻机是谁的。",
 "Beat back the drills with Dune":"与杜恩击退钻机",
 "The Ash Dunes. Halcyon's drills turn in the dead city, boring down toward Deepline, while the layers above and below curse each other.":"灰烬沙丘。哈尔西恩的钻机在死城里转动，朝深线一路钻下去，而上下两层正互相咒骂。",
 "Boss, the Sky says Deepline's Kael gassed its labs. Deepline says the Sky's singer, Nyra, drilled its tunnels. So whose drills are THESE?":"老大，天上说深线的凯尔毒气熏了他们的实验室。深线说天上的歌手妮拉钻穿了他们的隧道。那这些钻机又是谁的？",
 "Halcyon's. Six years I sold them scrap. I know their bolts. Somebody lent them two faces. The drills are all theirs.":"哈尔西恩的。我卖了六年废料给他们。他们的螺栓我认得。有人借了他们两张脸。钻机全是他们自己的。",
 "Up on the mountain the old bell tolls three times, as it never has in ninety-six years. Tarek unbuckles his sickle and drops it in the sand.":"山上，那口老钟响了三下，九十六年来从未有过。塔里克解下镰刀，丢进沙里。",
 "He walks out into the desert with nothing in his hands but the chain. Dune rises out of the sand to meet him.":"他走进沙漠，手里除了锁链什么也没拿。杜恩从沙中升起，迎向他。",
 "Dune. They'll bury everyone. You, me, the dead, my crew. Here. One end each.":"杜恩。他们会把所有人都埋了。你，我，死人，我的弟兄。拿着。一人一头。",
 "...One end each. Do not let go.":"……一人一头。别松手。",
 "Sand and chain. The crews are reeled in and buried to their necks, and the whole Surface pours over the ridge behind them.":"沙与锁链。钻机队被拽过来，埋到脖子，整个地表的人从他们身后的山脊上潮水般涌来。",
 "Boss! Word from the Crater, on a paper crane. Pell got caught in the Pit and named the faker: Rue. Wore both faces, for the Director.":"老大！陨坑来消息了，纸鹤送来的。佩尔在深坑落网，供出了那个冒牌货：露。两张脸都是她扮的，替总监干的。",
 "Rue. Never trusted a deal where I couldn't see the other face. Turns out nobody could.":"露。看不见对面那张脸的买卖，我从来不信。原来谁都看不见。",
 "Hollis paints a fourth banner under the Pact's three. Four banners start up the Halcyon Spire from four sides, toward the Engine Core.":"霍利斯在盟约的三面旗帜下画了第四面。四面旗帜从四个方向攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，向引擎核心进发。",
 "Don't make it a thing. Come on. Long climb, and whatever that Engine's been whistling for, I'd rather not shake its hand.":"别小题大做。走吧。要爬很久，而且不管那台引擎一直吹着口哨在唤什么东西，我都不想跟它握手。",
 "For ninety-six years Oda's temple bell has rung at every dawn. This morning a Halcyon survey team has climbed the mountain to silence it.":"九十六年来，奥达寺里的钟每个黎明都会响起。今天早上，一支哈尔西恩勘测队爬上山来，要让它闭嘴。",
 "Drive the surveyors off the temple":"把勘测队赶出寺庙",
 "The Temple of the Last Toll, before dawn. Frost on the steps, and a bell that has not missed a morning in living memory.":"黎明前的终钟寺。台阶上结着霜，还有一口在世人记忆中从未缺过一个早晨的钟。",
 "Halcyon survey. That bell carries eleven miles and gives the settlement away. Confiscate the bell. Remove the monk.":"哈尔西恩勘测队。那口钟能传十一英里，把定居点的位置都暴露了。没收钟。清除僧人。",
 "(Oda looks at the agent for a long moment. Then he lifts the bell in both hands.)":"（奥达久久地看着那名特工。然后，他双手举起了钟。）",
 "The survey team lies in a ring round the temple steps. The bell hums on in Oda's hands.":"勘测队围着寺庙台阶倒了一圈。钟仍在奥达手中嗡嗡作响。",
 "(Oda bows to the fallen, then to the sunrise, exactly as deep.)":"（奥达向倒下的人鞠躬，再向日出鞠躬，躬得一样深。）",
 "He rings once more, harder than he needs to. Every morning since a little girl called Coda was taken, he has rung a little harder.":"他又敲了一下，比需要的更用力。自从那个名叫寇妲的小女孩被带走，他每天早上都敲得更用力一些。",
 "The Pact of the Hidden Clans hangs beneath the bell in Hollis's handwriting. Halcyon has climbed the temple stairs to take it away and file it.":"隐秘氏族的盟约挂在钟下，是霍利斯的亲笔。哈尔西恩爬上寺庙台阶，要把它拿走归档。",
 "The Pact hangs in the temple under the bell, its ink browned by ninety-six years of candle smoke.":"盟约挂在寺中钟下，墨迹被九十六年的烛烟熏成了褐色。",
 "(A single, pointed toll.)":"（一声钟响，意有所指。）",
 "Yes, yes. Later. Halcyon is on the temple stairs, and they want the Pact for one of their filing cabinets.":"好，好。回头再说。哈尔西恩已经上了寺庙台阶，他们想把盟约塞进哪个档案柜里。",
 "(Oda sets himself in front of the scroll, the bell hanging from his fist like a stone in a sling.)":"（奥达挡在卷轴前，钟悬在他拳下，像投石索里的一块石头。）",
 "Still here. One scroll, one bell, and two old men too stubborn to fall over.":"都还在。一卷盟约，一口钟，还有两个倔得不肯倒下的老头子。",
 "(Oda taps the bell with one knuckle. Tink.)":"（奥达用一个指节敲了敲钟。叮。）",
 "I know, I know. The second line. Later.":"知道，知道。第二行。回头再说。",
 "Oda once watched a masked man carry a small girl up into the sky. Now he rides the Skylift to the Noble Ring with his bell, to find the man, and the girl.":"奥达曾眼看着一个戴面具的男人把一个小女孩带上天空。如今他带着钟，乘天梯来到贵族环区，去找那个男人，还有那个女孩。",
 "Duel Pell at the Noble Ring":"在贵族环区与佩尔决斗",
 "The bell-monk from the mountain, all this way up! Come to watch her dance? She is exquisite now. I made her so. Do take a seat.":"山上那个敲钟的和尚，大老远跑上来了！来看她跳舞吗？她如今美极了。是我把她变成这样的。请坐吧。",
 "(Oda does not sit. He rings the bell once, low, and every chandelier in the house shivers.)":"（奥达没有坐。他低低地敲了一下钟，剧院里每一盏枝形吊灯都在颤抖。）",
 "She no longer counts your tolls, monk. She counts my strings. One, two, three, and turn.":"她不再数你的钟声了，和尚。她数的是我的线。一，二，三，转身。",
 "(Oda plants his feet on the velvet carpet, and raises the bell.)":"（奥达在天鹅绒地毯上扎稳双脚，举起了钟。）",
 "A monk who only rings a bell. And yet here I lie, on the carpet of my own opera. How unscripted.":"一个只会敲钟的和尚。可我却躺在了自己歌剧院的地毯上。真是不按剧本来。",
 "On the stage, Coda, the opera's star, hears the bell through the walls, and misses one step on Pell's string.":"舞台上，歌剧院的首席寇妲隔着墙壁听见了钟声，在佩尔的线上踏错了一步。",
 "Silence suits you, monk. Keep it, and stay down. I shall take the bow for both of us.":"沉默很适合你，和尚。保持下去，趴着别动。谢幕的礼，我替我们俩一起行了。",
 "Two films have set the three layers at each other's throats, and Halcyon's drills are biting down through the Buried Meridian. Oda's bell has rung once every dawn since the Pact. Only ever once.":"两段影片让三层世界掐住了彼此的喉咙，而哈尔西恩的钻机正咬穿被掩埋的子午线。自盟约立下以来，奥达的钟每个黎明响一下。永远只响一下。",
 "The Buried Meridian. Every screen in the three layers plays two films, each layer blames the other, and Halcyon's drills bite into the sand.":"被掩埋的子午线。三层世界的每块屏幕都在放两段影片，各层互相指责，而哈尔西恩的钻机咬进了沙中。",
 "Monk! The Sky says Deepline's Kael gassed its labs. Deepline says the Sky's Nyra drilled its tunnels. Is this the end of the Pact?":"大师！天上说深线的凯尔毒气熏了他们的实验室。深线说天上的妮拉钻穿了他们的隧道。盟约就要到头了吗？",
 "(Oda shakes his head. A face is not a person. He once watched a smiling mask carry off a child.)":"（奥达摇摇头。一张脸不等于一个人。他曾眼看着一张微笑的面具带走一个孩子。）",
 "He raises the bell. Once at every dawn, always once, since before most of the Surface was born. Today he rings it three times.":"他举起钟。每个黎明一下，永远只是一下，早在地表大多数人出生之前便是如此。今天，他敲了三下。",
 "Across the Surface, everyone who knows the Pact puts down what they hold and turns toward the Meridian. Dune and Tarek already share one chain.":"整个地表上，凡是知道盟约的人都放下手中的东西，转身望向子午线。杜恩和塔里克已经共握一条锁链。",
 "One by one the drills fall silent. Only the bell is still ringing, far out over the sand.":"钻机一台接一台地沉寂下来。只有钟声还在远远的沙地上空回荡。",
 "Three times. Ninety-six years, and never once three. I came running. At my age. Running.":"三下。九十六年了，一次都没有过三下。我是跑过来的。我这把年纪。跑过来的。",
 "Word from the Crater on a paper crane: caught in the Pit, Pell has named the face-thief. Rue, his faceless spy, wearing Kael and Nyra for the Director.":"纸鹤从陨坑带来消息：在深坑落网的佩尔说出了窃脸者的名字。露，他的无面密探，替总监扮成了凯尔和妮拉。",
 "(Oda nods slowly. A mask, again. The same hand behind it, again.)":"（奥达缓缓点头。又是一张面具。面具后面，又是同一只手。）",
 "(Oda strikes the bell a fourth time, barely a hum, for the fourth banner. Then he begins to climb.)":"（奥达为第四面旗帜敲了第四下，轻得几乎只是一声嗡鸣。然后，他开始攀登。）",
 "Garo's throwing wheel was once a Halcyon drill bit. Only fair: Halcyon keeps drilling his mountain, and today it has found his tunnel.":"加罗的飞轮原本是一枚哈尔西恩钻头。这很公平：哈尔西恩一直在钻他的山，而今天，它找到了他的隧道。",
 "The forge and gate of the Hidden Village. Deepline steel comes up by tunnels no map shows. Bread goes down.":"隐秘之村的锻炉与村门。深线的钢铁沿着地图上没有的隧道运上来。面包送下去。",
 "Made this wheel from one of Halcyon's drill bits. Width of a door. Seemed fair. They keep drilling our mountain.":"这只飞轮是我用哈尔西恩的一枚钻头打的。门板那么宽。挺公平。他们一直在钻我们的山。",
 "Smuggling tunnel located. Seal it, detain the smith. Halcyon would like to know who is on the other end.":"已定位走私隧道。封死它，扣押铁匠。哈尔西恩想知道另一头是谁。",
 "So would I. Never seen her face. Neither will you.":"我也想知道。我从没见过她的脸。你们也别想见。",
 "Throw once, hit twice. And it comes home to the hand that threw it.":"扔一次，打两下。然后它回到扔出它的那只手里。",
 "For ten years Garo has sent bread down a hidden tunnel and Ferra of the Crusher Yard has sent steel up. Today, in the pitch dark halfway between, Halcyon finds them both.":"十年来，加罗通过一条秘密隧道往下送面包，粉碎场的费拉往上送钢铁。今天，在隧道中段伸手不见五指的黑暗里，哈尔西恩找到了他们俩。",
 "Halfway down the hidden tunnel, in a dark you could cut and sell. Halcyon has found it from both ends at once.":"秘密隧道的中段，黑得能切成块拿去卖。哈尔西恩从两头同时找到了这里。",
 "Ferra. Ten years of steel up and bread down, and we meet in the dark. Figures.":"费拉。十年来钢铁上来、面包下去，我们却在黑暗里见面。果然如此。",
 "Halcyon's coming from my end and yours. I brought scrap. Every bit of junk down here does what I tell it.":"哈尔西恩从我那头和你那头一起过来了。我带了废料。下面每一块破烂都听我的。",
 "I brought the wheel. One throws...":"我带了飞轮。一个扔……",
 "...one catches. I know. You scratch it on every crate.":"……一个接。我知道。你每只货箱上都刻这句。",
 "Tunnel's clear. And I still haven't seen your face. Good.":"隧道清干净了。我还是没见到你的脸。挺好。",
 "That's the Pact, big man. Folk worth saving, that you never have to look at.":"这就是盟约，大个子。值得救的人，你永远不必看见他们的脸。",
 "Every morning Garo throws and Tor, the shield of the gate, catches. This morning Garo takes down the big wheel, because he has seen what Halcyon is fitting to its new drills.":"每天早上，加罗扔，守门之盾托尔接。今天早上，加罗取下了那只大飞轮，因为他见过哈尔西恩给新钻机装上了什么。",
 "Duel Tor at the village gate":"在村门与托尔决斗",
 "Garo. One throw, one catch. Every morning. Why the big wheel?":"加罗。一扔，一接。每天早上。干吗拿大飞轮？",
 "Halcyon's new drill-heads. Seen them. If your shield can't take my Meteor Wheel, it can't take one of those.":"哈尔西恩的新钻头。见过了。你的盾要是扛不住我的流星轮，也扛不住那玩意儿。",
 "A test.":"考验。",
 "Started as a spar. Hold the gate, Tor. Show me nothing gets through.":"一开始是对练。守住门，托尔。让我看看什么都过不去。",
 "...Holding. Never dropped it.":"……守着。从没放下过。",
 "Both.":"都有。",
 "Good. Then the gate's ready. The drills aren't.":"好。那门准备好了。钻机还没有。",
 "Again?":"再来？",
 "Nothing gets past. Not even the smith.":"什么都过不去。连铁匠也不行。",
 "Each drill sunk into the Buried Meridian hangs from steel cables thick as an arm. Above and below, the layers blame each other for everything. Garo knows exactly whose steel this is.":"每台钻进被掩埋的子午线的钻机，都吊在手臂粗的钢缆上。上下各层把一切都怪到对方头上。加罗清楚地知道这是谁家的钢。",
 "Cut the drills loose at the Meridian":"在子午线斩断钻机",
 "The Drills at the Buried Meridian. Each rig hangs from humming cables thick as a man's arm. On the mountain, the bell has rung three times.":"被掩埋的子午线的钻机。每台钻机都吊在嗡嗡作响、人臂粗的钢缆上。山上，钟已经响了三下。",
 "Ferra's note came up this morning. Deepline's screens show Nyra, the Sky's singer, leading drills into their tunnels.":"费拉的字条今早送上来了。深线的屏幕上，天上的歌手妮拉正带着钻机钻进他们的隧道。",
 "The Sky's screens show a Deepline kid, Kael, venting the Core Sump on their labs. So each side blames the other.":"天上的屏幕上，一个叫凯尔的深线小子把核心污水坑的毒气排向他们的实验室。所以两边都怪对方。",
 "Ferra says faces are cheap and drills aren't. Same drills. Same steel. I'd know it blind. My wheel was cut from one.":"费拉说，脸不值钱，钻机可值钱。同样的钻机。同样的钢。闭着眼我都认得。我的飞轮就是从这种钻头上切下来的。",
 "The wheel goes out and comes back, out and back, singing. Every cable parts. The rigs sag, and Dune and Tarek's chain drags them under.":"飞轮飞出又飞回，飞出又飞回，呼啸作响。每根钢缆都断了。钻机瘫软下来，杜恩和塔里克的锁链把它们拖进了沙底。",
 "Wheel comes back. Drills don't.":"飞轮会回来。钻机不会。",
 "That night a crate comes up the lift. On the lid, in Ferra's scratch: Pell caught. Face-thief named. Rue. Wore both. Director's job. Still here. F.":"当晚，一只货箱随升降机升了上来。箱盖上是费拉刻的字：佩尔落网。窃脸者有名字了。露。两张脸都是她。总监指使。还在。——费",
 "Under the Pact's three banners Hollis writes a fourth. By morning four banners climb the Halcyon Spire, toward the Engine Core.":"霍利斯在盟约的三面旗帜下写下第四面。到了早上，四面旗帜已攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，向引擎核心进发。",
 "Triple bread tonight. Then I'm going up that Spire to see what an Engine's made of. Everything breaks, hit right.":"今晚送三倍面包。然后我要爬上那座尖塔，看看引擎是什么做的。什么东西都会碎，只要打对了地方。",
 "Ivo is up an hour before every dawn. So when Halcyon creeps up the mountain to gas the Hidden Village in its sleep, one boy is already warm, sweating, and delighted to see them.":"伊沃每天都比黎明早起一个小时。所以当哈尔西恩趁隐秘之村熟睡、悄悄摸上山来放毒气时，有个少年早已热好了身，满头大汗，见到他们高兴得不得了。",
 "Fight off the dawn raid on the village":"击退黎明时分的偷袭",
 "The Hidden Village, an hour before dawn. Frost on the stones, and steam rising off a boy halfway through his morning reps.":"黎明前一小时的隐秘之村。石头上结着霜，一个晨练做到一半的少年身上热气蒸腾。",
 "Four hundred and ninety-eight! Four hundred and ninety-nine! FIVE HUNDRED! Hah! Morning, mountain!":"四百九十八！四百九十九！五百！哈！早上好，大山！",
 "I climbed up here at fourteen. Hollis said wait for the sunrise. I waited a whole year of them. Worth it!":"我十四岁爬上这儿。霍利斯叫我等日出。我等了整整一年的日出。值了！",
 "Kid's awake. Gas him before he rouses the village. Quietly.":"那小鬼醒着。趁他还没吵醒村子，先把他毒倒。小声点。",
 "Quietly? I've been up two hours! You're late! Fist Storm!":"小声点？我都起来两个小时了！你们迟到了！拳风暴！",
 "Twelve punches in two seconds! They only needed three! The other nine were free!":"两秒十二拳！他们只需要三拳！另外九拳白送！",
 "The sun lifts over the peak. Ivo bows to it, still breathing hard, grinning.":"太阳从山峰后升起。伊沃向它鞠躬，还在大口喘气，咧着嘴笑。",
 "Beat you again, sun!":"又赢你一次，太阳！",
 "Ivo spars with Taro in the Village ring every dawn and has never once moved him. This dawn Halcyon's raiders are at the gate, and they, unlike Taro, move.":"伊沃每个黎明都在村中土俵和太郎对练，却从没推动过他一次。今天黎明，哈尔西恩的袭击者到了村门口，而他们可不像太郎，他们推得动。",
 "The Village ring at dawn. Salt on the earth, the rope pegged down. Taro stands in the middle, as he has since he was nine.":"黎明的村中土俵。土上撒着盐，草绳用木桩钉牢。太郎站在正中，从九岁起便是如此。",
 "Morning, Taro! Today's the day! I can feel it in my knees!":"早啊，太郎！就是今天了！我膝盖都感觉到了！",
 "You say this every morning.":"你每天早上都这么说。",
 "And one morning it'll be true! Hollis says a teacher and a wall are all I need. You're the wall!":"总有一天早上会成真的！霍利斯说，我只需要一位老师和一堵墙。你就是那堵墙！",
 "...Halcyon is at the gate. The wall would be grateful for some help.":"……哈尔西恩到村门口了。这堵墙很乐意有人帮忙。",
 "YES! Something that actually moves when I hit it!":"太好了！总算有打了会动的东西了！",
 "Fast. Very fast. And still, you have not moved me.":"快。非常快。可你还是没推动我。",
 "Tomorrow! Before dawn! I'll bring breakfast!":"明天！黎明之前！我带早饭来！",
 "I will be here. Bring rice.":"我会在这里。带米饭来。",
 "Lin of the Sky Clan has sealed Ivo twice and calls his style loud. Now she has climbed the mountain with a question for the Surface, and Hollis says Ivo's fists are the answer.":"天空氏族的琳封住过伊沃两次，说他的路数太吵。如今她带着一个给地表的问题爬上山来，而霍利斯说，伊沃的拳头就是答案。",
 "Duel Lin. Land one hit.":"与琳决斗。打中一拳。",
 "Ivo. The Sky Clan asks whether the Surface will stand against Halcyon. Hollis says you are the answer.":"伊沃。天空氏族想知道，地表是否会起来对抗哈尔西恩。霍利斯说，你就是答案。",
 "Me? Great! ...Wait. You've sealed me twice. Is this a trick?":"我？太好了！……等等。你封过我两次了。这是个圈套吗？",
 "A question. Twice I sealed you. You are loud. Loud is not ready.":"是个问题。我封过你两次。你太吵。吵不等于准备好了。",
 "Loud gets heard! One hit, Lin. That's my answer. One clean hit.":"吵才有人听见！一拳，琳。这就是我的答案。干干净净的一拳。",
 "I LANDED ONE! Did everyone see? TARO, DID YOU SEE?":"我打中了一拳！大家都看见了吗？太郎，你看见了吗？",
 "Strike five. Lin seals him mid-shout. He goes stiff as a fence post, still grinning.":"第五击。琳在他喊到一半时封住了他。他僵得像根篱笆桩，还咧着嘴笑。",
 "Three seals now. And one hit. I will tell the Sky Clan the Surface is ready. Noisily, it seems.":"如今是三次封印。外加一拳。我会告诉天空氏族：地表准备好了。看来，是吵吵闹闹地准备好了。",
 "Breathe out, loud one. Slower. Again, when your breath is ready.":"呼气，吵闹的家伙。慢一点。等你的气息准备好了，再来。",
 "Halcyon's drills are grinding down on the buried city, and every town is shouting about two faces on a screen. Ivo has trained his whole life for something this big to hit.":"哈尔西恩的钻机正朝被埋的城市碾磨下去，每座城镇都在为屏幕上的两张脸吵嚷。伊沃苦练一辈子，等的就是这么大一个能打的东西。",
 "Break the drill line at the Meridian":"在子午线打垮钻机阵线",
 "The Drills at the Buried Meridian. A line of Halcyon drill-heads grinds down toward the city under the sand.":"被掩埋的子午线的钻机。一排哈尔西恩钻头正朝沙下的城市碾磨下去。",
 "Everyone's yelling about the screens! Kael, the Deepline kid, gassing the Sky's labs! Nyra, the Sky singer, drilling Deepline!":"大家都在为屏幕吵吵嚷嚷！深线小子凯尔，毒气熏了天上的实验室！天上的歌手妮拉，钻穿了深线！",
 "The Sky blames Deepline. Deepline blames the Sky. The Elder says: when everyone shouts, watch who is silent.":"天上怪深线。深线怪天上。长老说过：所有人都在叫嚷时，看看谁不出声。",
 "Halcyon! Silent! And drilling! Lin said the Sky Clan never believed it, and Lin is never wrong. Annoyingly.":"哈尔西恩！不出声！还在钻！琳说天空氏族从来就没信过，而琳从来不会错。烦人得很。",
 "Dune and Tarek hold one chain between them. Then Oda's bell rings three times. It has not rung three in ninety-six years.":"杜恩和塔里克共握一条锁链。接着，奥达的钟响了三下。九十六年来，它从没响过三下。",
 "THREE! The whole Surface is coming! I'm not waiting for them. Twelve punches a second. How long does a drill last?":"三下！整个地表都要来了！我才不等他们。每秒十二拳。一台钻机能撑多久？",
 "A minute and a half of Fist Storm. The first drill-head comes apart like a sandcastle in the tide. Then the next.":"一分半钟的拳风暴。第一个钻头像潮水里的沙堡一样散了架。然后是下一个。",
 "That's a thousand and eighty! Did anybody count? Somebody count!":"一共一千零八十拳！有人数了吗？谁来数一下！",
 "Pell names the face-thief: Rue, his faceless spy, wearing faces for the Director. Kiri's crane flies it to the Crater, and a second Kael runs.":"佩尔说出了窃脸者的名字：露，他的无面密探，替总监戴上别人的脸。基里的纸鹤把消息送到陨坑，第二个凯尔逃了。",
 "Hollis paints a fourth banner. Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core, before whatever it's calling answers.":"霍利斯画下第四面旗帜。四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，向引擎核心进发，要赶在它召唤的东西应答之前。",
 "A tower full of stairs! Best training day of my LIFE! Elder, wait, I'm coming!":"一整座塔的台阶！这辈子最棒的训练日！长老，等等我，我来了！",
 "For years one man and one round shield have filled the Hidden Village's gate. Today Halcyon has brought a drill to empty it.":"多年来，一个男人和一面圆盾填满了隐秘之村的村门。今天，哈尔西恩带来一台钻机，要把它清空。",
 "Nothing gets past. Nothing has. Nothing will.":"什么都过不去。从没过去过。以后也不会。",
 "Bring the drill.":"把钻机拿来。",
 "Garo. Scratched.":"加罗。刮花了。",
 "Give it here. I'll beat it out by supper.":"拿来。晚饭前我给你敲平。",
 "Leave it. Character.":"留着。有个性。",
 "In the Tether Fields, under the ropes that hold a city in the sky, the gale shoves Hart's caravan sideways between anchor stones tall as towers. Halcyon riders come in on the wind.":"系索原野上，在那些把一座城拴在天上的绳索之下，狂风把哈特的商队往塔一般高的锚石之间横推。哈尔西恩骑手乘风而来。",
 "Shield the caravan with Hart":"与哈特护住商队",
 "The Tether Fields. Ropes thick as houses run up into the cloud, and the gale shoves the caravan sideways.":"系索原野。房子那么粗的绳索一直伸进云里，狂风把商队往旁边推。",
 "Tor. Riders, left side, four hundred paces and closing. Halcyon colours. Keep the wagons in line.":"托尔。骑手，左侧，四百步，正在逼近。哈尔西恩的旗色。让车队保持队形。",
 "Shield left. Spear behind.":"盾在左。矛在后。",
 "Standard.":"老规矩。",
 "Arrows bounce. Riders bounce. Wind bounces.":"箭会弹开。骑手会弹开。风也会弹开。",
 "Wind doesn't bounce, Tor. That's not a rule. That's weather.":"风可弹不开，托尔。那不是规矩。那是天气。",
 "...The wind bounced. I'm noting that as an exception.":"……风弹开了。我把这记作一次例外。",
 "Told you.":"说过了。",
 "(Nine years he hasn't noticed. Not my place.)":"（九年了他都没发现。轮不到我说破。）",
 "On the Surface they say a knight in Aurelia holds a line as well as Tor holds a gate. Tor has ridden the Skylift up with a caravan to see for himself.":"地表上的人说，奥蕾莉亚有个骑士守阵线守得和托尔守门一样好。托尔随商队乘天梯上去，要亲眼看看。",
 "Duel Aldric at the Skyport":"在天港与奥德瑞决斗",
 "No Surface goods pass the Skyport without Halcyon's seal. Turn back, and I will not hold it against you.":"没有哈尔西恩的印章，地表货物一律不得通过天港。回去吧，我不会因此怪罪你们。",
 "Aldric. The knight who holds a line.":"奥德瑞。那个守得住阵线的骑士。",
 "I am. And you are the wall on the Surface that no one has ever passed. I have heard of you, shield-bearer.":"正是。而你就是地表上那堵从没人越过的墙。我听说过你，持盾者。",
 "Then we find out.":"那就试试看。",
 "Shield against greatsword. Neither gives. Then a Halcyon drone wing dives on the caravan, and both of them move at once.":"盾对巨剑。谁都不让。然后，一队哈尔西恩无人机俯冲向商队，两人同时动了。",
 "You too. Who's your oath to, knight?":"你也是。你的誓言是向谁立的，骑士？",
 "To the people behind the wall. Always. I begin to wonder whether the Director remembers that.":"向墙后的人们。永远如此。我开始怀疑，总监是否还记得这一点。",
 "Come down to the Surface. Two walls hold better than one.":"下来地表吧。两堵墙比一堵守得牢。",
 "Hold, Surface wall. You held well. It was not quite enough today.":"到此为止吧，地表之墙。你守得很好。只是今天还差了一点。",
 "Three tolls of Oda's bell have brought forty towns to the Buried Meridian, where Halcyon's drills are boring down toward Deepline. Hart takes the front of the column. Tor takes the flank.":"奥达的三声钟响，把四十座城镇召到了被掩埋的子午线，哈尔西恩的钻机正在那里朝深线钻下去。哈特领纵队前锋。托尔守侧翼。",
 "Hold the column's flank at the Meridian":"在子午线守住纵队侧翼",
 "The Drills at the Buried Meridian. Oda rang three times, and the Surface came: forty towns in one column. Hart has the front. Tor, the flank.":"被掩埋的子午线的钻机。奥达敲了三下，地表的人都来了：四十座城镇，排成一支纵队。哈特守前锋。托尔，守侧翼。",
 "Above and below, every screen plays two films: Kael of Deepline gassing the Sky's labs, Nyra of the Sky drilling Deepline. Each side blames the other.":"上上下下，每块屏幕都在放两段影片：深线的凯尔毒气熏了天上的实验室，天上的妮拉钻穿了深线。两边都怪对方。",
 "Up top they want Deepline's blood. Down below, the Sky's. And these drills go straight through us to get there.":"上面的人想要深线的血。下面的人，想要天上的。而这些钻机，要从我们身上钻穿过去才到得了。",
 "Faces are a gate. Nobody guarded it.":"脸是一扇门。没人守着。",
 "This flank, somebody guards.":"这边侧翼，有人守。",
 "Drill crews, drones, dig mechs. Each hits the shield and stops, like rain on a roof. Ahead, Dune and Tarek drag the rigs under on one chain.":"钻机队，无人机，挖掘机甲。每一个撞上盾都停住了，像雨点打在屋顶上。前方，杜恩和塔里克用同一条锁链把钻机拖进了沙底。",
 "In the Sky, Aldric has turned his knights around. In the Pit, Pell is caught, and names the face-thief: Rue, his faceless spy, sent by the Director.":"天上，奥德瑞调转了他的骑士。深坑里，佩尔落网，说出了窃脸者的名字：露，他的无面密探，是总监派来的。",
 "One mask. Two faces. Whole war.":"一张面具。两张脸。一场战争。",
 "Hollis writes a fourth banner. Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core, before whatever it calls can answer. Tor's shield goes first.":"霍利斯写下第四面旗帜。四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，向引擎核心进发，要赶在它召唤的东西应答之前。托尔的盾走在最前面。",
 "Knight's on the far side. Good. Now I watch him hold.":"骑士在另一边。很好。现在我看他守。",
 "A thunderstorm splits open over the Crusher Yard and drops a boy in the trash. Halcyon's collectors are already coming to number him.":"一场雷暴在粉碎场上空裂开，把一个男孩丢进了垃圾堆。哈尔西恩的收集人已经在路上，要给他编号。",
 "Fight your way out of the Crusher Yard":"杀出粉碎场",
 "The Crusher Yard. Rain on rust, a crane groaning in the dark. The air over the heap tears open, and a boy falls out of a storm.":"粉碎场。雨打铁锈，一台吊车在黑暗中呻吟。废料堆上方的空气撕裂开来，一个男孩从风暴里掉了出来。",
 "Breathing! Name's Kael. And I'm nobody's salvage.":"活的！我叫凯尔。我不是谁的废品。",
 "Collection order. Charged object landed in the Yard. Bag it, tag it, number it, send it up.":"收集令。带电物体落入粉碎场。装袋，贴签，编号，送上去。",
 "Number me? Sure. Start by counting these.":"给我编号？行啊。先把这几下数清楚。",
 "Lightning out of a scrap pile. I'm keeping you. Salvage rights.":"废铁堆里蹦出一道闪电。你归我了。捡到就是我的。",
 "Halcyon wants the storm in a jar? Let's find out what thunder does to glass.":"哈尔西恩想把风暴装进罐子？那就看看雷霆碰上玻璃会怎样。",
 "Kael scratched Vharra's storm-eye on his jacket to remember where he came from. A hunter from the steppe reads it, just as Halcyon's collectors hit the stairs.":"凯尔在夹克上刻下瓦拉的风暴之眼，好记住自己从哪里来。一个来自草原的猎人认出了它，而哈尔西恩的收集人恰在此时冲上楼梯。",
 "That storm-eye on your jacket. Who carved Vharra's mark into Deepline tin?":"你夹克上那个风暴之眼。是谁把瓦拉的印记刻在深线的铁皮上的？",
 "Me. So I don't forget which sky dropped me. You're from the steppe too?":"我刻的。免得我忘了是哪片天把我丢下来的。你也是草原来的？",
 "Hunting clans. My wolf ran at the tear when it took me. You're storm-clan, kid. And you're down here alone.":"猎人部族。裂隙把我卷走时，我的狼朝它扑了过去。你是风暴部族的，小子。而你在这底下孤身一人。",
 "He is NOT alone. Rook. His brother. We've done a whole week of brothering. Ask anyone. Ask me. Ask me.":"他才不是一个人。我是鲁克。他兄弟。我们已经当了整整一星期的兄弟了。不信问谁都行。问我。问我啊。",
 "One week down here and I've got two brothers. Deepline's better than it smells.":"来这底下才一星期，我就有了两个兄弟。深线比它闻起来强多了。",
 "Halcyon tells Kael an escaped Subject called Nyra sold out the tunnels. At the Crater he meets a singer who was told the very same thing about him.":"哈尔西恩告诉凯尔，一个叫妮拉的出逃实验体出卖了隧道。在陨坑，他遇见一位歌者，而她听到的关于他的说法一模一样。",
 "The Crater, under a bruised violet sky. Wind off the rim, ash in the teeth. A girl in a Subject's grey is waiting.":"陨坑，天空紫得像一块淤青。风从坑沿刮来，灰烬塞满牙缝。一个穿着实验体灰衣的女孩在等着。",
 "Nyra. They say you sold Halcyon every hideout in Deepline, door by door.":"妮拉。听说你把深线的每一个藏身处都卖给了哈尔西恩，一扇门接一扇门。",
 "Then fight louder than I sing, Deepline. Let's hear it.":"那就打得比我唱得还响吧，深线人。让我听听。",
 "So who'd they show you? Because that wasn't me in those vents.":"那他们给你看的是谁？因为通风口那边的人可不是我。",
 "Someone with your face. And someone with mine walking your tunnels, I'd bet.":"一个长着你这张脸的人。我敢打赌，还有一个长着我这张脸的人，正在你们的隧道里走动。",
 "Up. If you really opened those vents, I've barely started.":"起来。如果那些通风口真是你打开的，我才刚刚开始。",
 "Every screen shows Kael gassing the Sky's labs, and the Sky believes it. Kael was asleep on Rook's floor. Somebody is wearing his face, and the strings lead to the Pit.":"每块屏幕都在播凯尔用毒气熏天上的实验室，天上的人也信了。可凯尔那晚睡在鲁克的地板上。有人戴着他的脸，而丝线一路通向深坑。",
 "Fight through the Pit Arena to Pell":"杀穿深坑竞技场，直抵佩尔",
 "The Three-Layer War. Every screen in every layer plays two films: Kael unsealing the Core Sump over the Sky's labs, Nyra leading Halcyon's drills into Deepline.":"三层之战。每一层的每块屏幕都在放两段影像：凯尔在天上的实验室下方打开核心污水坑，妮拉领着哈尔西恩的钻机钻进深线。",
 "The Sky blames Deepline. Deepline blames the Sky. Tonight the Noble Ring burns, drills chew at the Buried Meridian, and Halcyon floods the Pit Arena.":"天上怪深线。深线怪天上。今夜贵族环区燃起大火，钻机啃噬着被掩埋的子午线，哈尔西恩的人潮涌进深坑竞技场。",
 "Everyone up top says you gassed their labs. You were snoring on my floor all night!":"上面的人都说是你用毒气熏了他们的实验室。你明明整晚都在我地板上打呼噜！",
 "Somebody wore my face to start a war. Faces don't walk around by themselves. Somebody's holding the strings.":"有人戴着我的脸挑起了战争。脸不会自己到处乱走。有人在背后牵着线。",
 "The strings run to the Pit. To Pell. They always did.":"线通向深坑。通向佩尔。一直都是。",
 "Then we cut every last one, and I go meet the thief who wears me.":"那我们就把线一根不剩全部斩断，然后我去会会那个戴着我的脸的贼。",
 "Her name is Rue, dear boy. A thing with no face of its own. I taught her yours. She's at the Crater now, wearing it.":"她叫露，亲爱的孩子。一个没有自己面孔的东西。是我把你的脸教给了她。她现在就在陨坑，戴着它。",
 "Then the Crater hears it from me first! Hang on, Kael. My crane outflies any rumour going.":"那陨坑就得先从我这儿听到！撑住，凯尔。我的纸鹤比任何谣言都飞得快。",
 "The Crater. Kael and Nyra stand face to face between two roaring crowds, each layer sure the other is Halcyon's.":"陨坑。凯尔与妮拉在两群咆哮的人潮之间面对面站着，每一层都认定对方是哈尔西恩的人。",
 "A shout: there's a second Kael in the crowd. Kael turns to look. The copy meets his eyes, and runs. Rue is gone.":"一声大喊：人群里还有第二个凯尔。凯尔转头去看。那个复制品与他四目相对，然后拔腿就跑。露不见了。",
 "Hollis raises a fourth banner under the Pact's three. Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core, which hums like it's calling something.":"霍利斯在盟约的三面旗帜下升起第四面。四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，直指引擎核心，而引擎嗡嗡作响，像在呼唤着什么。",
 "Up the Spire, then. Director, you threw me in the trash. I'm hauling it all back up to you.":"那就上尖塔。总监，你把我扔进了垃圾堆。现在我把这些全都拖上去还给你。",
 "Half of Deepline sleeps warm because Subject 60 is in pain. For a year Ashka has hung in the furnace at the bottom of everything, and tonight the wardens come to stoke her hotter.":"深线有一半人睡得暖和，是因为60号实验体在受苦。一年来，阿什卡被吊在万物最底层的熔炉里；今夜，看守们又来给她加火了。",
 "Burn the wardens out of the Core Sump":"把看守烧出核心污水坑",
 "The Core Sump. The furnace under all of Deepline, where Aurelia's rubbish burns and a chain glows cherry-red around one woman.":"核心污水坑。整个深线底下的熔炉，奥蕾莉亚的垃圾在这里焚烧，一条烧得樱桃红的锁链缠着一个女人。",
 "At home I kept the vents under the Frozen Harbour. Red, slow, patient. Nobody had to chain them.":"在家乡，我看守冰封港湾下的地热口。红色，缓慢，耐心。从来不需要谁去锁住它们。",
 "Slum heat's down four degrees. Stoke Sixty. Prods on three, and log the noise as output.":"贫民窟温度降了四度。给六十号加火。电棍数到三，把噪音记作产出。",
 "A year of your prods. A year of the Slums sleeping warm on it.":"你们的电棍戳了我一年。贫民窟就靠这个睡了一年暖觉。",
 "Tonight I give the heat back. All of it. Come closer.":"今夜我把热还回去。全部。走近些。",
 "The chain holds. The wardens do not. One of those will change.":"锁链撑住了。看守们没撑住。这两者之中，总有一个会变。",
 "Far above, something knocks on the iron. Three taps come ringing down the pipes, as they have every night for a year.":"遥远的上方，有什么在敲击铁壁。三声叩响顺着管道叮当传下来，一年来夜夜如此。",
 "Still burning, whoever you are. Keep knocking.":"还在烧，不管你是谁。继续敲。",
 "After a year of taps through the pipes, someone climbs down the boiler shaft into the Sump. Ashka is about to hear her own name in a voice, and the wardens have seen him come.":"管道里的叩击响了一年之后，有人顺着锅炉竖井爬进了污水坑。阿什卡就要听见有人亲口喊出她的名字，而看守们已经看见他来了。",
 "Hold the Core Sump with Fumi":"与芙美守住核心污水坑",
 "...Hello. It's me. The taps. Found the hatch. Took a year.":"……你好。是我。敲管子的。找到了舱口。花了一年。",
 "You are bigger than your knocking. And quieter.":"你比你的敲击声要高大。也更安静。",
 "Fumi. Boilers, up top. Every night my pipes ran hot, and the heat was you. Couldn't sleep warm on it.":"芙美。锅炉，在上面。每天夜里我的管子都烫，那热是你。那份暖，我睡不安稳。",
 "Ashka. Not Sixty. Say it once, so I know it still sounds like a name.":"阿什卡。不是六十号。说一遍，让我知道它听起来还像个名字。",
 "Ashka.":"阿什卡。",
 "Unlogged civilian in the Sump. Bring the cold lances. Freeze the pair of them if you must.":"污水坑里有未登记的平民。带冷冻长枪来。必要时把他们俩一起冻上。",
 "I hold things in. Most nights. Not this one.":"我习惯把事憋在心里。大多数夜里都是。今夜不。",
 "That door. Give me time. Enough pressure in my pipes and it leaves its hinges.":"那扇门。给我点时间。我管道里的压力够了，它就会从门轴上飞出去。",
 "I have waited a year on a chain. I can wait on a gauge.":"我在锁链上等了一年。盯着一块压力表等，我也等得起。",
 "Then the vents above them roar. Fire is pouring down from somewhere far overhead, and it is not hers.":"就在这时，头顶的通风口轰鸣起来。火焰从极高的地方倾泻而下，而那不是她的火。",
 "A girl falls out of the vents in a rain of burning ash, with the Burn Ward's fire chasing her all the way down. Neither knows the other is from the Harbour. Both want to know who burns hotter.":"一个女孩在燃烧的灰烬雨中从通风口掉了下来，烧伤病房的火一路追着她烧到底。两人都不知道对方也来自港湾。两人都想知道谁烧得更旺。",
 "Duel Pyra in the Core Sump":"在核心污水坑与派拉决斗",
 "Ash pours from the vent mouth, then a girl, then the fire behind her. The Burn Ward has burned all the way to the bottom.":"灰烬从通风口涌出，接着是一个女孩，再接着是她身后的火。烧伤病房一路烧到了最底层。",
 "Oh, come ON. Another furnace? They built one down here too? I just melted theirs to the bolts.":"哦，饶了我吧！又一座熔炉？他们在这下面也建了一座？我才刚把他们那座熔得只剩螺栓。",
 "I am not their furnace. I am the fuel. And you are on fire in my house.":"我不是他们的熔炉。我是燃料。而你，正在我家里着火。",
 "Everything's on fire, lava lady. Let's see which of us is hotter.":"什么都在着火，岩浆大姐。来看看我们谁更烫。",
 "Come, little spark. The Sump has all night.":"来吧，小火星。污水坑有一整夜的时间。",
 "...Fine. FINE. You're hotter. Nobody's hotter than me. Who even are you?":"……行。行了！你更烫。没人比我更烫。你到底是谁啊？",
 "Ashka. Of the Frozen Harbour. I tended the deep vents there, before they chained me to this one.":"阿什卡。冰封港湾的。在他们把我锁到这一座之前，我在那里照看深处的地热口。",
 "Pyra. Harbour too, the blue forge on the north quay. Six weeks in their Burn Ward nearly did me in. You did a year?":"派拉。也是港湾的，北码头那座蓝色锻炉。他们的烧伤病房关了我六个星期，差点要了我的命。你待了一年？",
 "Aw. Did you go out? Up, lava lady. I'm barely warm.":"哎呀。你熄了？起来，岩浆大姐。我才刚热起来呢。",
 "Every screen shows a Deepline boy gassing the Sky's labs from her furnace, and a Sky girl leading drills into Deepline. Ashka was there when the boy came. Tonight Fumi's pressure and Dyna's bombs come for her door.":"每块屏幕都在播一个深线男孩从她的熔炉里放毒气熏天上的实验室，还有一个天上的女孩领着钻机钻进深线。那男孩来的时候，阿什卡就在那里。今夜，芙美的压力和黛娜的炸弹要来轰开她的门。",
 "Hold the Sump until the door blows":"守住污水坑，直到门被炸开",
 "The night of the Strings Cut. Every screen in the three layers plays two films, over and over.":"丝线斩断之夜。三层的每块屏幕都在放两段影像，一遍又一遍。",
 "In one, Deepline's Kael opens the Sump's vents on the Sky's labs. In the other, the Sky's Nyra waves Halcyon's drills into Deepline.":"一段里，深线的凯尔打开污水坑的通风口，灌向天上的实验室。另一段里，天上的妮拉挥手把哈尔西恩的钻机引进深线。",
 "I saw that boy at my vents. White hair, his face. He stood in my heat and did not sweat. Everyone sweats down here.":"我在我的通风口见过那个男孩。白头发，他的脸。他站在我的热浪里，一滴汗都没出。在这下面，人人都会出汗。",
 "Drills in the tunnels. Gauge in the red. Dyna's at the door with a bag that ticks.":"钻机进了隧道。压力表到了红线。黛娜拎着一个嘀嗒响的包到了门口。",
 "One door, four kilos, lots of love. Stand back, Ashka. Or don't. You're basically lava.":"一扇门，四公斤，满满的爱。退后，阿什卡。要么就别退。你基本上就是岩浆。",
 "Open it. The wardens come through me first.":"开吧。看守们得先过我这一关。",
 "The door leaves the Sump like a cork from a bottle. Ashka walks out of the furnace for the first time in a year. The chain stays.":"那扇门像软木塞出瓶一样飞离了污水坑。一年来第一次，阿什卡走出了熔炉。锁链留在了原地。",
 "Each layer blamed the other, as the Director meant. In the Pit, Pell hangs in his own Cradle and names his faceless spy: Rue wore both faces.":"正如总监所愿，每一层都怪罪另一层。在深坑，佩尔被吊在自己的翻花绳里，说出了他那个无面间谍：两张脸都是露戴的。",
 "The Sky's knights have turned and the Surface's bell has rung three times. Hollis raises a fourth banner, and four climb the Spire.":"天上的骑士们倒戈了，地表的钟敲了三下。霍利斯升起第四面旗帜，四面旗帜攀上尖塔。",
 "The Engine Core waits at the top. It has been calling into the dark a long time. I am done being its fuel.":"引擎核心在顶上等着。它朝黑暗呼唤了很久很久。我不再做它的燃料了。",
 "On Vharra she set one tube in the grass and turned the festival sky gold. In the Scrapworks every problem is a demolition job, and tonight Halcyon's collection crew is the problem.":"在瓦拉，她在草地上插了一根管子，就把节日的天空染成了金色。在废料工坊，每个问题都是一桩爆破活儿；而今夜的问题，是哈尔西恩的收集队。",
 "Blast Halcyon out of the Scrapworks":"把哈尔西恩炸出废料工坊",
 "The Scrapworks. Scorched benches, a reek of sulphur, and a girl with no eyebrows humming over a box of wires.":"废料工坊。烧焦的工作台，一股硫磺味，还有一个没有眉毛的女孩对着一箱电线哼着歌。",
 "Problem: Halcyon sent a collection crew for the girl who makes things go boom. Solution, and sorry, it's obvious: boom.":"问题：哈尔西恩派了一支收集队，来抓那个能让东西轰隆一声的女孩。解决方案嘛，抱歉，太明显了：轰。",
 "Collection target, explosives class. Approach with caution. She's... she is lighting something.":"收集目标，爆炸物级。谨慎接近。她在……她在点什么东西。",
 "Grenade, mine or rocket? Pick a favourite. Trick question. You're getting all three.":"手雷、地雷还是火箭？挑一个最喜欢的。陷阱题。三样你全都有份。",
 "Look at that crater. Look at the lip on it. Somebody frame that.":"瞧瞧这个坑。瞧瞧这坑沿。谁去给它裱个框。",
 "Halcyon wants my bombs in a jar? Tell them to bring a bigger jar. And earplugs. And a new building.":"哈尔西恩想把我的炸弹装进罐子？让他们带个更大的罐子来。再带副耳塞。再带栋新楼。",
 "Dyna needs someone who can stand next to her work without falling over. Mako, a dock hand, has built a suit that nothing will ever crush again, and he wants it tested.":"黛娜需要一个能站在她的作品旁边而不被掀翻的人。码头工马科造了一身再也没有什么能压扁的战甲，正想找人试一试。",
 "Hold the Scrapworks with Mako":"与马科守住废料工坊",
 "YOU'RE THE BOMB GIRL. ...Sorry. Suit's loud. I've got a cannon on it. Cannon's empty.":"你就是那个炸弹女孩！……抱歉。战甲嗓门大。上面装了门炮。炮是空的。",
 "A walking cannon with nothing in it? Saddest thing I've ever seen. Can it take a blast?":"一门肚子里空空的、会走路的大炮？这是我见过最惨的东西。它扛得住爆炸吗？",
 "Got crushed under a crate once. Built this so nothing crushes me again. Go on. Try.":"我被一只板条箱压过一回。造了这身，就再没什么能压扁我。来吧。试试。",
 "Ooh. Okay. Three, two... hold very still, big man.":"哦。好嘞。三，二……别动啊，大个子。",
 "Oh, I love you. Professionally. Partners: I make, you carry, and I ride on your shoulders.":"哦，我爱你。职业上的那种。搭档：我造，你扛，我骑在你肩膀上。",
 "Their captain's down. Suit's fine. You?":"他们的队长倒了。战甲没事。你呢？",
 "Never better. Hey. Fumi up at the boilers says there's a door under his floor, and a woman chained in a furnace behind it.":"好得不能再好。嘿。锅炉房的芙美说，他地板底下有扇门，门后有个女人被锁在熔炉里。",
 "That door needs a year of steam and the biggest bang I've ever built. I want it. I want it so much.":"那扇门需要一年的蒸汽，再加上我造过的最大的一声轰。我想要。我太想要了。",
 "Jax, who keeps the Long Bar at Mile Zero up on the Surface, has ridden all the way down to the Scrapworks. Word up top is that Dyna can't keep time. She has offered to show him a fuse.":"在地表零英里经营长吧台的杰克斯，一路骑马下到了废料工坊。上面都传黛娜掐不准时间。她提出要给他看看引信。",
 "Duel Jax in the Scrapworks":"在废料工坊与杰克斯决斗",
 "Long ride down from Mile Zero, partner. Folks up top say you got no sense of timing.":"从零英里骑下来可真远，伙计。上面的人都说你毫无时机感。",
 "Folks say a lot of things. I said I'd show you a real fuse, cowboy, and you came. Sweet.":"人们说的多了。我说过要给你看一根真正的引信，牛仔，你还真来了。真好。",
 "Six in the wheel. I count every one. You count anything?":"弹巢里六发。每一发我都数着。你数过什么吗？",
 "Three, two, one. That's all the counting a fuse ever needs.":"三，二，一。一根引信需要数的，就这么多。",
 "Timing's the whole art. The bang's just the applause.":"时机就是全部的艺术。那一声轰，不过是掌声。",
 "Drinks at the Long Bar, then. Water's cold. Floor's fireproof. Mostly.":"那就去长吧台喝一杯。水是凉的。地板防火。大部分防火。",
 "Halcyon's drills are in Deepline, and each layer's screens blame the other's people. Under all the shouting, a door in the Core Sump is still shut, and Dyna has saved her biggest bang for it.":"哈尔西恩的钻机进了深线，每一层的屏幕都在怪罪另一层的人。在所有喧嚣之下，核心污水坑里有扇门依然紧闭，而黛娜把她最大的一声轰留给了它。",
 "Fight to the Sump door and blow it":"杀到污水坑门前，炸开它",
 "The night of the Strings Cut. Drills grind through Deepline's walls, and every screen plays two films on a loop.":"丝线斩断之夜。钻机碾穿深线的墙壁，每块屏幕都在循环播放两段影像。",
 "Down here: the Sky's Nyra waving the drills in. Up in Aurelia: Deepline's Kael opening the Sump's vents on their labs. Each side blames the other.":"这下面放的是：天上的妮拉挥手把钻机引进来。上面的奥蕾莉亚放的是：深线的凯尔打开污水坑的通风口，灌向他们的实验室。两边都怪对方。",
 "I saw her! Ice girl, right out in front of the drills, waving them on like a parade!":"我看见她了！冰女孩，就站在钻机最前面，挥手招呼它们，跟游行似的！",
 "A singer Halcyon kept in a tank, leading Halcyon's drills? Wrong colour smoke. Somebody's faking the show.":"一个被哈尔西恩关在缸里的歌手，去给哈尔西恩的钻机带路？烟的颜色不对。有人在演戏。",
 "Whoever it was. Ashka's still down there. Gauge is red. The door, Dyna.":"不管是谁。阿什卡还在下面。压力表红了。那扇门，黛娜。",
 "Front-row seat for every eruption you ever have. That's my fee.":"你以后每一次喷发，我都要坐头排。这就是我的酬劳。",
 "In the Pit, Pell hangs in his own Cradle and names his faceless spy. Rue wore both faces, on the Director's orders.":"在深坑，佩尔被吊在自己的翻花绳里，说出了他的无面间谍。两张脸都是露戴的，奉的是总监的命令。",
 "Kiri's crane flies the name to the Crater. The Sky and the Surface have risen too. Under four banners, the layers climb the Spire toward the Engine Core.":"基里的纸鹤把这个名字送到了陨坑。天上和地表也都起来了。四面旗帜之下，三层一同攀上尖塔，直指引擎核心。",
 "Something's ticking at the top of that tower. I know a fuse when I hear one. Let's go cut it.":"那座塔顶上有东西在嘀嗒响。引信的声音我一听就知道。走，去把它掐了。",
 "Dockside Nine sits where the Drowned Line runs out. Everything there is out of reach except to Bando. Halcyon has heard about his arms, and sent a net.":"九号码头位于溺亡线的尽头。那里的一切都够不着，除了班多。哈尔西恩听说了他的手臂，派来了一张网。",
 "Hold Dockside Nine against Halcyon":"守住九号码头，挡住哈尔西恩",
 "Dockside Nine, the last wharf on the Drowned Line. Black water, wet rope, crane hooks nobody can reach. Except him.":"九号码头，溺亡线的最后一座码头。黑水，湿绳，谁也够不着的吊钩。除了他。",
 "Did I ever tell you about the kite? Festival day on Vharra. One little girl, one tall tree. Everybody climbs. Not me. I reach.":"我跟你讲过那只风筝没有？瓦拉的节日。一个小女孩，一棵高高的树。大家都去爬。我不爬。我伸手。",
 "That's the stretchy one. Reach like that is Subject grade. Net him and log the arms.":"就是那个能伸长的。这种臂展够得上实验体级别。把他网住，手臂登记在案。",
 "Net me? From way over there? Buddy, way over there is eleven arm's lengths. Easy.":"网我？从那么远？伙计，那么远也就十一个臂长。轻轻松松。",
 "You came all the way down here to get punched from the far end of the dock. Respect. Wrong, but respect.":"你们大老远跑下来，就为了在码头另一头挨揍。佩服。错了，但佩服。",
 "Right after the kite. It goes kite, then this. It's a set.":"排在风筝后面讲。先风筝，再这个。这是一套的。",
 "Halcyon has bricked up the old cargo tunnel with Bando's crates behind it. Dyna is offering him a hole, and something small and paper is drifting down the shaft toward them.":"哈尔西恩把旧货运隧道砌死了，班多的货箱还在里头。黛娜愿意送他一个洞，而一样小小的纸东西正顺着竖井朝他们飘下来。",
 "Hold the cargo tunnel with Dyna":"与黛娜守住货运隧道",
 "Bando! Halcyon bricked up the cargo tunnel with your crates behind it. Want a hole? I've got a hole. Hole's free.":"班多！哈尔西恩把货运隧道砌死了，你的货箱还在里头。要个洞吗？我这儿有洞。洞免费。",
 "I always want a hole. You blow it, I reach through it. Best job on the docks.":"洞我永远都要。你来炸，我伸手进去掏。码头上最好的活儿。",
 "Stand back. Or, you know. Stretch back.":"退后。或者，你懂的。往后伸。",
 "Wait! Look up! A Paper Post kite, down the whole shaft, with a note pinned to its tail.":"等等！往上看！一只纸鹤邮驿的风筝，顺着整条竖井飘下来，尾巴上别着一张字条。",
 "It's from Sora! The kite girl! She says Gale still owes me a kite. See? SEE? It happened!":"是索拉寄来的！那个风筝女孩！她说盖尔还欠我一只风筝。看见没？看见没有？！真有这回事！",
 "Nobody said it didn't, Bando. We just heard it a lot. Halcyon's coming through the hole. Reach, hero.":"没人说没有啊，班多。我们只是听了太多遍。哈尔西恩从洞里过来了。伸手吧，英雄。",
 "Reeled him in, let him go. Elastic. It's science.":"拽进来，再松手。有弹性。这叫科学。",
 "Write back to Sora for me, Dyna. Tell her the arm's still long, and I tell it right every time.":"帮我给索拉回信，黛娜。告诉她胳膊还是那么长，而且我每次都讲得一字不差。",
 "Tarek, chief of the Surface's chain raiders, has come down to Dockside Nine to settle whose reach is longer. Bando has made very sure the whole dock turned out to watch.":"地表锁链掠夺者的首领塔里克来到九号码头，要定一定谁够得更远。班多确保了整座码头的人都来围观。",
 "Duel Tarek for the longest reach":"与塔里克决斗，比谁够得最远",
 "So this is Dockside Nine. Smells like rope and bragging. Heard you tell the Surface your reach beats mine.":"原来这就是九号码头。一股绳子和吹牛的味道。听说你跟地表的人讲，你的臂展比我长。",
 "Told everybody. Every day. And you came down to measure! Did you bring a tape?":"跟每个人都讲了。天天讲。你还真下来量了！带卷尺了吗？",
 "Brought a chain. Garo forged it, and nothing's slipped it yet. Terms: you lose, the kite story gets my name in it.":"带了条锁链。加罗打的，至今没有东西挣脱过。条件：你输了，风筝的故事里得加上我的名字。",
 "Ha! Deal. Everybody watching? Good. Somebody count arms.":"哈！成交。大家都看着吗？好。谁来数数胳膊。",
 "Bando by an arm! An actual whole arm!":"班多赢了一条胳膊！实打实的一整条胳膊！",
 "...By a hand. One. Next time you come up to me, dockhand. They always do.":"……一只手。就一只。下次换你上来找我，码头工。他们总会来的。",
 "Any time. Leave the chain, though. I'll hang it on the dock as a trophy.":"随时奉陪。不过锁链留下。我要把它挂在码头上当战利品。",
 "Reeled in, dockhand. Come again when the arm's grown.":"拽回来了，码头工。等胳膊长长了再来。",
 "Deepline's screens blame a Sky singer for Halcyon's drills, and the Sky's screens blame a Deepline kid for its labs. In the Pit Arena, Pell hangs in the rafters pulling strings, where nobody can reach him.":"深线的屏幕把哈尔西恩的钻机怪到一个天上的歌手头上，天上的屏幕则把实验室的事怪到一个深线小子头上。在深坑竞技场，佩尔吊在房梁上牵着线，谁也够不着他。",
 "Fight up to Pell's rafters in the Pit":"一路打上深坑里佩尔的房梁",
 "The night of the Strings Cut. Drills punch into the Drowned Line, and every screen in Deepline shows who led them: Nyra, a Sky singer.":"丝线斩断之夜。钻机凿进溺亡线，深线的每块屏幕都在播是谁领的路：妮拉，一个天上的歌手。",
 "Every screen in the Sky shows Kael of the Crusher Yard gassing their labs. Each layer swears the other hit first, and both are marching.":"天上的每块屏幕都在播粉碎场的凯尔用毒气熏他们的实验室。每一层都发誓是对方先动的手，两边都在进军。",
 "The Sky? Only Sky person I know writes me letters on kites. This stinks of Halcyon. A whole crate of Halcyon.":"天上？我认识的唯一一个天上的人，用风筝给我寄信。这事一股哈尔西恩的臭味。整整一箱哈尔西恩的臭味。",
 "Pell's up in the Pit's rafters, working the strings! Sable and Moro have the Cradle set below. Problem: nobody, not even all of us, can get up there.":"佩尔在深坑的房梁上牵着线！萨布尔和莫罗在下面布好了翻花绳。问题是：谁都上不去，就算我们全体出动也不行。",
 "Nobody? Rook. Buddy. Look who you're talking to. Forty arm's lengths, tops.":"谁都上不去？鲁克。伙计。看看你在跟谁说话。四十个臂长，顶多了。",
 "Bando's arm climbs into the dark of the rafters and comes down holding every one of Pell's strings. Pell drops into his own Cat's Cradle.":"班多的手臂攀进房梁的黑暗中，回来时攥着佩尔的每一根线。佩尔掉进了他自己的翻花绳。",
 "Got 'em. Every string. How's it hanging, Pell? I mean that literally.":"拿到了。每一根线。佩尔，最近挂得还好吗？我说的是字面意思。",
 "Breathtaking reach. Bravo. Very well: both faces were Rue's. I taught her. Do tell the Crater, before they kill each other.":"惊人的臂展。好极了。也罢：两张脸都是露的。是我教的她。快去告诉陨坑吧，趁他们还没互相杀光。",
 "Kiri's crane flies the name to the Crater, and a second Kael bolts from the crowd. The Ring has turned, the bell has rung, and Hollis raises a fourth banner.":"基里的纸鹤把这个名字送到了陨坑，人群里第二个凯尔拔腿就逃。环区倒戈了，钟声响了，霍利斯升起了第四面旗帜。",
 "Hurry, though. The Director's Engine has been calling to something for years, and I don't believe it was ever us.":"不过要快。总监的引擎多年来一直在呼唤着什么东西，而我不认为它呼唤的是我们。",
 "Four banners, one big Spire, Engine Core at the top. Long way up. Good thing I'm long.":"四面旗帜，一座大尖塔，引擎核心在顶上。路很长。还好我也很长。",
 "Everything Aurelia throws away ends up in the Crusher Yard, and Ferra decides what is worth saving. Halcyon has come to take her stock, and her.":"奥蕾莉亚扔掉的一切最后都会落进粉碎场，由费拉决定什么值得留下。哈尔西恩来了，要拿走她的存货，还有她本人。",
 "Throw Halcyon out of the Crusher Yard":"把哈尔西恩扔出粉碎场",
 "The Crusher Yard. Hills of scrap under work lamps. Whatever the Sky throws away rolls down here, and Ferra sorts it.":"粉碎场。工作灯下堆着一座座废铁山。天上扔掉的东西都滚到这下面，由费拉来分拣。",
 "The night I was born, every tool on the smithy wall turned to face my cradle. Down here it's every bolt.":"我出生那晚，铁匠铺墙上的每一件工具都转过来朝着我的摇篮。在这下面，转过来的是每一颗螺栓。",
 "Crusher Yard. Seize the scrap stock and the woman who moves it. She's flagged for the Engine.":"粉碎场。查封废料存货，连同搬动它的那个女人。她已被标记，要送去给引擎。",
 "You're standing on fifty tonnes of my scrap. Every ounce of it answers to me. Shall I ask it?":"你脚下踩着五十吨我的废铁。每一两都听我的。要我问问它们吗？",
 "Halcyon. Shiny outside, hollow in the middle. Into the press with the rest.":"哈尔西恩。外面闪亮，里面空心。跟其他东西一起进压机吧。",
 "Never have, Sparks. Go sort the copper. And stay out from under car doors.":"从来不需要，火花。去把铜分好。还有，别再钻到车门底下去。",
 "For years Ferra's steel has gone up the hidden tunnels and Garo's bread has come down, hand to hand, never face to face. Tonight Halcyon's lamps are in the tunnel.":"多年来，费拉的钢铁顺着秘密隧道往上送，加罗的面包往下送，手递手，却从未见过面。今夜，哈尔西恩的灯照进了隧道。",
 "Hold the hidden tunnel with Garo":"与加罗守住秘密隧道",
 "The tunnels no map shows. Steel goes up, bread comes down. Tonight there are Halcyon lamps bobbing in the dark.":"地图上没有的隧道。钢往上，面包往下。今夜，黑暗中晃动着哈尔西恩的灯。",
 "And you're Garo. Bread's too good for a smith. Years of trade, and not one face.":"那你就是加罗了。面包好得不像铁匠做的。做了这么多年买卖，一面都没见过。",
 "Never needed one. The Pact runs on steel.":"从来不需要见。盟约靠钢铁运转。",
 "Halcyon's found our tunnel. Pity. For Halcyon.":"哈尔西恩找到了我们的隧道。可惜了。对哈尔西恩来说。",
 "That captain's armour is decent iron. Sin to leave it lying.":"那个队长的盔甲是好铁。扔在这儿就是罪过。",
 "Take it up. Make something honest of it. Steel up, bread down.":"拿上去吧。打成点正经东西。钢往上，面包往下。",
 "Vex left Ferra's Yard half-taught, sure that pulling and pushing are one and the same. Now he walks back in to prove it on his old teacher.":"维克斯没学完就离开了费拉的场子，认定拉和推是一回事。现在他走回来，要在老师身上证明这一点。",
 "Duel Vex in the Crusher Yard":"在粉碎场与维克斯决斗",
 "Ferra. Still sorting junk into little piles? Pull and push are one force. I proved it, across the tunnel.":"费拉。还在把垃圾分成一小堆一小堆？拉和推是同一种力。我证明过了，在隧道那头。",
 "You proved you can't take a lesson without arguing with it. You left half-taught, boy.":"你证明的是你学一堂课非得跟它抬杠。你只学了一半就走了，小子。",
 "I know every bad habit you've got. I gave you half of them.":"你的每个坏习惯我都知道。有一半是我教的。",
 "Never. Go home to your yard. Come to mine for dinner some night. Bring nothing.":"想都别想。回你的场子去。哪天晚上来我这儿吃饭。什么都别带。",
 "Pull and push. One thing. Told you. Again, teacher?":"拉和推。一回事。跟你说过了。再来，老师？",
 "Two stolen faces on every screen have set the layers at war, and Halcyon's drills have reached the Pit Arena. Ferra knows where Kael was that night, and she has a whole Yard to throw.":"每块屏幕上两张偷来的脸让各层开了战，哈尔西恩的钻机已经开到了深坑竞技场。费拉知道那晚凯尔在哪里，而她有一整座废料场可以扔。",
 "Bury the drills in the Pit under scrap":"用废铁把深坑里的钻机埋掉",
 "The Three-Layer War. Every screen shows two films: Kael venting the Core Sump onto the Sky's labs, Nyra leading Halcyon's drills into Deepline.":"三层之战。每块屏幕都在放两段影像：凯尔把核心污水坑的废气排向天上的实验室，妮拉领着哈尔西恩的钻机钻进深线。",
 "Each layer is sure the other struck first. The Noble Ring is in uproar, the Surface holds the Buried Meridian, and down here the drills reach the Pit.":"每一层都认定是对方先动的手。贵族环区一片哗然，地表守住了被掩埋的子午线，而在这下面，钻机开到了深坑。",
 "Kael spent that night in my Yard, sorting copper. Somebody's selling faces. I want the shop.":"那晚凯尔就在我场子里分铜。有人在倒卖脸。我要找到那家店。",
 "Whoever it is, their drills are in the Pit. Pull, or push?":"不管是谁，他们的钻机在深坑里。拉，还是推？",
 "Both. Every bolt, every car door, every rusted rail in Deepline. Up. All of you.":"都要。每一颗螺栓，每一扇车门，深线每一根生锈的铁轨。起来。全都起来。",
 "Every scrap of junk in Deepline rises at Ferra's word, hangs there like a held breath, and drops on Halcyon's drills.":"深线的每一块废料都应费拉一声令下升起，像屏住的一口气那样悬在空中，然后砸向哈尔西恩的钻机。",
 "Good drill steel, wasted on Halcyon. I'll find it better work.":"好好的钻机钢，浪费在哈尔西恩手里。我会给它找份更好的活儿。",
 "Snared in his own Cradle, Pell gives up the thief: Rue. At the Crater a second Kael flees the first, and the puppet show is over.":"被困在自己翻花绳里的佩尔供出了那个贼：露。在陨坑，第二个凯尔从第一个凯尔面前逃走，木偶戏落幕了。",
 "Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core. Ferra's scrap shields the stairs.":"四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，直指引擎核心。费拉的废铁护住了阶梯。",
 "Sparks will want to hear it from me. Later. Now up. I've a mind to see what the Director's Engine is made of.":"火花会想听我亲口讲。晚点再说。现在上去。我倒想看看总监的引擎是用什么做的。",
 "Sen keeps a rusted metro car as his dojo, and keeps it spotless. Halcyon wants his technique on file, and sends men who do not wipe their feet.":"森恩把一节生锈的地铁车厢当作道场，擦得一尘不染。哈尔西恩想把他的技艺存档，派来的却是一群进门不擦鞋的人。",
 "Clear the Rust Dojo of Halcyon's men":"把哈尔西恩的人清出锈蚀道场",
 "The Rust Dojo: a dead metro car, scrubbed until it shines. A broom leans by the door. The cleanest room underground.":"锈蚀道场：一节报废的地铁车厢，擦得锃亮。一把扫帚靠在门边。地下最干净的房间。",
 "A square of white paper. One line of ink. I waited so long my teacher sat down. ...The line has not come yet.":"一方白纸。一笔墨线。我等了太久，久到我的老师都坐下了。……那一笔还没有来。",
 "Target: the swordsman. Directive: technique on file, subject intact. Move in.":"目标：剑客。指令：技艺存档，目标完好。上。",
 "Petals drift down from nowhere. Not one touches the floor before the last man does.":"花瓣不知从何处飘落。没有一片比最后一个人先落地。",
 "Draw.":"拔刀。",
 "Boot prints, from the door to where the men lie. Sen regards them for a long time. Then he fetches the broom.":"从门口到那些人倒下的地方，一串靴印。森恩看了它们很久。然后去拿来了扫帚。",
 "Pell has sold the Lantern Cell. Its quiet one kneels on Sen's mat and asks to learn the Flash Step properly, and Sen does not answer for seven days.":"佩尔出卖了灯笼小队。小队里最安静的那个跪在森恩的垫子上，请求好好学一学闪步，而森恩七天都没有回答。",
 "Hold the Rust Dojo with Sable":"与萨布尔守住锈蚀道场",
 "Seven days. Sable sits. Sen sweeps. On the eighth morning, boots ring on the platform outside, and he lays down the broom.":"七天。萨布尔坐着。森恩扫地。第八天早上，月台外响起靴声，他放下了扫帚。",
 "The step is not fast. It is finished before it begins.":"这一步不在于快。它在开始之前就已经结束了。",
 "All. Halcyon followed you. Show me.":"就这些。哈尔西恩跟着你来了。让我看看。",
 "Yes. Now you will always be there first.":"是。从今往后，你永远都会先到。",
 "A letter waits on the mat: three pages from Isa of the Archive, who once drew lines beside him. Sen answers in a single line.":"垫子上放着一封信：档案馆的伊莎写来的三页纸，她曾在他身旁一同运笔。森恩只回了一行。",
 "Pell comes down the Old Metro with Halcyon at his back to take Sable home to the Director. Between them stands one swordsman, in no hurry at all.":"佩尔带着哈尔西恩的人沿旧地铁而来，要把萨布尔带回总监身边。挡在他们之间的，是一个毫不着急的剑客。",
 "Duel Pell on the Old Metro platform":"在旧地铁站台与佩尔决斗",
 "The Old Metro platform, outside the Rust Dojo. Pell walks the edge, strings glinting, Halcyon's men behind him.":"旧地铁站台，锈蚀道场外。佩尔沿着站台边缘踱步，丝线闪着光，哈尔西恩的人跟在身后。",
 "Swordsman. You have something of mine. A quiet girl with a quick step. The Director would like her returned.":"剑客。你手里有件东西是我的。一个步子很快的安静姑娘。总监希望她物归原主。",
 "You sold her. She is not yours to want.":"你卖了她。她轮不到你来要。",
 "A thousand strings against one sword? Charming. Show me what you've taught her, then.":"一千根线对一把剑？真可爱。那就让我看看你教了她些什么。",
 "...Turn around.":"……转过身去。",
 "...One line, and every string falls together. They said you were patient. They undersold it.":"……一笔，所有的线一齐落下。他们说你有耐心。他们说少了。",
 "She stays.":"她留下。",
 "Pell rises into the dark on his last string. Sen sweeps the platform.":"佩尔拉着最后一根线升入黑暗。森恩打扫站台。",
 "Patience, swordsman. You haven't arrived yet. Again.":"耐心点，剑客。你还没到。再来。",
 "Two stolen faces have set the three layers at each other's throats, and every string behind them runs to the Pit Arena. Sen has one sword.":"两张偷来的脸让三层掐住了彼此的喉咙，而它们背后的每一根线都通向深坑竞技场。森恩只有一把剑。",
 "Clear the Pit floor under the strings":"清理丝线下的深坑场地",
 "The Three-Layer War. Two films on every screen: Kael gassing the Sky's labs, Nyra leading Halcyon's drills into Deepline. Each layer blames the other.":"三层之战。每块屏幕上两段影像：凯尔用毒气熏天上的实验室，妮拉领着哈尔西恩的钻机钻进深线。每一层都怪对方。",
 "Above, the Noble Ring burns. On the Surface, drills sink into the Buried Meridian. In the Pit Arena, Pell's strings hang like rain.":"上方，贵族环区在燃烧。地表，钻机钻入被掩埋的子午线。深坑竞技场里，佩尔的丝线像雨一样垂挂。",
 "Two faces. Two lies. One hand. The strings all run here.":"两张脸。两个谎。一只手。所有的线都通到这里。",
 "Then we do not chase faces.":"那我们就不去追脸。",
 "One is enough.":"一把就够了。",
 "One stroke. Every string from rafter to floor parts at once, and Pell's own Cradle folds shut on him.":"一刀。从房梁到地面的每一根线同时断开，佩尔自己的翻花绳合拢，把他困在其中。",
 "One line through the Cat's Cradle. Twice now, swordsman. ...Her name is Rue. I made her. Send it to the Crater.":"一笔穿过翻花绳。这是第二次了，剑客。……她叫露。是我造的她。把这个送去陨坑。",
 "Kiri's crane carries the name. At the Crater a second Kael runs from the first, and Rue is gone. Three layers, played like puppets.":"基里的纸鹤带走了这个名字。在陨坑，第二个凯尔从第一个面前逃走，露不见了。三层，被当作木偶一样操弄。",
 "Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core, and the Engine hums like something calling. Sen climbs without a word.":"四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，直指引擎核心，引擎嗡嗡作响，像有什么在呼唤。森恩一言不发地向上攀登。",
 "Rook of the Lantern Cell has never fought by himself, even on his own. Halcyon has come back to the Slums to finish what it started the night the Cell was sold.":"灯笼小队的鲁克从没一个人打过架，哪怕他孤身一人。哈尔西恩回到贫民窟，要了结小队被出卖那一夜开始的事。",
 "Fight off the collectors in the Slums":"在贫民窟打退收集人",
 "The Deepline Slums. Washing lines, dripping pipes, a kettle screaming somewhere. Rook never fights alone. Not even when he is alone.":"深线贫民窟。晾衣绳，滴水的管道，某处一只水壶在尖叫。鲁克从不单打独斗。哪怕他孤身一人。",
 "Lantern Cell, loudest member, reporting! Also the second loudest! And the third! Twin Rush!":"灯笼小队，嗓门最大的成员，前来报到！还有嗓门第二大的！还有第三大的！双影突袭！",
 "Cell remnant, male. The one who held the door. Collection is overdue. Bring in the original.":"小队残余，男性。守门的那个。收集已逾期。把本体带回来。",
 "The door. Sure. Let's talk about anything else. ...And the original? Most mornings even I can't tell.":"那扇门。行啊。咱们聊点别的吧。……本体？大多数早上连我自己都分不清。",
 "Count 'em up. One of me beat all of you. Fine, six of me. Same guy, mostly.":"数一数。我一个打赢了你们所有人。好吧，六个我。基本上是同一个人。",
 "Never without you, brother. I just started with me. There's plenty of me to go round.":"从来不会撇下你，兄弟。我只是先跟我自己开打了。我多的是，人人有份。",
 "Halcyon is building a cage on the Slums' stairs. Rook and Kael, brothers out of the trash, mean to decide which way its door opens.":"哈尔西恩正在贫民窟的楼梯上搭一只笼子。鲁克和凯尔，这对从垃圾堆里出来的兄弟，打算决定笼门往哪边开。",
 "Rook! Halcyon's bolting a cage together on the stairs. Big one. Both-of-us big.":"鲁克！哈尔西恩在楼梯上拼一只笼子。大的。装得下我们俩的那种大。",
 "For us? We're flattered. Oh, and Kiri's crane came down the Stacks. She says some Subject up in the Sky can see Husks.":"给我们的？真是受宠若惊。哦对了，基里的纸鹤顺着排风塔飞下来了。她说天上有个实验体能看见空壳。",
 "Kiri's the paper girl? The one with two of her?":"基里就是那个纸女孩？有两个她的那个？",
 "Two of her. Only person alive who gets it. Anyway. You, me, all of me. Brothers?":"两个她。世上唯一一个能懂的人。总之。你，我，所有的我。兄弟？",
 "Always. Clones out, Rook.":"永远是。分身上，鲁克。",
 "Into the cage! ...No. Wait. Other direction.":"进笼子！……不对。等等。反方向。",
 "Their captain had a key on his belt. A Halcyon key.":"他们队长腰带上有把钥匙。哈尔西恩的钥匙。",
 "Pell had a key once. A key to the Engine. He paid for it with us.":"佩尔以前也有把钥匙。一把通往引擎的钥匙。他拿我们换的。",
 "Then let's go make him give back the change.":"那就去让他把找的零钱还回来。",
 "In the Pit Arena the sensei who taught Rook his clones, and then sold the Lantern Cell for a key, has kept his old student's seat warm.":"在深坑竞技场，那位教会鲁克分身术、又为了一把钥匙出卖灯笼小队的老师，一直给他的老学生留着座位。",
 "Duel Pell in the Pit Arena":"在深坑竞技场与佩尔决斗",
 "Rook. My best student. You came to the Pit at last. I've kept your seat warm, front row, as always.":"鲁克。我最好的学生。你终于来深坑了。我一直给你留着座位，头排，跟往常一样。",
 "You taught me the clones. Then you sold us for a key, and my clones held that door till they were smoke.":"你教会了我分身。然后你为了一把钥匙卖了我们，我的分身守着那扇门，直到化成了烟。",
 "And you walked out of the smoke behind them. I was so proud of you. Truly.":"而你从他们身后的烟里走了出来。我真为你骄傲。真的。",
 "Don't be proud. Start counting. There's always more of me.":"别骄傲。开始数吧。我永远还有更多。",
 "...More of you than I counted. You were never any good at being only one.":"……比我数的还多。你从来就不擅长只当一个人。",
 "It's not a trick, Pell. It's friends. You never had any. Where's the key?":"这不是把戏，佩尔。这是朋友。你从来没有过。钥匙在哪儿？",
 "Somewhere the Director can't reach it. Another day, dear boy.":"在总监够不着的地方。改天吧，亲爱的孩子。",
 "The strings draw him up into the rafters like a spider up its own thread, and the Pit is empty.":"丝线把他拉上房梁，像蜘蛛顺着自己的丝往上爬，深坑空了。",
 "Strings beat clones, Rook. Did I teach you nothing? Up. Again.":"丝线克分身，鲁克。我什么都没教会你吗？起来。再来。",
 "Two stolen faces have the three layers at each other's throats. Rook knows exactly where Kael slept that night, and the Cell has a net for the man pulling the strings.":"两张偷来的脸让三层掐住了彼此的喉咙。鲁克清楚那晚凯尔睡在哪里，而小队已经为那个牵线的人备好了一张网。",
 "The Three-Layer War. On every screen, Kael opens the Sump's vents on the Sky's labs, and Nyra walks Halcyon's drills into Deepline.":"三层之战。每块屏幕上，凯尔打开污水坑的通风口灌向天上的实验室，妮拉领着哈尔西恩的钻机走进深线。",
 "Each layer swears the other struck first. The Noble Ring burns, the Buried Meridian shakes, and Halcyon's drill crews pour into the Pit.":"每一层都发誓是对方先动的手。贵族环区在燃烧，被掩埋的子午线在震颤，哈尔西恩的钻机队涌进了深坑。",
 "Kael was asleep on my floor that night! Snoring! I have witnesses! Mostly me, but a lot of me!":"那晚凯尔睡在我地板上！打着呼噜！我有证人！主要是我，不过有好多个我！",
 "Faces lie. Strings don't. Every string runs here. To Pell.":"脸会撒谎。线不会。每一根线都通到这里。通到佩尔。",
 "We close his own Cradle on him. You hold the floor. All of you.":"我们用他自己的翻花绳把他困住。你守住场地。你们全体。",
 "A whole Pit full of Rooks. Finally, a crowd my size.":"满坑都是鲁克。总算凑齐一群跟我一个尺码的观众了。",
 "The Rooks hold the Pit floor. Sable and Moro pull the last thread, and Pell's own Cat's Cradle snaps shut on him.":"鲁克们守住了深坑场地。萨布尔和莫罗拉动最后一根线，佩尔自己的翻花绳猛地合上，把他困在里面。",
 "Caught by my own lesson. ...Hold it tight, Rook. I shan't struggle.":"栽在了自己教的东西上。……抓紧了，鲁克。我不会挣扎的。",
 "Why not? You always struggle. You taught us struggling.":"为什么不？你总是挣扎。挣扎都是你教我们的。",
 "Because the faces were mine to teach. The thief is Rue. Someone send that to the Crater.":"因为那些脸是我教的。贼是露。谁去把这个送到陨坑。",
 "Kiri's crane carries the name. At the Crater a second Kael bolts from the crowd, and Rue is gone. The whole war was a puppet show.":"基里的纸鹤带走了这个名字。在陨坑，第二个凯尔从人群里拔腿就逃，露不见了。整场战争就是一出木偶戏。",
 "Hollis sews a fourth banner, for the Hidden Clans, and Rook carries it up the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core. Loudly.":"霍利斯为隐秘氏族缝了第四面旗帜，鲁克扛着它登上哈尔西恩尖塔，直指引擎核心。一路大声嚷嚷。",
 "Down in the Slums it is quiet. Halcyon has come for the quiet one of the Lantern Cell, and the air is starting to hum.":"下面的贫民窟很安静。哈尔西恩来抓灯笼小队里最安静的那个，空气开始嗡嗡作响。",
 "Beat Halcyon's hunters in the Slums":"在贫民窟击败哈尔西恩的猎手",
 "The Deepline Slums, under the Skylift's roots. Pipes drip. Nobody moves. Then the air begins to hum.":"深线贫民窟，天梯的根部之下。管道滴水。没人动。然后空气开始嗡鸣。",
 "Cell runaway, female, the quiet one. Secure her before she does anything.":"小队逃犯，女性，安静的那个。趁她还没动手，拿下她。",
 "Too late.":"太迟了。",
 "Pell sold us for a key. Every hand he hires, I go through. Then his.":"佩尔为了一把钥匙卖了我们。他雇的每一只手，我都穿过去。然后是他的。",
 "Sable's Flash Step is quick, not true. She sits seven days in Sen's Rust Dojo while he sweeps, and on the eighth, Halcyon follows her in.":"萨布尔的闪步快而不真。她在森恩的锈蚀道场静坐七天，看他扫地；到了第八天，哈尔西恩跟着她闯了进来。",
 "Hold the Rust Dojo with Sen":"与森恩守住锈蚀道场",
 "Seven days. She sits. He sweeps. Nobody speaks. On the eighth morning, he leans the broom against the wall.":"七天。她坐着。他扫地。没人说话。第八天早上，他把扫帚靠在了墙上。",
 "The step is finished before it begins. Be there. Then arrive.":"这一步在开始之前就已结束。先在那里。然后抵达。",
 "...A week, for that.":"……一个星期，就为了这个。",
 "Boots on the platform. Show me.":"月台上有靴声。让我看看。",
 "I was. Thank you, sensei. The real kind.":"我做到了。谢谢你，老师。真正的那种。",
 "Go. Run at him, if you must. Run well.":"去吧。要冲向他，就冲吧。冲得漂亮些。",
 "Two kinds of lightning in one slum is one too many. The quiet girl with violet lightning and the loud boy with white are about to settle, in public, whose sky it is.":"一座贫民窟里有两种闪电，就多了一种。紫色闪电的安静女孩，和白色闪电的吵闹男孩，要当众定一定这片天归谁。",
 "Duel Kael in the Slums":"在贫民窟与凯尔决斗",
 "Hey! Quiet girl! You're the one with the purple lightning, right? Big fan. Huge.":"嘿！安静姑娘！你就是那个会放紫色闪电的，对吧？我是你的粉丝。超级大粉丝。",
 "Violet. You throw yours at everything. Loudly. Deepline has one thunder too many.":"是堇紫。你的闪电什么都砸。还很吵。深线多了一道雷。",
 "In public, then. Whoever's standing keeps the sky.":"那就当众来。谁还站着，天就归谁。",
 "Okay. Okay! You're fast. Like, actually lightning fast. Which, fine. Fair.":"好吧。好吧！你很快。真的快得像闪电。嗯，行。服气。",
 "You're loud. Thunder loud. ...You're not bad.":"你很吵。吵得像打雷。……你还不赖。",
 "So who keeps the sky?":"所以天归谁？",
 "We keep arguing. In public. Same time tomorrow.":"我们接着吵。当众吵。明天老时间。",
 "Ha! That's the sound of me winning! Again? Say again. Please say again.":"哈！这就是我赢了的声音！再来？说再来。求你说再来。",
 "Two films on every screen have set the layers at each other's throats. Sable knows whose hands taught those faces, and tonight she means to arrive.":"每块屏幕上的两段影像让各层掐住了彼此的喉咙。萨布尔知道是谁的手教出了那些脸，今夜她要抵达。",
 "Flash through the Pit Arena to Pell":"闪过深坑竞技场，直抵佩尔",
 "The Three-Layer War. Every screen shows it: Kael opening the Sump's vents onto the Sky's labs. Nyra leading Halcyon's drills into Deepline.":"三层之战。每块屏幕都在放：凯尔打开污水坑的通风口灌向天上的实验室。妮拉领着哈尔西恩的钻机钻进深线。",
 "The Sky blames Deepline. Deepline blames the Sky. The Noble Ring is burning, the Surface holds the Buried Meridian, and the drills reach the Pit.":"天上怪深线。深线怪天上。贵族环区在燃烧，地表守住了被掩埋的子午线，钻机开到了深坑。",
 "The Kael in that film was quiet. The air didn't hum. Kael is never quiet.":"影像里的那个凯尔很安静。空气没有嗡鸣。凯尔从来不安静。",
 "Pell's up in the rafters. Rook's got the floor. Go.":"佩尔在房梁上。鲁克守着场地。去。",
 "I've been running at him since the night he sold us. Tonight I arrive.":"从他出卖我们那晚起，我就一直在朝他冲。今夜，我抵达。",
 "Flash Step. She is at the last string before Pell knows she has moved. The Cradle closes on its maker.":"闪步。佩尔还没察觉她动了，她已到了最后一根线前。翻花绳在它的主人身上合拢。",
 "My quiet one. I always should have watched the quiet one. ...The faces were Rue's. Tell the Crater.":"我那个安静的孩子。我早该盯紧那个安静的。……那些脸是露的。告诉陨坑。",
 "Kiri's crane flies the name to the Crater. A second Kael bolts from the crowd, and Rue is gone. Somebody was working both sides like puppets.":"基里的纸鹤把这个名字送到陨坑。第二个凯尔从人群里拔腿就逃，露不见了。有人把两边都当木偶一样操弄。",
 "Rook held the door for us. That night. ...Thank you, Rook.":"鲁克为我们守住了那扇门。那一晚。……谢谢你，鲁克。",
 "Was that a thank-you? Moro! MORO! She thanked me! Somebody write it on a banner!":"那是一句谢谢吗？莫罗！莫罗！她谢我了！谁来把这句写在旗子上！",
 "Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core. Sable is first on the stairs. Whatever the Engine is calling, it has to stop now.":"四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，直指引擎核心。萨布尔第一个踏上阶梯。不管引擎在呼唤什么，现在都必须停下。",
 "Somewhere down the Old Metro, between two dead lamps, Moro is having an excellent nap. Halcyon has come down the line to wake him.":"旧地铁深处，两盏熄灭的灯之间，莫罗正睡着一场极好的午觉。哈尔西恩顺着线路下来，要把他叫醒。",
 "Clear Halcyon out of the Old Metro":"把哈尔西恩赶出旧地铁",
 "The Old Metro, in the long dark between two station lamps. Water ticks off a rail. Moro is asleep on a bench.":"旧地铁，两盏站灯之间漫长的黑暗里。水滴从铁轨上嗒嗒落下。莫罗在长椅上睡着了。",
 "Cell remnant, male, the sleepy one. Ran with the girl. Wake him and bag him.":"小队残党，男性，犯困的那个。跟那个女孩一起跑的。叫醒他，装袋带走。",
 "Shadow Snare. Hold still. ...There. Now everybody's resting.":"影缚。别动。……好了。现在大家都在休息。",
 "Pell taught us shadows are for hiding. He was wrong. They're for holding.":"佩尔教我们，影子是用来藏身的。他错了。影子是用来缚人的。",
 "Rook has been louder than usual for days, because the door he held still burns behind his eyes. Moro notices, and offers to carry it, while Halcyon climbs the stairs.":"鲁克这些天比平时还要吵，因为他守过的那扇门仍在他眼底燃烧。莫罗看出来了，提出替他扛着；与此同时，哈尔西恩正爬上楼梯。",
 "Hold the Slums with Rook and Sable":"与鲁克和萨布尔死守贫民窟",
 "Moro! Moro moro moro. You awake? Halcyon's in the Slums! We need you! All of us need you!":"莫罗！莫罗莫罗莫罗。醒着吗？哈尔西恩进贫民窟了！我们需要你！我们全都需要你！",
 "Nothing! Why would anything be wrong? Everything's great! Look how great!":"没事！能有什么事？一切都好极了！你看多好！",
 "The door you held is still burning behind your eyes. I know. I'll carry it. You keep being loud.":"你守过的那扇门，还在你眼底烧着。我知道。我来扛。你继续吵你的。",
 "Stop talking. Captain on the stairs.":"别聊了。楼梯上来了个队长。",
 "...Thanks. For the, you know. The carrying thing.":"……谢了。就是，那个。替我扛着的事。",
 "Didn't catch that. You weren't loud enough.":"没听清。你不够大声。",
 "Every night a red scarf walks through Moro's shadows in muddy boots. Tonight he follows it up onto the Night Ward's rooftops to teach it to knock.":"每天夜里，都有一条红围巾穿着沾泥的靴子，从莫罗的影子里穿过。今晚，他一路跟它上了夜间病房的屋顶，要教它学会敲门。",
 "Duel Vesper on the Night Ward roofs":"在夜间病房屋顶与韦斯帕决斗",
 "The Night Ward roofs, Aurelia. Moro has come up through his own shadow, after a red scarf that keeps walking through it.":"奥蕾莉亚，夜间病房的屋顶。莫罗从自己的影子里钻了上来，追着一条总从他影子里穿过的红围巾。",
 "You followed me all the way up. That's new. Usually you just sigh.":"你一路跟上来了。稀奇。平常你只会叹气。",
 "Lamps go out, doors open. Everybody knows that.":"灯一灭，门就开。谁都知道。",
 "Mine don't open. Mine hold on. Come and find out.":"我的不开。我的会拽住你。来试试。",
 "Find a way. You're clever. It's annoying.":"自己想办法。你很聪明。烦人得很。",
 "Behind you. Still behind you. Again?":"在你身后。还在你身后。再来？",
 "Deepline blames the Sky for the drills, and the Sky blames Deepline for its labs. Down in the Pit, Moro, who would rather be asleep, notices a shadow that moves wrong.":"深线把钻机算在天空城头上，天空城把实验室的事算在深线头上。下面的深坑里，宁愿睡觉的莫罗注意到一道影子动得不对。",
 "Pin the drill crews in the Pit":"在深坑钉住钻机工人",
 "The Three-Layer War. Every screen plays two films: Kael opening the Sump's vents on the Sky's labs, Nyra leading the drills into Deepline.":"三层之战。每一块屏幕都在放两段影像：凯尔打开污水坑的通风口灌向天空城的实验室，妮拉领着钻机攻进深线。",
 "Each layer blames the other. Both are wrong. Both bleed. In the Pit Arena, Halcyon's drill crews break in through the walls.":"每一层都在怪另一层。双方都错了。双方都在流血。在深坑竞技场，哈尔西恩的钻机工人破墙而入。",
 "Watch Nyra's film again. Her shadow moves a beat late. Shadows don't lie. Faces do.":"再看一遍妮拉那段。她的影子慢了一拍。影子不会说谎。脸会。",
 "I'll hold everything else.":"剩下的，全由我来缚住。",
 "Moro's shadows pin every drill crew in the Pit, like flies in amber. Not hidden. Held.":"莫罗的影子把深坑里每一组钻机工人都钉在原地，像琥珀里的苍蝇。不是藏。是缚。",
 "My own lesson, turned inside out. ...The faces were Rue's, my sleepy one. Send it to the Crater.":"我自己的课，被翻了个里朝外。……那些脸是露的，我那犯困的孩子。把消息送去陨坑。",
 "Kiri's crane carries the name. At the Crater a second Kael runs from the real one, and Rue is gone. Someone was playing all three layers.":"基里的纸鹤带走了这个名字。在陨坑，第二个凯尔从真凯尔面前逃走，露不见了。有人一直在同时操弄三层。",
 "Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core. Moro climbs too, yawning. Whatever the Engine is calling, he would like it to stop.":"四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，朝引擎核心而去。莫罗也在爬，打着哈欠。不管那引擎在召唤什么，他都希望它停下。",
 "The Pit Arena roars every night for Pell, the smiling porcelain mask who taught the Lantern Cell. For ten years he has also been the Director's spymaster.":"深坑竞技场每晚都为佩尔欢呼——那张教出灯笼小队、面带微笑的瓷面具。十年来，他同时也是总监的间谍头子。",
 "Beat the Director's squad in the Pit":"在深坑击败总监的分队",
 "The Pit Arena. Strings glint in the rafters like spider silk after rain. Pell, sensei of the Lantern Cell, smiles behind white porcelain.":"深坑竞技场。椽梁间丝线闪烁，像雨后的蛛丝。灯笼小队的老师佩尔，在白瓷面具后微笑。",
 "Spymaster. Your report is three days late, and I do not keep slack strings. A squad is on its way down to test the tension.":"间谍头子。你的报告迟了三天，而我不留松弛的线。一支分队正在下去的路上，来试试你绷得紧不紧。",
 "Three days? I was rehearsing, Director. Send your squad in. I'll teach them the steps.":"三天？我在排练呢，总监。让您的分队进来吧。我教他们几个舞步。",
 "Three layers, three strings, one pair of hands. Somebody must hold the balance. Why not a man who bows so well?":"三层世界，三根线，一双手。总得有人掌握平衡。何不交给一个鞠躬鞠得这么漂亮的人？",
 "Do tell the Director his testers were marvellous. Wooden, of course. But marvellous.":"请务必转告总监，他派来的试验员精彩极了。当然，木头木脑的。但精彩极了。",
 "Noted. Keep the layers watching each other, Spymaster. A city that watches its neighbours never looks up at my Engine.":"记下了。让三层互相盯着，间谍头子。一座忙着盯邻居的城市，永远不会抬头看我的引擎。",
 "When the stands are empty, he dusts three seats in the front row. Nobody has sat in them since the night he sold their owners.":"看台空了之后，他会拂去前排三个座位上的灰。自从他出卖了座位主人的那一夜起，就再没人坐过那里。",
 "In Halcyon's Blank Wing, where nothing casts a shadow, Pell finds a prisoner with no face and no voice. He means to teach it to wear anyone's.":"在哈尔西恩的空白侧楼，万物都没有影子；佩尔在那里找到一个没有脸、也没有声音的囚犯。他打算教它戴上任何人的脸与声音。",
 "Break Rue out of the Blank Wing":"把露救出空白侧楼",
 "The Blank Wing, high in Aurelia. White walls, white light, not one shadow anywhere. In the last cell sits a shape with no face.":"空白侧楼，高悬于奥蕾莉亚。白墙，白光，哪里都没有一道影子。最后一间牢房里，坐着一个没有脸的身影。",
 "Good evening, little nothing. The guards say you become whatever you look at. Shall we test that?":"晚上好，小虚无。看守们说，你看着什么，就会变成什么。我们试试看？",
 "...Evening. Little nothing.":"……晚上好。小虚无。",
 "Ha! My voice, near enough. A touch flat in the vowels. Now watch my hand. Then yours. ...Oh, yes.":"哈！是我的声音，八九不离十。元音稍微平了点。现在看我的手。再看你的。……噢，没错。",
 "Oh, yes. Any face I please. ...Whose?":"噢，没错。我想要哪张脸都行。……要谁的？",
 "Whoever is useful, my dear. The guards are coming, and nobody told them you were leaving. Shall we?":"谁有用就要谁的，亲爱的。看守们来了，可没人告诉他们你要走了。我们走吧？",
 "Their captain. I wore him. 'Open the door, you idiots.' They opened it.":"他们的队长。我穿上了他。“开门啊，蠢货们。”他们就开了。",
 "Beautiful. An hour out of the box, and already my finest pupil. You'll want a name. Rue, I think. A small bitter herb.":"漂亮。出笼才一个钟头，就已经是我最好的学生了。你得有个名字。就叫露吧，取自芸香——一种苦涩的小草。",
 "On the long way down to Deepline he teaches her a hundred faces. Not once does he ask what her own looks like.":"在下往深线的漫长路上，他教会她一百张脸。却一次也没问过，她自己的脸是什么模样。",
 "Rook comes to the Pit to collect for the whole Lantern Cell. Pell, who sold it for a key, must face the loudest and most loyal pupil he ever had.":"鲁克来到深坑，替整个灯笼小队讨债。为了一把钥匙出卖了小队的佩尔，必须面对他教过的最吵、也最忠诚的学生。",
 "Duel Rook in the Pit Arena":"在深坑竞技场与鲁克决斗",
 "Pell! You sold us. Sable, Moro, me, the whole Cell, for one key. We've come to collect. All of us.":"佩尔！你出卖了我们。萨布尔、莫罗、我，整个小队，就为了一把钥匙。我们来讨债了。我们所有人。",
 "Rook. Still saying 'we' when you mean 'I'. I did adore that about you.":"鲁克。还是把“我”说成“我们”。我当年真是爱极了你这一点。",
 "Adore this! Twin Rush!":"爱这个吧！双影突袭！",
 "Strings beat clones, dear boy. Front row, please. Class is in session.":"丝线克分身，好孩子。请坐前排。上课了。",
 "...Still. Not. Done. I've got clones left. I've always got clones left.":"……还。没。完。我还剩分身。我永远都还剩分身。",
 "You always did. I counted you wrong, all those years. I am sorry for that.":"你一向如此。这些年，是我把你数错了。为此，我很抱歉。",
 "...No. I sold the right to be sorry along with you. Another day, Rook.":"……不。我连道歉的资格，也跟你们一起卖掉了。改日吧，鲁克。",
 "That one was for the door. Get up, Pell. The next one's just for me.":"这一下是为了那扇门。起来，佩尔。下一下只为我自己。",
 "Halcyon's drills break into Deepline behind a stolen face, and the Director orders Pell to keep the Pit quiet while they dig. Pell taught that face to the thief himself.":"哈尔西恩的钻机借着一张偷来的脸攻进深线，总监命令佩尔在他们挖掘时让深坑保持安静。而那张脸，正是佩尔亲手教给窃贼的。",
 "Hold the Pit against Halcyon's crews":"在深坑抵挡哈尔西恩的人马",
 "The Three-Layer War. Every screen plays two films: Kael gassing the Sky's labs, Nyra leading Halcyon's drills into Deepline.":"三层之战。每一块屏幕都在放两段影像：凯尔用毒气熏天空城的实验室，妮拉领着哈尔西恩的钻机攻进深线。",
 "Each layer swears the other struck first. Neither film is true. Both faces were worn by Rue, exactly as Pell taught her.":"每一层都发誓是对方先动的手。两段影像都不是真的。两张脸都是露戴的，一招一式，正如佩尔所教。",
 "Splendid work, Spymaster. Sky against Deepline, the Surface caught between, and nobody looks up. Hold the Pit while my drills go deep.":"干得漂亮，间谍头子。天空城对深线，地表夹在中间，没有人抬头。我的钻机往深处挖的时候，你替我守住深坑。",
 "I taught her that face. I taught her the boy's. And every night I called it balance.":"那张脸是我教她的。那男孩的脸也是。而每一夜，我都管这叫平衡。",
 "Somewhere up in the Noble Ring my star is cutting her strings mid-aria. Good girl. Your drills are burying Deepliners, Director. Your men come through me.":"此刻，在上面贵族环区的某处，我的明星正在咏叹调唱到一半时斩断她的线。好姑娘。您的钻机在活埋深线人，总监。您的人得先过我这一关。",
 "Across the Pit, the Lantern Cell draws Pell's own Cat's Cradle shut around him. He could slip it. He does not.":"深坑另一头，灯笼小队用佩尔自己的翻花绳把他收紧缠住。他本可以挣脱。他没有。",
 "Got you! ...Hang on. You taught us how to get out of this. Why aren't you?":"抓住你了！……等等。这招怎么脱身是你教我们的。你怎么不脱？",
 "Because for once the strings are in the right hands. The face-thief is Rue. I named her for regret. Kiri, fly it to the Crater.":"因为这一回，线总算握在了对的人手里。窃脸者是露。我给她取这个名字，是为了悔恨。基里，把它飞送到陨坑。",
 "Vesna calls in Halcyon's debts, Ashka walks out of the Sump, and at the Crater a second Kael runs from the first. Rue is gone.":"维斯娜向哈尔西恩讨债，阿什卡走出污水坑；在陨坑，第二个凯尔从第一个面前逃走。露不见了。",
 "Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core. They carry Pell up with them, still tied, still bowing.":"四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，朝引擎核心而去。他们把佩尔也一起带了上去，仍被绑着，仍在鞠躬。",
 "Under Deepline's oldest tunnels lie the war dead of 2091, and Thorne keeps them as a garden, borders and all. Halcyon has come down with sacks, wanting the bones for its Engine.":"深线最古老的隧道底下，躺着2091年的战死者，索恩像照料花园一样照料他们，连花坛边都修得整整齐齐。哈尔西恩带着麻袋下来了，想把这些骨头拿去喂它的引擎。",
 "Clear Halcyon out of the catacombs":"把哈尔西恩赶出地下墓穴",
 "The catacombs under the oldest part of Deepline. The dead of the Ashfall War lie in neat rows, planted like bulbs.":"深线最古老一隅下的地下墓穴。落灰战争的死者整整齐齐排成行，像种下的球根。",
 "Halcyon survey. Bone stock is reclassified as filter material for the Engine. Clear the site. All of it.":"哈尔西恩勘测。骨料库存重新归类为引擎过滤材料。清场。全部清走。",
 "My guests have rested nearly a century without your help. May I show you to a bed of your own?":"我的客人们没靠你们帮忙，也安歇了将近一个世纪。容我领您去看看您自己的床位？",
 "Now, a note to Ume of the Glowwild. Her pollen had the whole garden sneezing for a week. I must thank her. Firmly.":"好了，给荧野的梅写张便条。她的花粉让整座花园打了一个星期的喷嚏。我得好好谢谢她。严肃地谢。",
 "Every Sunday Vesna, keeper of the Red Ledger, brings the cups and Thorne brings the tea. This Sunday Halcyon sends men down the catacomb stair, after the book and the bones both.":"每个周日，掌管赤色账簿的维斯娜带来茶杯，索恩带来茶。这个周日，哈尔西恩派人顺着墓穴的台阶下来，账簿和骨头都想要。",
 "Defend Sunday tea with Vesna":"与维斯娜守住周日茶会",
 "And I the tea. Halcyon's page, I imagine. It does look heavier than the cups, my dear.":"我带了茶。我猜是哈尔西恩那一页。它看起来确实比杯子还沉，亲爱的。",
 "It grows every week. And today they've sent men down your stair to read the rest of it.":"它每周都在变长。今天他们还派人顺着你的台阶下来，要把剩下的读完。",
 "Then we shall finish our tea after. The dead keep their own accounts. Let me help with the living.":"那我们就过会儿再把茶喝完。死者自有他们的账。活人的，让我来帮忙。",
 "Targets confirmed: the Ledger woman and the grave man. Secure the book. Bag the bones.":"目标确认：账簿女人和守墓人。夺取账簿。骨头装袋。",
 "And now he owes me a bed. More tea? It has barely stewed.":"现在他欠我一张床位了。再来点茶？才刚泡出味呢。",
 "Every spring Thorne's cuttings go up to the Glowwild and Ume's pollen comes down to the catacombs. This year Ume, the Glowwild's gardener, has come down herself to settle whose garden is finer.":"每年春天，索恩的插枝送上荧野，梅的花粉落进地下墓穴。今年，荧野的园丁梅亲自下来了，要比一比谁的花园更好。",
 "Thorne! I came down to see your famous garden. Your cuttings arrive every spring, so very polite.":"索恩！我下来看看你那座有名的花园。你的插枝每年春天都会寄到，可真有礼貌。",
 "And your pollen arrives each spring, so very effective. The whole catacomb sneezed for a week.":"你的花粉也每年春天都到，可真有效。整座墓穴打了一个星期的喷嚏。",
 "Wasn't it wonderful? Oh, don't touch the purple one. Shall we see whose garden wins?":"是不是很美妙？噢，别碰那朵紫色的。我们来看看谁的花园赢？",
 "Cuttings against pollen. How delightful. Do wipe your feet. Those are somebody's grandparents.":"插枝对花粉。多么令人愉快。请务必擦擦脚。那些可是别人家的祖父母。",
 "Your bones bite back! I didn't know bones could bite.":"你的骨头会反咬！我都不知道骨头还会咬人。",
 "Nor I that spores could. My compliments. Do take a cutting home.":"我也不知道孢子会。佩服。请务必带一根插枝回家。",
 "Please don't. ...Achoo.":"千万别。……阿嚏。",
 "Oh! Something in your garden is blooming. Oh dear. It's you.":"噢！你的花园里有东西开花了。哎呀。是你。",
 "Deepline's screens blame a Sky singer for Halcyon's drills, and the Sky's blame a Deepline boy for its labs. The drills have broken into the graves, and Thorne's guests heard them.":"深线的屏幕把哈尔西恩的钻机归罪于一个天空城的歌手，天空城的屏幕则把实验室的事归罪于一个深线少年。钻机凿进了墓穴，索恩的客人们都听见了。",
 "Fight beside the risen dead in the Pit":"在深坑与复苏的亡者并肩作战",
 "The night of the Strings Cut. Drills crack the catacomb walls, and Halcyon's crews pour through the graves toward the Pit.":"丝线斩断之夜。钻机凿裂墓穴的墙壁，哈尔西恩的人马穿过坟墓，涌向深坑。",
 "Our screens say the Sky's Nyra led them in. The Sky's screens say our Kael gassed their labs. The Ledger says Halcyon paid for both.":"我们的屏幕说是天空城的妮拉领他们进来的。天空城的屏幕说是我们的凯尔用毒气熏了他们的实验室。账簿说，两边都是哈尔西恩付的钱。",
 "So each side blames the other, and the Director sits back. Faces are cheap, my dear. Bones are honest.":"于是两边互相指责，总监坐享其成。脸是廉价的，亲爱的。骨头才诚实。",
 "My guests heard the drills, and would like a word. Rise, please, everyone. The living half of Deepline needs the dead half.":"我的客人们听见了钻机声，想说几句话。诸位，请起身吧。深线活着的那一半，需要死去的那一半。",
 "The war dead stand up for the living and walk Halcyon's crews, very politely, out of the tunnels.":"战死者为活人站了起来，非常有礼貌地把哈尔西恩的人马送出了隧道。",
 "Thank you, everyone. Back to bed now. Mind your neighbours' fingers.":"谢谢各位。现在回床上去吧。当心别压着邻居的手指。",
 "Nicely done. Pell's caught in his own Cradle, and he has named the thief of faces: Rue. Both films were her.":"干得漂亮。佩尔被自己的翻花绳缠住了，他说出了窃脸者的名字：露。两段影像都是她。",
 "Kiri's crane carries the name to the Crater. The Sky and the Surface have risen too. Hollis raises a fourth banner, and four climb the Spire.":"基里的纸鹤把这个名字送到陨坑。天空城和地表也都起来了。霍利斯竖起第四面旗帜，四面旗帜攀上尖塔。",
 "Then I shall come too. Something at the Engine Core has been calling into the dark for years. My guests hear it. They don't care for it.":"那我也去。引擎核心那里，有个东西多年来一直朝黑暗里呼唤。我的客人们听得见。他们不喜欢。",
 "Vex's yard is smaller than Ferra's, newer, and paid for with a loan from Vesna. Halcyon wants the yard, the scrap and the boy with the magnets.":"维克斯的场子比费拉的小，也更新，是用维斯娜的贷款买下的。哈尔西恩想要这座场子、这些废料，还有那个玩磁铁的男孩。",
 "Hold your yard against Halcyon":"守住你的场子，挡住哈尔西恩",
 "The yard across the tunnel from Ferra's. Smaller. Neater. Vex's. Bought with Vesna's money, and every brick still owes her.":"隧道对面，正对着费拉的场子。更小。更整齐。维克斯的。用维斯娜的钱买的，每一块砖都还欠着她。",
 "Magnet boy. The Director wants that trick on file. Take him and inventory the scrap.":"磁铁小子。总监要把那手把戏存档。带走他，把废料清点入册。",
 "Opposites attract. Come closer. ...Closer. Now go away.":"异性相吸。靠近点。……再近点。现在滚开。",
 "Repel, Attract, Flux Flip. That's the whole lesson. No charge.":"斥力，吸引，磁通反转。整堂课就这些。不收费。",
 "Vex! Vesna's runner is at the gate. Says the interest is due today. Says she's smiling.":"维克斯！维斯娜的跑腿在门口。说今天该付利息了。说她在笑。",
 "Mako's suit pulls left, so Vex, who kept only one friend from the Yard, tunes its magnets out on Dockside Nine. Halcyon picks that moment to come down the dock.":"马科的机甲总往左偏，于是维克斯——粉碎场的旧人里，他只留下了这一个朋友——在九号码头替它校准磁铁。哈尔西恩偏偏挑这时候沿着码头过来了。",
 "Hold Dockside Nine with Mako":"与马科死守九号码头",
 "Your magnets always pull left. You build too fast. Hold still, let me feel the field.":"你的磁铁总是往左拉。你造得太快了。别动，让我感受一下磁场。",
 "You talk too much. About polarity.":"你话太多。关于极性的。",
 "You're the only one from the Yard I kept. I talk about polarity because you let me.":"粉碎场的人里，我只留下了你。我讲极性，是因为你肯听。",
 "Perfect timing. Field test.":"时机正好。磁场实测。",
 "Ferra built most of that suit. I just made it behave. Don't tell her the first part.":"那套机甲大半是费拉造的。我只是让它听话。前半句别告诉她。",
 "Vex walks back into Ferra's Crusher Yard to show his old teacher he was right about magnets, and learns she has been watching his fights.":"维克斯走回费拉的粉碎场，要向老师证明自己对磁铁的看法是对的，却发现她一直在看他打架。",
 "Duel Ferra in the Crusher Yard":"在粉碎场与费拉决斗",
 "Vex. Walking back into my Yard. Bold, for a boy who still owes Vesna the walls he sleeps in.":"维克斯。走回我的场子来了。胆子不小啊，你睡觉的那几面墙都还欠着维斯娜的钱。",
 "Your Flux Flip leaves your left side open for half a breath. Every time.":"你的磁通反转会让左侧空门半口气的工夫。每一次都是。",
 "...You watch my fights? Then watch this one. Up close.":"……你看我打架？那就看这一场。凑近了看。",
 "Say that again. Slower.":"再说一遍。慢一点。",
 "...Maybe. If you cook on my side of the tunnel.":"……也许吧。要是你在隧道我这一边做饭的话。",
 "Two stolen faces have set the layers at war, and tonight Vesna opens the Red Ledger to call in every debt. Vex owes her a whole yard.":"两张偷来的脸挑起了三层之间的战争；今晚，维斯娜翻开赤色账簿，要讨回每一笔债。维克斯欠她一整座场子。",
 "Tear apart the drills in the Pit":"在深坑拆碎钻机",
 "The Three-Layer War. On every screen, Kael vents the Sump onto the Sky's labs and Nyra walks the drills into Deepline. Each side blames the other.":"三层之战。每一块屏幕上，凯尔都把污水坑的废气排向天空城的实验室，妮拉都领着钻机走进深线。双方互相指责。",
 "Vex doesn't care whose face it was. Halcyon's drills are in the Pit Arena, and Vesna is at his gate with the Red Ledger open.":"维克斯不在乎那是谁的脸。哈尔西恩的钻机已经开进深坑竞技场，而维斯娜摊开赤色账簿，站在他的门口。",
 "Vex, darling. Tonight I collect Halcyon's page, the longest in the book. And yours is the size of a yard.":"维克斯，亲爱的。今晚我要收哈尔西恩那一页，全本账里最长的一页。而你那一页，有一座场子那么大。",
 "Then pay me in iron. Every drill in that Pit, in pieces. We'll discuss interest afterwards.":"那就用钢铁还我。深坑里的每一台钻机，拆成碎块。利息我们事后再谈。",
 "Not in full. But a very good month. And Pell has named the face-thief, darling: Rue. The Crater watched her run.":"还没还清。不过这个月很不错。还有，佩尔说出了窃脸者的名字，亲爱的：露。陨坑的人都看着她逃走。",
 "Four banners climb the Halcyon Spire toward the Engine Core. Vex goes up with a drill bit over each shoulder.":"四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，朝引擎核心而去。维克斯两边肩上各扛着一根钻头，也上去了。",
 "Up the Spire with you. Does that come with a discount?":"跟你一起上尖塔。这个有折扣吗？",
 "Vesna keeps the Red Ledger, the book of every debt underground. Halcyon wants it, because each of those names is a handle to pull, and it has sent collectors.":"维斯娜掌管着赤色账簿，那本记着地下每一笔债的书。哈尔西恩想要它，因为上面的每一个名字都是一根可以拉动的把手；于是它派来了收账人。",
 "Beat Halcyon's crew in the Red Quarter":"在赤区击败哈尔西恩的人马",
 "The Neon Market's Red Quarter. Pink light on wet tiles, and every debt in Deepline written in one red book.":"霓虹市场的赤区。粉色的灯光洒在湿漉漉的地砖上，深线的每一笔债，都写在一本红色的书里。",
 "The bookkeeper. Director's instruction: acquire the Ledger. Every name in it is a lever.":"记账的。总监指示：取得账簿。里面每一个名字都是一根杠杆。",
 "You want my book? How sweet. Let me open a fresh page for you. Name first, then the amount.":"想要我的账簿？真可爱。让我给你开一页新的。先写名字，再写金额。",
 "Halcyon's page grows longer every week. One day I call in all of it, with interest.":"哈尔西恩那一页每周都在变长。总有一天，我会连本带利全部讨回来。",
 "Every Sunday Vesna brings the cups down to the catacombs and Thorne, their keeper, brings the tea. This Sunday Halcyon comes down the stair after the Ledger, and tea will have to wait.":"每个周日，维斯娜把茶杯带下地下墓穴，墓穴的守护者索恩带来茶。这个周日，哈尔西恩为了账簿顺着台阶下来了，茶只好等等再喝。",
 "Defend Sunday tea with Thorne":"与索恩守住周日茶会",
 "Thorne. Sunday. Cups, as agreed.":"索恩。周日。茶杯，照约定。",
 "And the tea, as agreed. You look tired, my dear. Is the Ledger heavy today?":"茶，也照约定。你看起来很累，亲爱的。今天的账簿很沉吗？",
 "Halcyon's page is the longest in the book. I'd like it closed before somebody closes mine.":"哈尔西恩那一页是全本账里最长的。我想赶在别人合上我这一页之前，先把它合上。",
 "The dead keep their own accounts. Allow me to help with the living. Ah. Guests.":"死者自有他们的账。活人的，容我帮忙。啊。有客人。",
 "Ledger woman and grave man, co-located. Take the book. Take the bones. Take the cups if they resist.":"账簿女人和守墓人，位置重合。拿走账簿。拿走骨头。他们要是反抗，连杯子也拿走。",
 "Interrupting tea. That's a surcharge.":"打扰喝茶。这要额外收费。",
 "Your tea has gone cold. And in all these years you have never once charged me for it.":"你的茶凉了。这么多年来，你从没向我收过一分钱。",
 "Nor will I. Tell no one, darling. I have a reputation.":"以后也不会。别告诉任何人，亲爱的。我还要名声的。",
 "Maren, the harbour doctor, has seen what Vesna charges in blood, and has come to the Red Quarter to close the account. Vesna has never lost an argument about money.":"港口医生玛伦见识过维斯娜用血收的账，她来到赤区，要把这笔账了结。维斯娜在钱的事上从没吵输过。",
 "Duel Maren in the Red Quarter":"在赤区与玛伦决斗",
 "Vesna. I've read your bills. The ones paid in blood. You call that bookkeeping?":"维斯娜。我看过你的账单。那些用血付的。你管这叫记账？",
 "Doctor. You give blood away for free. Do you know what that does to a market?":"医生。你把血白白送人。你知道这对市场有什么影响吗？",
 "It keeps people alive. What you do is a sickness, and I've come to treat it.":"它让人活着。你做的事是一种病，我是来治它的。",
 "...You heal from every cut you make. That isn't a ledger. It's a wound that pays itself.":"……你每割一刀，自己的伤就好一分。那不是账簿。那是一道自己给自己付账的伤口。",
 "Give me your arm. I'm patching it. Free of charge. Don't argue.":"胳膊给我。我给你包扎。免费的。别争。",
 "...Just this once. And I'm writing that down too.":"……就这一次。这个我也要记下来。",
 "Sit. Breathe. Your pulse is racing. Try me again when it's steady.":"坐下。呼吸。你的脉搏太快了。等它稳了再来找我。",
 "The screens swear a Sky singer led Halcyon's drills into Deepline and a Deepline boy gassed the Sky's labs. Vesna has read the real receipts. Tonight, in the Pit, she opens the Red Ledger at Halcyon's page.":"屏幕信誓旦旦地说，是天空城的一个歌手领着哈尔西恩的钻机攻进深线，是深线的一个少年用毒气熏了天空城的实验室。维斯娜看过真正的收据。今晚，在深坑，她把赤色账簿翻到了哈尔西恩那一页。",
 "Hold the Pit while the Ledger collects":"账簿收账时守住深坑",
 "The night of the Strings Cut. Every screen plays two films: Deepline's Kael gassing the Sky's labs, the Sky's Nyra walking drills into Deepline.":"丝线斩断之夜。每一块屏幕都在放两段影像：深线的凯尔用毒气熏天空城的实验室，天空城的妮拉领着钻机走进深线。",
 "Each layer blames the other, and arms itself. Only one woman in Deepline has read the receipts.":"每一层都在指责另一层，并武装起来。深线只有一个女人看过那些收据。",
 "The Sky didn't send these drills. Halcyon did, and paid for them with Deepline's own money.":"派来这些钻机的不是天空城。是哈尔西恩，而且用的是深线自己的钱。",
 "Their page runs longer than any other. Tonight I open it, and call in every debt at once.":"他们那一页比哪一页都长。今晚我翻开它，一次性讨回所有的债。",
 "Especially yours, darling. You may pay in iron. Now.":"尤其是你的，亲爱的。你可以用钢铁还。现在就还。",
 "Vesna reads Halcyon's page aloud in the Pit, line by line, and every debtor in Deepline stands up to answer it.":"维斯娜在深坑里一行一行高声念出哈尔西恩那一页，深线的每一个欠债人都站起来应声。",
 "Snared by the Lantern Cell in his own Cradle, Pell pays his share in a name: Rue. She wore both faces, on the Director's coin.":"被灯笼小队用他自己的翻花绳困住，佩尔用一个名字付清了他那一份：露。两张脸都是她戴的，拿的是总监的钱。",
 "Kiri's crane takes the name to the Crater. The Sky and the Surface have risen too. Hollis raises a fourth banner, and four climb the Spire.":"基里的纸鹤把这个名字带往陨坑。天空城和地表也都起来了。霍利斯竖起第四面旗帜，四面旗帜攀上尖塔。",
 "Halcyon's page, closed. The interest I collect from the Director, at the Engine Core, in person. And from whatever his Engine has been calling.":"哈尔西恩那一页，结清了。利息，我要在引擎核心找总监亲自收。还有他的引擎一直在召唤的那个东西，也一样。",
 "Fumi runs the boilers over the Sump, and half of Deepline sleeps warm because of them. For a year someone under the floor has tapped on his pipes, and he has tapped back. Halcyon has noticed.":"芙美管着污水坑上方的锅炉，深线有一半人靠它们睡得暖和。一年来，地板底下一直有人敲他的管道，而他也敲了回去。哈尔西恩注意到了。",
 "Hold the boilers against Halcyon":"守住锅炉，挡住哈尔西恩",
 "The Waterworks, above the Core Sump. Boilers the size of houses, sweating gauges, and one man who keeps half of Deepline from freezing.":"水厂，位于核心污水坑之上。房子那么大的锅炉，挂满水珠的仪表，还有一个让半个深线免于冻僵的男人。",
 "Pressure's good. Pumps good. The tapping's... still there. Under the floor. Every night.":"压力正常。泵正常。敲击声……还在。地板底下。每天晚上。",
 "Boilerman. Logs show unauthorised contact with Subject Sixty through the pipes. Hands off the iron. You're reassigned.":"锅炉工。日志显示你通过管道与六十号实验体进行了未经授权的接触。手离开铁家伙。你被调岗了。",
 "When the steam thins, Fumi kneels by the main pipe and taps three times. Three taps come back up, slower, and hot.":"蒸汽散去时，芙美跪在主管道旁，敲了三下。三下回敲从下面传上来，更慢，滚烫。",
 "A year I've let them cook you down there. A YEAR. ...Hold on. I'm coming down.":"我让他们在下面把你煮了一年。整整一年！……撑住。我这就下来。",
 "Fumi has found the hatch at last. He takes the long ladder down to meet the woman whose pain has kept his pipes warm, and the wardens follow him down.":"芙美终于找到了那道舱口。他顺着长长的梯子往下爬，去见那个用自己的痛苦温暖了他管道的女人，看守们也跟着他下来了。",
 "Hold the Core Sump beside Ashka":"与阿什卡并肩死守核心污水坑",
 "Down the boiler shaft, rung after rung, into heat that bites. At the bottom of everything, a woman in a red-hot chain looks up.":"顺着锅炉竖井往下，一级又一级，钻进咬人的热浪。在万物的最底层，一个缠着烧红锁链的女人抬起头来。",
 "...The tapping. So the boiler man has a face.":"……敲管道的人。原来锅炉工也有张脸。",
 "Fumi. Heard you every night. The heat in my pipes was you hurting. Couldn't stand it.":"芙美。每晚都听见你。我管子里的热，是你在疼。受不了了。",
 "Ashka. Not Sixty. Say it out loud. I want to hear it in a voice.":"阿什卡。不是六十号。大声说出来。我想听人用声音说出它。",
 "Ashka. ...Wardens on the stairs. Stay back. I'm building pressure.":"阿什卡。……看守上楼梯了。退后。我在加压。",
 "You came down. Nobody comes down.":"你下来了。从来没人下来。",
 "Next time I bring enough pressure to put that door through the ceiling. Partners?":"下次我带足压力，把那扇门轰穿天花板。搭档？",
 "Mako's suit boiler is running hot again. Fumi has stopped it cooking him twice, and Mako wants it hit at full pressure until something gives, here, before Halcyon does it for him.":"马科机甲的锅炉又过热了。芙美已经两次拦住它把马科煮熟；马科想让它在满压下挨打，直到有什么东西撑不住为止——就在这里，赶在哈尔西恩替他动手之前。",
 "Duel Mako to test his boiler":"与马科决斗，测试他的锅炉",
 "FUMI. Suit boiler's at one-ten and climbing. Dyna wants a full pressure test. You're the gauge man.":"芙美！机甲锅炉一百一十度，还在升。黛娜要做满压测试。你是看表的人。",
 "Full pressure. On a suit. With you inside it.":"满压。对着一套机甲。你还在里面。",
 "You've stopped it cooking me twice. Hit it till something pops. Better here than in front of Halcyon.":"你拦住它煮我两次了。打到有东西爆开为止。在这儿爆，总比在哈尔西恩面前爆好。",
 "...Fine. Brace. Relief lines open.":"……行吧。撑住。泄压管线打开。",
 "The suit's boiler blows a valve with a shriek like a kettle the size of a train. The suit stays standing.":"机甲的锅炉崩掉一个阀门，尖啸声像一把火车那么大的水壶。机甲依然站着。",
 "STILL UP. Readings?":"还站着！读数？",
 "Readings fine. Three new valves. Takes more than me to pop it now.":"读数正常。三个新阀门。现在光凭我可崩不开它了。",
 "Good. ...Thanks, Fumi. Really.":"好。……谢了，芙美。真的。",
 "Suit's fine. You're the one venting. Again?":"机甲没事。泄气的是你。再来？",
 "On every screen a Deepline boy gasses the Sky's labs and a Sky girl leads Halcyon's drills into Deepline. Fumi doesn't care whose face it was. He has a year of pressure saved, and a door to spend it on.":"每一块屏幕上，都是深线的少年用毒气熏天空城的实验室，天空城的女孩领着哈尔西恩的钻机攻进深线。芙美不在乎那是谁的脸。他攒了一整年的压力，还有一扇门等着他花掉。",
 "Hold the Sump while pressure builds":"加压期间守住污水坑",
 "The night of the Strings Cut. Halcyon's drills are in Deepline's walls, and every screen plays the same two films.":"丝线斩断之夜。哈尔西恩的钻机已经钻进深线的墙里，每一块屏幕都在放同样的两段影像。",
 "Kael, a Yard kid, opening the Sump's vents on the Sky's labs. Nyra, a Sky singer, waving the drills down. Each layer swears the other struck first.":"凯尔，粉碎场的孩子，打开污水坑的通风口灌向天空城的实验室。妮拉，天空城的歌手，挥手引钻机下来。每一层都发誓是对方先动的手。",
 "Ashka saw that boy at her vents. Didn't sweat. Two films, two lies. One liar.":"阿什卡在她的通风口看见过那个男孩。他没出汗。两段影像，两个谎。一个骗子。",
 "Doesn't matter tonight. How much pressure you got, boiler man?":"今晚这不重要。你攒了多少压力，锅炉工？",
 "A year. One night for every night I didn't come down. ...OPEN EVERY VALVE. ALL OF THEM. NOW.":"一年。我没下来的每一夜，都算一夜。……打开所有阀门！全部！马上！",
 "Every valve in the Waterworks screams down one pipe at once. Dyna lights the fuse. The Sump's door stops existing.":"水厂的每一个阀门同时朝一根管道尖啸而下。黛娜点燃引信。污水坑的门不复存在。",
 "You're out. I'm... going to sit down a minute.":"你出来了。我……要坐一会儿。",
 "Not for long. In the Pit, Pell hangs in his own strings and names the face-thief: Rue. The Director paid for both films.":"坐不了多久。在深坑，佩尔吊在自己的丝线里，说出了窃脸者的名字：露。两段影像都是总监出的钱。",
 "The Noble Ring has turned and Oda's bell has rung three times. Hollis raises a fourth banner, and four climb the Spire for the Engine Core.":"贵族环区已经倒戈，奥达的钟响了三下。霍利斯竖起第四面旗帜，四面旗帜攀上尖塔，直指引擎核心。",
 "That Engine's been drawing heat for years. Something on the far end's drawing too. Up. I'm bringing a gauge.":"那台引擎多年来一直在抽热。另一头也有个东西在抽。上去。我带个压力表。",
 "Mako was crushed under a crate at Dockside Nine once and promised himself never again. He built armour and never stopped adding to it, and now Halcyon wants it, with him inside.":"马科曾在九号码头被一只货箱压在底下，他向自己保证：绝不再有下次。他造了一身装甲，从此一直往上加；如今哈尔西恩想要它，连人带甲。",
 "Hold Dockside Nine in the suit":"驾驶机甲死守九号码头",
 "Dockside Nine. Years ago a crate came down on a dock hand called Mako, and he made himself one promise: never again.":"九号码头。多年前，一只货箱砸在一个叫马科的码头工人身上，他对自己许下一个承诺：绝不再有下次。",
 "So I built a suit. Then kept building. ...New plating this week. Do you, um. Do you like it?":"所以我造了一套机甲。然后一直造下去。……这周新换了装甲板。你，呃。你喜欢吗？",
 "That suit is Halcyon property as of tonight. Peel it. Bring the pilot in one piece, if convenient.":"从今晚起，那套机甲归哈尔西恩所有。把它剥开。方便的话，把驾驶员完整地带回来。",
 "Out of the suit, I'm gentle. In it... PLATING SEALED. ARM CANNON HOT. Step back, please.":"出了机甲，我很温和。进了机甲……装甲密封。臂炮升温。请后退。",
 "PLATING AT SIXTY PERCENT. REGROWING. ...Good.":"装甲百分之六十。再生中。……好。",
 "Mako! The crates! The whole stack's coming down!":"马科！货箱！整垛都要塌下来了！",
 "Halcyon has dented the plating, cooked the boiler and bent the magnets. Everyone who keeps Mako's suit alive meets in the Crusher Yard to fix it, and Halcyon follows them in.":"哈尔西恩砸凹了装甲板，烧坏了锅炉，弄弯了磁铁。所有让马科的机甲活下去的人都聚到粉碎场来修它，哈尔西恩也跟了进来。",
 "Hold the Crusher Yard with Dyna":"与黛娜死守粉碎场",
 "Mako. You look like a crate fell on you. Again. ...Too soon? Too soon.":"马科。你看起来像被货箱砸了。又一次。……这玩笑开早了？开早了。",
 "Halcyon tested it. PLATING DENTED. BOILER AT ONE-THIRTY. MAGNETS PULLING LEFT. ...Sorry. It's loud when it's scared.":"哈尔西恩测过它了。装甲凹陷。锅炉一百三十度。磁铁左偏。……抱歉。它一害怕就很吵。",
 "Scrap for the plating. Family discount. Don't make that face. I'm protecting my stock, not you.":"装甲板用的废料。亲情价。别摆那副脸。我护的是我的货，不是你。",
 "Magnets. Fair warning, I'll be explaining polarity the whole time. To you, to her, to the wall.":"磁铁。先说好，我会全程讲解极性。讲给你，讲给她，讲给墙。",
 "Boiler. Third time I've stopped it cooking you. Stop letting it.":"锅炉。第三次拦住它煮你了。别再让它煮了。",
 "Everybody who keeps the suit alive, in one yard. And... Halcyon's at the gate. Of course.":"让机甲活着的所有人，都在一个场子里。然后……哈尔西恩到门口了。当然了。",
 "Thanks. All of you. Every plate on this thing is somebody's hands.":"谢谢。你们所有人。这身上的每一块板，都是某个人的手。",
 "Dyna has built the biggest bombs of her life for one blast test. If Mako's suit survives these, it survives anything, and she has decided it's more fun if he fights back.":"黛娜为一次爆破测试造出了她这辈子最大的炸弹。马科的机甲要是扛得住这些，就什么都扛得住；而且她认定，他还手的话会更好玩。",
 "Duel Dyna in her blast test":"在爆破测试中与黛娜决斗",
 "Then I build you a better one, and I feel really bad for a minute. Hold still. No, fight back. It's prettier when you fight back.":"那我就给你造一套更好的，然后难过个一分钟。别动。不对，还手。你还手的时候更好看。",
 "...Okay. TARGETING. Fighting back.":"……好吧。锁定目标。还手。",
 "It held! Every single one! Look at that plating, all scorched and gorgeous!":"扛住了！每一颗都扛住了！看看那装甲板，烧得焦黑，美极了！",
 "Dizzy's fine. Dizzy means alive. I'm writing 'dizzy' on the chart.":"晕没关系。晕说明还活着。我在记录表上写“晕”。",
 "Kaboom. Suit's smoking, big man. Patch it and go again?":"轰隆。机甲冒烟了，大个子。补一补再来？",
 "Every screen blames a Sky singer for Halcyon's drills or a Deepline kid for the Sky's gassed labs. Deepline marches on the Pit Arena, and Mako walks at the front with Dyna on his shoulders.":"每一块屏幕不是把哈尔西恩的钻机归罪于天空城的歌手，就是把天空城被毒气熏的实验室归罪于深线的孩子。深线向深坑竞技场进军，马科走在最前面，肩上扛着黛娜。",
 "Smash Halcyon's crews in the Pit":"在深坑粉碎哈尔西恩的人马",
 "The night of the Strings Cut. Halcyon's drills are in Deepline, and the screens say a Sky singer called Nyra led them in.":"丝线斩断之夜。哈尔西恩的钻机已经开进深线，屏幕上说，是一个叫妮拉的天空城歌手领它们进来的。",
 "Up in Aurelia the screens say Kael, a Yard kid, gassed the Sky's labs. Each layer blames the other. The Director planned it so.":"上面奥蕾莉亚的屏幕说，是粉碎场的孩子凯尔用毒气熏了天空城的实验室。每一层都在指责另一层。这正是总监的计划。",
 "A Sky girl out in front of Halcyon's drills? Ferra says it's wrong. I trust Ferra. Ferra's never wrong about junk.":"一个天空城的女孩走在哈尔西恩的钻机前面？费拉说不对劲。我信费拉。费拉看破烂从来没看走眼过。",
 "Doesn't matter whose face. Drills are real. Walk, big man. I've got the ammo.":"是谁的脸不重要。钻机是真的。走吧，大个子。弹药我包了。",
 "WALKING.":"前进。",
 "A walking tank crosses the Pit with Dyna on its shoulders, and Halcyon's crews break on it like surf on a pier.":"一辆步行坦克扛着肩上的黛娜穿过深坑，哈尔西恩的人马撞上它，像浪头拍在码头桩上一样碎开。",
 "FULL BARRAGE. Last shell was the size of a car. ...That felt good. Is that bad?":"全弹齐射。最后一发炮弹有一辆车那么大。……感觉真爽。这样不好吗？",
 "That was MY shell. And no. Mako, listen: Pell's caught in his own Cradle. He named the face-thief. Rue. Both films were her.":"那可是“我的”炮弹。还有，不会。马科，听着：佩尔被自己的翻花绳缠住了。他说出了窃脸者的名字。露。两段影像都是她。",
 "Kiri's crane takes the name to the Crater. The Sky and the Surface rose tonight too, and four banners start up the Spire toward the Engine Core.":"基里的纸鹤把这个名字带到陨坑。今晚天空城和地表也起来了，四面旗帜开始攀上尖塔，朝引擎核心而去。",
 "Something up there hums wrong, big man. Like a fuse nobody lit. Walk.":"上面有个东西嗡嗡得不对劲，大个子。像一根没人点过的引信。走。",
 "The sea took Nami once in the flooded tunnels at the bottom of Deepline, and gave her back with its cold still in her. The Director wants to know how, and has sent men into her water to find out.":"大海曾在深线最底层的淹水隧道里带走奈美，又把她还了回来，那份寒意至今还留在她身体里。总监想知道这是怎么回事，派人下到她的水里来查。",
 "Hold the Drowned Line against Halcyon":"守住溺亡线，挡住哈尔西恩",
 "The Drowned Line. Sunken platforms, a dead train under black water, and fins turning slow circles beneath the surface.":"溺亡线。沉没的站台，黑水下一列死去的列车，还有水面下缓缓绕圈的鱼鳍。",
 "Subject candidate: the drowned woman. Submerged eleven minutes, still ambulatory. The Director wants the mechanism.":"实验体候选：溺水的女人。淹没十一分钟，仍能行走。总监要知道其中的机理。",
 "Come into the water. I'll show you the mechanism.":"到水里来。我给你看看机理。",
 "The sea taught me its teeth, down in the dark. First it taught me to wait.":"在下面的黑暗里，大海教会了我它的牙齿。在那之前，它先教会了我等待。",
 "Fumi's pumps thump somewhere overhead like a slow heart. The fins sink. The water lies flat.":"芙美的泵在头顶某处砰砰作响，像一颗缓慢的心脏。鱼鳍沉下去了。水面平静如镜。",
 "Stay. Nobody else goes under while I'm watching.":"留下吧。有我看着，谁也不会再沉下去。",
 "Maren, the harbour doctor who fought the sea for a whole night to get Nami back, has been let down to check Deepline's water. Halcyon has followed her, and Nami stands guard.":"港口医生玛伦曾与大海搏斗了一整夜，才把奈美抢了回来；如今她获准下来检查深线的水。哈尔西恩跟着她下来了，奈美在一旁守护。",
 "Guard Maren at the Waterworks":"在水厂护卫玛伦",
 "Nami. They've let me down to check the water lines. Two hours, they said. I promised I'd be quick.":"奈美。他们准我下来检查水管。说是两个小时。我保证过会很快。",
 "You're never quick. You stop for every cough.":"你从来就快不了。听见一声咳嗽你就要停下。",
 "I argued with the sea a whole night for you. Let me argue with a few coughs. ...Pulse is good. Breathe for me.":"为了你，我跟大海争了一整夜。让我跟几声咳嗽争一争吧。……脉搏不错。吸口气给我听。",
 "Pumps are up. Halcyon followed the doctor down. Six of them. In the tunnel.":"泵开起来了。哈尔西恩跟着医生下来了。六个人。在隧道里。",
 "You came back from the sea colder. And kinder. I never wrote that down, but it's true.":"你从海里回来以后，更冷了。也更温柔了。我从没把这写进病历，但这是真的。",
 "You gave me back. I keep you safe. That's the deal.":"你把我还了回来。我保你平安。这是交易。",
 "There's no deal, Nami. There never was. ...But thank you.":"没有什么交易，奈美。从来都没有。……不过，谢谢你。",
 "Fumi's pumps are draining the Drowned Line for the first time in years. Halcyon wants the water to cool its Engine, and Nami has to fight her friend to keep it where it belongs.":"多年来头一回，芙美的泵在抽干溺亡线。哈尔西恩要用这水来冷却它的引擎，奈美不得不与朋友交手，好让水留在它该在的地方。",
 "Duel Fumi on the Drowned Line":"在溺亡线与芙美决斗",
 "The Drowned Line. Fumi's pumps run flat out, and the water is falling. Old platforms surface, furred with rust.":"溺亡线。芙美的泵开足了马力，水位在下降。旧站台浮出水面，长满了一层锈毛。",
 "Fumi. You're draining my Line. The docks float on it. The Ashfall dead sleep under it. Stop.":"芙美。你在抽干我的溺亡线。码头浮在它上面。落灰战争的死者睡在它下面。停下。",
 "Halcyon wants it. Coolant for their Engine. I don't pump, they shut my boilers. Deepline freezes.":"哈尔西恩要它。给他们的引擎当冷却液。我不抽，他们就关我的锅炉。深线就会冻上。",
 "Then Halcyon gets neither. Touch those valves again and you go in the water.":"那哈尔西恩哪样都别想要。你再碰那些阀门，就给我下水。",
 "Can't stop now, Nami. ...I'm sorry. I'm so SORRY, all right?":"现在停不下来了，奈美。……对不起。我真的、真的很对不起，行了吧？",
 "...You're stronger than my pumps. Always were.":"……你比我的泵还强。一直都是。",
 "And you're kinder than Halcyon. That's why they picked you. Tell them no. We keep the boilers lit together.":"而你比哈尔西恩善良。所以他们才挑中你。跟他们说不。锅炉，我们一起让它烧着。",
 "Sorry. Sorry. Pressure's too high to stop. Again?":"对不起。对不起。压力太高，停不下来。再来？",
 "Halcyon's drills are boring through Nami's water, and every screen says the Sky's Nyra led them. Nyra was Maren's patient, kept in a tank. Nami doesn't believe a word of it.":"哈尔西恩的钻机正钻穿奈美的水域，每一块屏幕都说是天空城的妮拉领它们来的。妮拉曾是玛伦的病人，被养在一个水箱里。奈美一个字也不信。",
 "Fight the drill crews as the Line rises":"溺亡线涨起时迎战钻机工人",
 "The night of the Strings Cut. Every screen in Deepline shows the Sky's Nyra waving Halcyon's drills into the Drowned Line.":"丝线斩断之夜。深线的每一块屏幕上，都是天空城的妮拉挥手把哈尔西恩的钻机引进溺亡线。",
 "Every screen in the Sky shows Deepline's Kael gassing its labs. Each layer blames the other, and the Director smiles at both.":"天空城的每一块屏幕上，都是深线的凯尔用毒气熏他们的实验室。每一层都在指责另一层，而总监对两边都微笑。",
 "Nyra? Maren kept that girl alive in a Halcyon tank. She'd never lead drills into anyone's home.":"妮拉？玛伦在哈尔西恩的水箱里让那个女孩活了下来。她绝不会把钻机带进任何人的家。",
 "Drills are drinking the Line, Nami. Halcyon's coolant after all. Run the pumps backwards and the whole Line comes up.":"钻机在喝溺亡线的水，奈美。到头来还是给哈尔西恩当冷却液。把泵倒着开，整条溺亡线就会涨上来。",
 "Then run them backwards. The Line has waited a long time to stand up.":"那就倒着开。溺亡线等着站起来，已经等很久了。",
 "The Drowned Line rises out of the dark, thick with turning fins, and closes over Halcyon's drills. They do not come back up.":"溺亡线从黑暗中升起，满是盘旋的鱼鳍，淹没了哈尔西恩的钻机。它们再也没有浮上来。",
 "The sea gave me back. It doesn't give drills back.":"大海把我还了回来。它可不还钻机。",
 "In the Pit, Pell hangs in his own Cradle and names his faceless spy: Rue. She wore both faces. The war was a puppet show.":"在深坑，佩尔吊在自己的翻花绳里，说出了他那无脸间谍的名字：露。两张脸都是她戴的。这场战争是一出木偶戏。",
 "Kiri's crane flies the name to the Crater. Above and below, the other layers rose tonight too. Four banners start up the Spire.":"基里的纸鹤把这个名字飞送到陨坑。上上下下，其他各层今晚也都起来了。四面旗帜开始攀上尖塔。",
 "Something at the Engine Core pulls, like a tide with no moon. We go up. I go dripping.":"引擎核心那里有个东西在拉扯，像一场没有月亮的潮汐。我们上去。我浑身滴着水上去。"
});
